5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98#fastapi-异步并发执行机制深度剖析","content":"**`async def`（异步函数）**：运行在主线程的 `asyncio` 事件循环中，必须配合非阻塞库（如 `httpx`、`aiofiles`、`asyncio.sleep`）。遇到 `await` 时自动让出 CPU 控制权支撑万级并发。"},"179":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-7","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98#fastapi-异步并发执行机制深度剖析","content":"**`def`（同步函数）**：FastAPI 自动将其派遣到外部线程池（`ThreadPoolExecutor`）执行，避免阻塞主事件循环。"},"180":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-8","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98#fastapi-异步并发执行机制深度剖析","content":"切勿在 `async def` 中调用同步阻塞代码（如 `time.sleep(5)` 或 `requests.get`），否则会导致整个主线程的事件循环被完全卡死！"},"181":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98-9","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi/08-%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98#流式传输-json-lines-stream-json-lines","content":"FastAPI 官方文档展示了通过 `StreamingResponse` 逐行推送 **JSON Lines (`.jsonl`)** 数据流的模式："},"182":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","FastAPI"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/fastapi"},"183":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/fastapi#官方资料","content":"官方资料"},"184":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/fastapi#学习资源","content":"学习资源"},"185":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-2","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"FastAPI 是一个现代、快速（高性能）的 Python Web 框架，基于标准的 Python 类型提示（Type Hints），底层由 **Starlette**（负责高性能 ASGI 异步核心）和 **Pydantic**（负责数据验证与序列化）强力驱动。在现代人工智能（AI）、大语言模型（LLM）微服务、智能体（Agent）开发领域，FastAPI 已成为事实上的行业标准开发框架。"},"186":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-3","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"快速入门与核心概念\" href=\"/docs/ai/fastapi/01-快速入门与核心概念\" description=\"环境配置、类型提示、首个应用与 OpenAPI 规范\" />"},"187":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-4","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"请求参数与 Pydantic 模型\" href=\"/docs/ai/fastapi/02-请求参数与Pydantic模型\" description=\"路径/查询/请求体/校验器/表单与上传\" />"},"188":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-5","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"响应处理与状态码\" href=\"/docs/ai/fastapi/03-响应处理与状态码\" description=\"响应模型、状态码、自定义响应与流式输出\" />"},"189":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-6","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"依赖注入系统\" href=\"/docs/ai/fastapi/04-依赖注入系统\" description=\"Depends、子依赖、yield 资源释放与 JWT 认证\" />"},"190":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-7","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"SQL关系型数据库与ORM实战\" href=\"/docs/ai/fastapi/05-SQL关系型数据库与ORM实战\" description=\"官方分层结构、SQLAlchemy、一对多关联、SQLModel 与 Alembic\" />"},"191":{"id":"/docs/ai/fastapi-8","page_id":"/docs/ai/fastapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/fastapi","content":"<Card title=\"中间件与生命周期与异常\" href=\"/docs