terview/multi-agent","type":"page","content":"Agent / 多智能体系统","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","Agent 与多智能体"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent"},"211":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么拆成多个-agent","content":"为什么拆成多个 Agent"},"212":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#多智能体架构如何设计","content":"多智能体架构如何设计"},"213":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-2","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"子智能体划分的原则"},"214":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-3","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#主智能体与子智能体协作与通信","content":"主智能体与子智能体协作与通信"},"215":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-4","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"A2A 协议与 MCP 的区别"},"216":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-5","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"为什么不用 MCP 统一所有能力？"},"217":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-6","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#生产落地的最佳组合","content":"生产落地的最佳组合"},"218":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-7","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"ReAct / Planning / Reflection / Self-Reflection"},"219":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-8","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#了解哪些-agent-框架它们各自的优劣","content":"了解哪些 Agent 框架？它们各自的优劣？"},"220":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-9","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#mcp-的可扩展性体现在哪里-什么场景适合封装mcp","content":"MCP 的可扩展性体现在哪里? 什么场景适合封装MCP?"},"221":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-10","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么拆成多个-agent","content":"| 瓶颈        | 问题                                                            | 拆分后解决的问题             |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| Prompt 膨胀 | 单 Agent 处理所有场景导致 System Prompt 臃肿，模型注意力分散（Lost in the Middle） | 每个 Agent 只含几百字的聚焦提示词 |","table":"table-0"},"222":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-11","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么拆成多个-agent","content":"| 瓶颈     | 问题                       | 拆分后解决的问题               |\n| ------ | ------------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| 工具选择幻觉 | 面对数十个工具时，选择正确工具的准确率指数级下降 | 每个 Agent 仅绑定 3-5 个专属工具 |","table":"table-0"},"223":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-12","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么拆成多个-agent","content":"| 瓶颈      | 问题                             | 拆分后解决的问题            |\n| ------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 模型适配不匹配 | 不同阶段对模型能力要求不同（规划需强推理，分类只需轻量模型） | 每个 Agent 独立选最优性价比模型 |","table":"table-0"},"224":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-13","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么拆成多个-agent","content":"| 瓶颈    | 问题                            | 拆分后解决的问题         |\n| ----- | ----------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| 工程不可控 | 微调一个 Prompt 产生\"蝴蝶效应\"，破坏其他任务表现 | 类似微服务，独立开发、测试、调优 |","table":"table-0"},"225":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-14","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#多智能体架构如何设计","content":"| 模式   | 设计                                                         | 试用场景         |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| 路由模式 | 主 Agent 或分类器接收用户输入，分析意图，然后决定将任务分发给某一个特定的专业 Agent。任务完成后直接返回 | 智能客服、多功能个人助理 |","table":"table-1"},"226":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-15","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#多智能体架构如何设计","content":"| 模式       | 设计                                                                   | 试用场景    |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| 编排/流水线模式 | 类似于工厂的流水线（SOP）。一个 Agent 的输出作为下一个 Agent 的输入。通常结合确定性代码（如状态机/工作流引擎）进行编排 | 代码生成与测试 |","table":"table-1"},"227":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-16","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#多智能体架构如何设计","content":"| 模式   | 设计                                                                   | 试用场景          |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| 层级模式 | 由一个 Supervisor Agent 负责拆解任务、分发子任务给多个 Worker Agents，并汇总他们的结果进行审核和最终输出 | 研究报告撰写、复杂数据分析 |","table":"table-1"},"228":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-17","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"设计多智能体系统时，将复杂任务合理拆分并分配给不同的子智能体是架构成败的关键。通常遵循以下五个黄金划分原则："},"229":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-18","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**按单一职责原则划分 (Single Responsibility Principle, SRP)**："},"230":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-19","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**逻辑**：一个 Agent 应该且仅有一个引起它变化的原因（专注于做一类事情）。"},"231":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-20","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**示例**：在电商客服系统中，不要让一个 Agent 既处理退款、又回答商品参数、还去查物流。应拆分为：`退款处理 Agent`、`商品导购 Agent` 和 `物流查询 Agent`。"},"232":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-21","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**按工具调用限制划分 (Tool-driven Boundary)**："},"233":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-22","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**逻辑**：大模型能熟练使用的工具数量是有限的（通常建议单 Agent 绑定工具不超过 5 个）。"},"234":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-23","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**示例**：如果某个任务需要 15 个外部 API（数据库读写、外部搜索、邮件发送等），应按照工具的使用边界将 Agent 拆分为 3-4 个。专门负责敏感操作（如付款或数据库修改）的 Agent 应该独立出来，便于精细化控制权限和安全审计。"},"235":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-24","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**按业务阶段/SOP 划分 (Stage-based / Pipeline Partitioning)**："},"236":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-25","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**逻辑**：沿用企业内成熟的工业标准作业程序（SOP），将线性流转的每个关键节点设计为独立的 Agent。"},"237":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-26","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**示例**：软件开发团队工作流：`需求分析 Agent -> 架构设计 Agent -> 代码编写 Agent -> 代码审查 Agent`。"},"238":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-27","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**按模型能力与成本要求划分 (Model-to-Cost Boundary)**："},"239":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-28","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**逻辑**：任务的难度不同，对模型推理能力的依赖也不同。将简单任务与复杂任务剥离，分派给不同能力的模型。"},"240":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-29","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**示例**："},"241":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-30","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**复杂/高难度任务**（算法推理、架构规划、最终输出审查）：交给强推理模型（如 Claude 3.5 Sonnet 或 GPT-4o）。"},"242":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-31","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**简单/高频任务**（数据分类、格式提取、文本翻译）：交给轻量快速模型（如 GPT-4o-mini 或 Gemini Flash）。"},"243":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-32","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**按上下文与状态独立性划分 (Context Independence)**："},"244":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-33","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**逻辑**：如果某些子任务不需要知道主任务的完整历史上下文，就可以将其剥离为独立的子 Agent，甚至可以并行运行。"},"245":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-34","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#子智能体划分的原则","content":"**示例**：在撰写一份大型行业报告时，可以把“收集互联网各领域数据”的任务分发给 5 个独立的 **数据搜集子 Agent**，它们各自在极小的上下文中运行，收集完后由 **汇总 Agent** 整合。"},"246":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-35","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"A2A 与 MCP 并不是竞争关系，而是 **互补的上下层关系**：A2A 解决横向的 Agent 协同，MCP 解决纵向的模型与外部资源对接。"},"247":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-36","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**A2A（Agent-to-Agent Protocol）**："},"248":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-37","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**发起方**：Google Cloud 及其生态伙伴（Linux 基金会托管）。"},"249":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-38","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**定位**：智能体之间互相发现、建立信任、协作的 **横向（Lateral）开放标准**。"},"250":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-39","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**核心理念**：`Agent A ── A2A ── Agent B`，解决的是 Agent 怎么和另一个 Agent 对话。"},"251":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-40","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**形象比喻**：两个独立部门的经理之间谈商务合作、任务委托。"},"252":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-41","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**MCP（Model Context Protocol）**："},"253":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-42","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**发起方**：Anthropic 主导，开源社区快速采纳。"},"254":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-43","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**定位**：LLM 与外部工具、数据源之间的 **纵向（Vertical）通用接口层**。"},"255":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-44","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**核心理念**：`LLM → MCP → 工具 / 数据源 / 外部系统`，解决的是模型怎么调用外部能力。"},"256":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-45","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**形象比喻**：经理（Model）打开自己的工具箱（Tools）或查阅本地数据库（Data）。"},"257":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-46","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"MCP 支持两种传输协议：`HTTP`(SSE/Streamable) `STDIO`(标准输入输出)"},"258":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-47","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**STDIO**: Client 把 MCP Server 当作子进程启动，通过 stdin 发 JSON-RPC 请求，从 stdout 读响应。"},"259":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-48","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"适用场景：本地工具、命令行工具、桌面应用"},"260":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-49","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**HTTP**：Client 通过 HTTP POST 发送 JSON-RPC 请求，Server 通过 SSE（Server-Sent Events） 或 HTTP 响应返回结果。"},"261":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-50","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"适用场景：远程服务、云端部署、多客户端共享、Web 环境"},"262":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-51","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**封装与配置**："},"263":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-52","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**连接**："},"264":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-53","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"**连接**："},"265":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-54","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"多维度对比表"},"266":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-55","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent)     | MCP (Model Context Protocol) |\n| -------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| **协作维度** | 横向：Agent 与 Agent 之间的对等协作 | 纵向：模型与工具、数据源的接入              |","table":"table-2"},"267":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-56","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent) | MCP (Model Context Protocol) |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **网络拓扑** | 去中心化、Peer-to-Peer    | 中心化、Client-Host-Server       |","table":"table-2"},"268":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-57","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent)           | MCP (Model Context Protocol)        |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| **通信协议** | 标准 HTTPS/REST，异步 Webhook 或 SSE | JSON-RPC 2.0，通过 STDIO 或 HTTP/SSE 传输 |","table":"table-2"},"269":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-58","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent)                               | MCP (Model Context Protocol)               |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **能力描述** | **Agent Card**（`.well-known/agent.json`，声明服务端点与能力） | **Tools / Resources / Prompts**（三位一体的标准接口） |","table":"table-2"},"270":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-59","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent) | MCP (Model Context Protocol) |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **主要能力** | 发现、鉴权、任务委托、多角色协商     | 调用工具、读取资源、注入提示词              |","table":"table-2"},"271":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-60","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#a2a-协议与-mcp-的区别","content":"| 维度       | A2A (Agent-to-Agent) | MCP (Model Context Protocol) |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| **典型场景** | 跨企业、跨框架的 Agent 协同    | 单个 Agent 内部对接数据库、文件系统、API    |","table":"table-2"},"272":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-61","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"“既然 MCP 能让大模型调用工具，为什么不把每个 Agent 包装成 MCP Tool，用 MCP 统一多 Agent 系统？” 主要原因有三点："},"273":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-62","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"**自治性差异**："},"274":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-63","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"MCP Tool 是 **无状态、被动的**，遵循 “调用 → 执行 → 返回” 的单向链路，不具备自主决策能力。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-64","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"Agent 是 **有状态、主动的**，拥有独立目标、长短期记忆、Reflection 与 ReAct 循环，可以主动决定是否调用其他 Agent。"},"276":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-65","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"**协作维度差异**："},"277":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-66","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"MCP 是 **点对点的资源访问通道**，缺乏管理多 Agent 会话流转、多向广播、状态图拓扑的顶层设计。"},"278":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-67","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"A2A 天然支持多角色协商、任务委托（Delegation）、SOP 状态机维护等横向协作能力。"},"279":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-68","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"**上下文爆炸风险**："},"280":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-69","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"若用 MCP 暴露所有 Agent 的底层工具，全部工具 Schema 会被拼进 LLM 上下文，瞬间造成 **上下文窗口饱和** 与注意力偏移。"},"281":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-70","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#为什么不用-mcp-统一所有能力","content":"A2A 通过 Agent Card 提供 **高维能力抽象**（只暴露 Agent 的输入输出契约，不暴露底层工具），实现高级别路由寻址。"},"282":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-71","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#生产落地的最佳组合","content":"工业界最科学的架构是 **A2A + MCP 的分层组合**："},"283":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-72","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#生产落地的最佳组合","content":"**A2A 层**：负责上层 Agent 间的能力发现、任务分发与协作谈判。"},"284":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-73","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#生产落地的最佳组合","content":"**MCP 层**：负责单个 Agent 内部与具体数据库、文件系统、物理工具的本地通信。"},"285":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-74","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#生产落地的最佳组合","content":"**A2A 管 Agent 之间怎么合作，MCP 管 Agent 内部怎么用工具。** 前者是“经理开会”，后者是“经理用工具箱”。"},"286":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-75","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**论文**：ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models"},"287":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-76","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**核心思想**：把 Chain-of-Thought（连续推理）和 Tool Use（工具调用）交替编织，形成 `思考 → 行动 → 观察 → 思考 → ...` 的循环。"},"288":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-77","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**执行轨迹**："},"289":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-78","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**关键特征**:"},"290":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-79","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"每步都产出 Thought——让模型显式地\"说出它在想什么\""},"291":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-80","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"每步都执行 Action——调用真实工具，拿到真实反馈"},"292":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-81","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"Observation 是工具返回——作为下一步 Thought 的输入"},"293":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-82","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"没有全局规划——走到哪算哪，可能绕弯路"},"294":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-83","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**核心思想**：先规划，在后执行。Agent 拿到任务后，不急着动手，而是先生成一个完整的执行计划，然后再按计划逐步执行。"},"295":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-84","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**执行流程**："},"296":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-85","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**Plan 的三种常见形态**："},"297":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-86","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**论文**："},"298":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-87","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"Reflexion: Language Agents with Verbal Reinforcement Learning（Shinn et al., 2023）"},"299":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-88","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"Self-Refine: Iterative Refinement with Self-Feedback（Madaan et al., 2023）"},"300":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-89","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"Reflection Agents（LangChain Blog）"},"301":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-90","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**核心思想**：Agent 完成一轮任务后，自己扮演**批评者**审查自己的输出，发现问题后迭代改进。"},"302":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-91","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"> 输出层面的自我修正，不是决策层面的修路。"},"303":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-92","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**执行循环**："},"304":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-93","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"**Reflexion vs Self-Refine 的区别**："},"305":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-94","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度   | Self-Refine (Madaan) | Reflexion (Shinn) |\n| ---- | -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| 反馈来源 | 同一个 Agent 自己评价       | 外部环境 / evaluator  |","table":"table-3"},"306":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-95","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | Self-Refine (Madaan) | Reflexion (Shinn)  |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 记忆  | 无持久记忆                | 持久化反思记忆（跨 episode） |","table":"table-3"},"307":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-96","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度   | Self-Refine (Madaan) | Reflexion (Shinn) |\n| ---- | -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 文本质量提升               | 任务成功/失败后的策略改进     |","table":"table-3"},"308":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-97","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | Self-Refine (Madaan) | Reflexion (Shinn) |\n| --- | -------------------- | ----------------- |\n| 风格  | \"再改改这一句\"             | \"上次失败了，下次换个策略\"    |","table":"table-3"},"309":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-98","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | ReAct | Planning | Reflection |\n| --- | ----- | -------- | ---------- |\n| 时机  | 执行中   | 执行前      | 执行后        |","table":"table-4"},"310":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-99","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | ReAct | Planning | Reflection |\n| --- | ----- | -------- | ---------- |\n| 作用域 | 单步    | 全局任务     | 单个 / 全局输出  |","table":"table-4"},"311":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-100","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | ReAct      | Planning   | Reflection      |\n| --- | ---------- | ---------- | --------------- |\n| 输出  | 下一个 Action | Plan（步骤列表） | Critique + 修改建议 |","table":"table-4"},"312":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-101","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | ReAct              | Planning            | Reflection               |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 循环  | Thought→Action→Obs | Plan→Execute→Replan | Generate→Critique→Refine |","table":"table-4"},"313":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-102","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度      | ReAct         | Planning    | Reflection |\n| ------- | ------------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| 解决的核心问题 | 工具调用与现实反馈如何衔接 | 复杂任务如何不遗漏步骤 | 输出质量如何自检   |","table":"table-4"},"314":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-103","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度  | ReAct        | Planning   | Reflection       |\n| --- | ------------ | ---------- | ---------------- |\n| 类比  | 开车时看导航走一步看一步 | 出门前看地图规划路线 | 到目的地后回头检查有没有漏带东西 |","table":"table-4"},"315":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-104","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#react--planning--reflection--self-reflection","content":"| 维度   | ReAct                        | Planning                    | Reflection            |\n| ---- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 代表实现 | LangChain ReAct Agent、CrewAI | Plan & Execute、CrewAI Flows | Reflexion、Self-Refine |","table":"table-4"},"316":{"id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent-105","page_id":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/interview/multi-agent#mcp-的可扩展性体现在哪里-什么场景适合封装mcp","content":"**水平扩展**：一个 Client 接 N 个 Server\n**垂直扩展**：一个 Server 暴露 N 个工具\n**传输扩展**：STDIO / HTTP\n**生态扩展**：社区 Server 直接拿来用"},"317":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","type":"page","content":"架构体系","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","LangChain"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic"},"318":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"什么是 Agent"},"319":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","content":"LangChain 并不仅仅是一个框架，而是一整个智能体开发平台，包含很多不同的组件。"},"320":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-2","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","content":"其中，包含一系列开源的智能体（Agent）开发框架，而且兼容 Python 和 TypeScript 两种语言："},"321":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-3","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","content":"**LangChain**：用于快速构建智能体，可兼容任何模型提供商\n**LangGraph**：从底层一步步控制智能体的构建，包括记忆（Memory）、人机协同（HITL）等\n**Deep Agents**：用于构建复杂的、处理多步骤的任务的智能体"},"322":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-4","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","content":"另外，LangChain 还包含一套帮助人工智能团队利用实时生产数据进行**持续测试和改进**的平台，叫做 LangSmith："},"323":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-5","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"在人工智能领域，Agent是指一种能够**感知环境、进行推理、自主决策**并采取行动以实现特定目标的**智能系统**。"},"324":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-6","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"| 特性   | 传统聊天机器人/LLM | AI Agent    |\n| ---- | ----------- | ----------- |\n| 交互模式 | 被动响应，问一句答一句 | 主动规划，以目标为导向 |","table":"table-0"},"325":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-7","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"| 特性  | 传统聊天机器人/LLM | AI Agent        |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------- |\n| 执行力 | 停留在文本生成层面   | 能操作软件、发送邮件、分析数据 |","table":"table-0"},"326":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-8","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"| 特性  | 传统聊天机器人/LLM | AI Agent        |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------- |\n| 自主性 | 需要人类给出详细步骤  | 只需给定最终目标，自主寻找路径 |","table":"table-0"},"327":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-9","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"> 如果说大模型（LLM）是“大脑”，那么 Agent 就是“拥有手脚和思维逻辑的独立个体”。它不再只是被动地回答问题，而是能主动拆解任务并调用各种工具来完成工作。"},"328":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic-10","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/basic#什么是-agent","content":"当然，Agent的模式也是在不断演进的：\n\\- **阶段一**：ReAct + Tool Calling\n\\- **阶段二**：Reflection + Long Memory\n\\- **阶段三**：Multi Agent System，MAS"},"329":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"page","content":"核心组件","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","LangChain"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component"},"330":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"Agent"},"331":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"332":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-2","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#models","content":"Models"},"333":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-3","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#初始化模型","content":"初始化模型"},"334":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-4","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#init_chat_model","content":"init_chat_model"},"335":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-5","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#使用model类","content":"使用Model类"},"336":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-6","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#访问模型","content":"访问模型"},"337":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-7","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#invoke-阻塞式访问","