ain/core_component#存储架构","content":"存储架构"},"388":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-58","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基础-api-使用","content":"基础 API 使用"},"389":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-59","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"put / get"},"390":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-60","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#search","content":"search"},"391":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-61","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#在-agent-中访问","content":"在 Agent 中访问"},"392":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-62","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#工具中使用","content":"工具中使用"},"393":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-63","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"中间件中使用"},"394":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-64","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"**代码示例**："},"395":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-65","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"> 基本步骤: `1.加载环境变量 -> 2.定义工具 -> 3.定义Agent -> 4.调用Agent`"},"396":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-66","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"Langchain 提供了 `create_agent` 方法用来快速创建 Agent，我们只需要提供好 Agent 所需的模型（Models）、工具（Tools）即可。"},"397":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-67","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"大模型提供的 API 接口中，有一个 tools 参数，描述了工具的详细信息："},"398":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-68","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"所以，LangChain 会帮助我们把 tool 的信息封装为此 tool 参数，与 message 一起发送给大模型，大模型就了解 tool 的详细信息，根据用户需求判断是否需要调用 tool，需要调用哪个 tool。"},"399":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-69","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"模型不能直接调用 tool，只能返回字符串。但是它可以把要调用的 tool信息、参数信息都以 Json 格式返回："},"400":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-70","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"这样一来，LangChain 就会帮我们解析响应结果中的 Function 信息，也就是 tool 信息，就知道了要调用哪个函数，以及参数是什么了。LangChain 就会执行该函数，再把得到的结果再次发送给大模型。"},"401":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-71","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#agent","content":"具体的工作流程如图："},"402":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-72","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#常见问题","content":"展开查看"},"403":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-73","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#models","content":"这里说的模型，完整叫法是大语言模型（LLM）。它能够理解人类语言，使用人类语言生成内容、翻译、提取摘要、回答问题等。\n不仅如此，现在大多数的模型还有一些特别能力：\n（1）Tool calling - 调用外部工具（例如查询数据库或调用 API），并在其回复中使用这些工具返回的结果。\n（2）Structured output - 将模型的响应结果约束为遵循已定义的格式，例如：json\n（3）Multimodality - 可以处理和返回文本以外的数据，如图像、音频和视频。\n（4）Reasoning - 模型可以执行多步推理来得出结论。"},"404":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-74","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#models","content":"可以说 LLM 就是 Agent 的大脑，是 Agent 的推理引擎。它驱动 Agent 做出每个决定：何时调用工具、调用哪个工具、如何解释结果，以及何时提供最终答案。"},"405":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-75","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#models","content":"LangChain 支持现在市面上大部分的大语言模型（LLM），并且提供了统一的模型调用接口。使您可以轻松访问许多不同的模型提供者，并且在模型之间进行试验和切换也变得很容易。"},"406":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-76","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#init_chat_model","content":"采用`init_chat_model`自动初始化模型时，模型的类型由 LangChain 通过模型名称自动推断。如果要切换其它模型，我们只需要安装其他模型依赖，然后配置 API_KEY 改变模型名称即可，其他的代码都不用。"},"407":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-77","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#init_chat_model","content":"`init_chat_model`默认会根据模型名称自动确定模型的提供者、其 base_url，并从 env 读取 api_key ，但前提是必须是 langchain 支持的模型提供者。如果是其他不支持的模型，我们必须自定义模型参数来访问。"},"408":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-78","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#init_chat_model","content":"可见，通过参数自定义模型时，模型的类型由 model_provider 参数类决定。"},"409":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-79","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#init_chat_model","content":"除了修改模型提供者以外，`init_chat_model`方法允许我们调整模型参数，例如：\n`temperature`: 控制生成文本的随机性，值越小越确定，值越大越随机\n`max_tokens`: 控制生成文本的最大长度\n`top_p`: 控制生成文本的多样性，值越小越多样，值越大越确定\n`timeout`: 控制生成文本的超时时间\n`max_retries`: 控制生成文本的最大重试次数"},"410":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-80","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#使用model类","content":"init_chat_model 方法底层就是帮我们利用 Model 类创建对象。但只支持有限的模型，而在其社区，除了官方提供的Model，还有一些类是社区提供。具体支持的模型，可以查看官网。"},"411":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-81","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#使用model类","content":"例如使用社区版本的 Model 类来访问阿里云百炼的通义千问模型：\n（1）安装依赖"},"412":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-82","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#使用model类","content":"（2）使用"},"413":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-83","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#invoke-阻塞式访问","content":"invoke 方法是阻塞式调用，需要等待模型生成全部结果才会返回，等待时间较长。"},"414":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-84","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#stream-流式访问","content":"流式调用可以实时看到AI返回的一个个词。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-85","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#stream-流式访问","content":"除了上面的两种访问方式还有 `batch()` 方法，以及它们的异步版本`ainvoke()`、`astream()`、`abatch()`：\n&#8195;`batch()`：批量处理多个输入高并发场景，需要同时处理大量请求\n&#8195;`astream()`：非阻塞式，提高系统吞吐量高并发 Web 应用、IO 密集型任务\n&#8195;`ainvoke()`：非阻塞式，提高系统吞吐量高并发 Web 应用、IO 密集型任务\n&#8195;`abatch()`：非阻塞式，提高系统吞吐量高并发 Web 应用、IO 密集型任务"},"416":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-86","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#批量调用","content":"`batch()` 特点是等待所有请求处理完毕，按原始输入顺序返回结果列表。当输入列表很大或单个模型调用耗时差异显著时，`batch_as_completed()` 允许应用收到第一个结果后立即返回，而不会等待批次内所有任务完成才响应。即`batch_as_completed()`每个请求完成后立即 `yield`结果，结果可能乱序。"},"417":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-87","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#批量调用","content":"但是每个返回的响应都被放在一个元组中，元组的第一个元素是原始输入的 index 索引，可根据索引重新排序。"},"418":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-88","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#异步调用","content":"**同步（sync）**：\n&#8195;概念：发起一个任务之后，需要**等待该任务完成后**，才能继续执行后续任务\n&#8195;表现：当前执行流**会被阻塞**\n**异步（async）**：\n&#8195;概念：发起一个任务之后，**不必等该任务完成**，就可以继续执行其他任务\n&#8195;表现：当前执行流**不会被阻塞**\n&#8195;备注：虽然不必等待任务完成，但任务完成后，仍然可以通过特定方式获取结果"},"419":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-89","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#异步调用","content":"在 LangChain 框架中，异步方法与它们的同步版本相比，具备如下特点：\n（1）避免阻塞主线程：同步调用会阻塞程序执行，而异步方法让应用程序在等待 API 响应时保持响应性\n（2）优化资源利用：异步操作可以更高效地利用系统资源，减少空闲等待时间"},"420":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-90","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#如何处理api调用失败","content":"使用 `try-except` 块捕获异常："},"421":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-91","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#创建智能体","content":"**创建智能体，指定模型名，由 Langchain 初始化模型**："},"422":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-92","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#创建智能体","content":"**创建智能体，并使用创建好的 model**："},"423":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-93","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#调用智能体","content":"**阻塞式调用**："},"424":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-94","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#调用智能体","content":"**流式调用**："},"425":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-95","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#调用智能体","content":"Agent 的 stream 模式同样返回一个 generator，但是其结构由`stream_mode`参数决定：\n① `messages`: 返回LLM生成的每一个片段，是一个包含token和metadata的元组（Tuple）\n② `updates`: 返回Agent运行过程中的每一次事件，例如与LLM的对话、工具的调用等\n③ `custom`: 返回通过 stream writer 记录的每一次自定义的输出"},"426":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-96","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#messages","content":"消息是 LangChain 中模型上下文的基本单位。它们代表模型的输入和输出，承载了与大语言模型交互时所需的对话状态内容及元数据。消息是包含以下内容的对象：\n（1）**Role**：角色，用于标识消息类型，例如：system、user\n（2）**Content**：内容，表示消息的实际内容，例如：文本、图片、音频等\n（3）**Metadata**：元数据，可选字段，例如：响应信息、消息ID和令牌使用情况"},"427":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-97","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"在 LangChain 中，我们并不需要自己创建 BaseMessage 对象，LangChain 已经把常见消息根据角色（Role）创建了对应的 BaseMessage 的子类：\n（1）**System message**：role 是 system，代表系统消息，用于设定模型角色和交互背景\n（2）**Human message**：role 是 user，代表用户输入的消息\n（3）**AI message**：role 是 assistant，代表 LLM 生成的响应，包含：文本、工具调用、元数据\n（4）**Tool message**：role 是 tool，代表工具调用时产生的结果"},"428":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-98","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"**AI message**：表示模型调用的输出结果，其中可能包含多模态数据、工具调用以及可后续访问的提供商特定元数据。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-99","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"属性"},"430":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-100","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"（1）**Tool calls**"},"431":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-101","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"（2）**Token usage**"},"432":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-102","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"**Tool message**：对于支持工具调用的模型，AI消息可以包含工具调用。工具消息用于将单次工具执行的结果返回给模型。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-103","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#消息类型","content":"属性"},"434":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-104","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#多模态消息","content":"前面的消息指的是文本消息，多模态指的是处理以不同形式存在的数据的能力，例如文本、音频、图像和视频。LangChain 包含了这些数据的通用类型，可在不同服务提供商之间使用。聊天模型可以接受多模态数据作为输入，并将其作为输出生成。**前提是必须是多模态模型才支持。**"},"435":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-105","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#提示词","content":"发送给大模型的所有消息都可以称为提示词（Prompt），它直接影响模型的输出结果。其中，SystemMessage 尤为重要，我们把SystemMessage 称为**系统提示词（System Prompt）**，它可以给模型设定角色和本次聊天的背景，对模型生成的内容有很大的影响。"},"436":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-106","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#系统提示词","content":"> 如果没有设定系统提示词，模型会按照训练中的自我认知来回答。"},"437":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-107","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#提示词工程","content":"通过优化 System Prompt 从而让模型输出更理想的结果的这一过程，我们称为提示词工程（Prompt Engineering）。"},"438":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-108","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#提示词工程","content":"从**内容**来说，提示词通常包含以下几个部分，通常按此顺序排列：\n（1） 身份（Identity）：描述AI的职责、沟通风格和总体目标。\n（2） 说明（Instructions）：请指导模型如何生成所需的响应。它应该遵循哪些规则？模型应该做什么，以及模型绝对不能做什么？\n（3） 示例（Examples）：提供可能的输入示例，以及模型期望的输出。\n（4） 背景信息（Context）：向模型提供生成响应所需的任何额外信息，例如RAG的额外知识库数据，或您认为特别相关的任何其他数据。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-109","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#提示词工程","content":"从**格式**来说，在编写 System Prompt 时，您可以使用 Markdown 格式和 XML 标签的组合来帮助模型理解提示和上下文数据的逻辑边界。\n（1） Markdown 的标题和列表有助于标记提示的不同部分，并向模型传达层级结构。它们还可以提高开发过程中提示的可读性。\n（2） XML 标签可以帮助明确区分一段内容（例如用作参考的辅助文档、对话示例等）的起始和结束位置。"},"440":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-110","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#提示词工程","content":"示例"},"441":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-111","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#设定角色和详细指令","content":"**角色**：可以帮助模型认清自己的身份，以对应的身份来回答问题。\n**指令**：告诉模型需要遵循哪些规则，应该做什么，不应该做什么。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-112","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#设定角色和详细指令","content":"示例"},"443":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-113","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#few-shot-examples","content":"有时候希望模型按照固定的风格来回答问题，但是这种分割不太好描述，哪儿此时就可以通过举例的方式让模型学习例子来回答。用户只需在输入提示中提供几个输入-输出示例，模型就能理解任务模式并生成符合预期的输出。"},"444":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-114","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#few-shot-examples","content":"示例"},"445":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-115","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"由于传统程序识别结果化的数据会更加方便，所以有时候希望 LLM 也能输出固定结构的内容，方便我们解析，这种同样可以通过提示词来实现。"},"446":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-116","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"示例"},"447":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-117","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"在 LangChain 中，实现结构化输出我们只需设定好一个数据类型就可以实现结构化输出。"},"448":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-118","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"示例"},"449":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-119","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"并非所有模型都支持 response_format 参数（结构化输出）"},"450":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-120","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"但是可以修改结构化输出的策略来满足：`ProviderStrategy` `ToolStrategy`，前者是模型提供商的原生结构化输出，后者是工具调用的方式实现"},"451":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-121","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#结构化输出","content":"> 此种情况下，提示词还是需要注明需要写明 JSON 输出，并且字段写清楚，不然可能出现的字段不全依旧报错"},"452":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-122","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#tools","content":"一个完整的 Agent 至少要包含两个关键的部分：\n**模型**：大脑，负责推理、分析、规划任务步骤\n**工具**：手脚，负责执行，与外界交互"},"453":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-123","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"定义一个带有工具的 Agent 分为两步："},"454":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-124","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"① 使用 tool 装饰器定义工具"},"455":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-125","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"② 定义 Agent，绑定工具"},"456":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-126","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"输出："},"457":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-127","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"流程图："},"458":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-128","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#基本用法","content":"所谓工具，本质就是一个**可调用的函数**，要想让 Agent 知道有哪些工具可调用，该如何调用这些工具，就必须把这些函数的详细信息发给模型，包括：**函数名、函数的作用、函数的参数和返回值信息**。所以，定义工具的时候，关键就是把这些信息描述清楚即可。"},"459":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-129","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"定义工具的过程在 LangChain 中被大大简化，与定义普通函数几乎没什么差别，只是在一些细节上需要注意。"},"460":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-130","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"（1）**首先，定义工具需要在函数上添加`@tool`装饰器**\n例如，我们定义一个计算平方根的数学工具："},"461":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-131","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"智能体在工作时，需要将函数的**名称、输入、作用**传递给大模型，默认情况下这些信息来源是：\n&#8195;工具名称：函数名\n&#8195;工具输入：函数入参\n&#8195;工作的作用：函数的注释"},"462":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-132","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"当然，上面的信息可以被 `@tool` 装饰器进行覆盖："},"463":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-133","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"**通过装饰器定义工具名称**："},"464":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-134","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"> `name_or_callable` 可以省略"},"465":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-135","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"**通过装饰器定义工具作用描述**："},"466":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-136","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"**通过装饰器定义工具入参约束**："},"467":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-137","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"如果要覆盖工具的入参信息比较复杂，就需要借助Pydantic或JSON约束"},"468":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-138","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"在 LangChain 中，作为工具的函数有两个保留的参数名，分别是`config`与`runtime`，前者用来传递运行时配置，后者用来传递运行时上下文，在自定义参数时不能与之重复。"},"469":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-139","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"具体可参考官方文档：保留参数名（Reserved argument names）"},"470":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-140","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"**细节问题**："},"471":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-141","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"> `@tool`会从 docstring 生成描述信息，同样要求遵循 Google docstring 规范。如果没有则会报错\n>\n> ```python :no-line-numbers\n> Traceback (most recent call last):\n> ...\n> ValueError: Function must have a docstring if description not provided.\n>\n> ```"},"472":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-142","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"补充 docstring"},"473":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-143","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"输出为:"},"474":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-144","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"`description`参数可以更改工具描述，优先级高于 docstring 的函数说明"},"475":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-145","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"输出："},"476":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-146","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"当我们没有向 @tool 传递 description 参数时，默认情况下， tool 会将 docstring 整体视为 description"},"477":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-147","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"输出："},"478":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-148","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"通过将 parse_docstring 设置为 True，docstring会被解析，填充到相应的字段描述中。"},"479":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-149","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"输出："},"480":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-150","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"（2）**把定义好的工具传递给 Agent**：模型就可以得到工具的信息，并根据情况判断是否要调用工具，调用哪个工具"},"481":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-151","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#自定义工具","content":"（3）**开始调用**"},"482":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-152","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#预定义工具","content":"LangChain 中提供了许多预定义好的工具，方便我们使用，可使用预定义工具列表可参考官网"},"483":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-153","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#预定义工具","content":"模型本身只能根据本身的训练数据回答问题，无法获取实时信息，但如果我们提供了 web 搜索的工具，那么 Agent 就如同具备了实时 web 搜索的能力，回答会更加准确。"},"484":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-154","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#预定义工具","content":"下面以 Tavily 为例："},"485":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-155","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#预定义工具","content":"> AI 回答包含信息来源"},"486":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-156","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#mcp-工具接入","content":"MCP（Model Context Protocol）是一种开放协议，标准化了应用程序向 LLM 提供工具和上下文的方式。LangChain Agent 可以通过 `langchain-mcp-adapters` 库使用 MCP Server 上的工具。"},"487":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-157","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#mcp-工具接入","content":"> 来源：LangChain MCP 文档"},"488":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-158","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#在-create_agent-中使用-mcp","content":"使用 `MultiServerMCPClient` 加载 MCP Server 上的工具，然后传入 `create_agent` 的 `tools=` 参数："},"489":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-159","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#传输协议","content":"MCP 支持两种传输机制："},"490":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-160","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#传输协议","content":"| 协议      | 说明                        | 适用场景      |\n| ------- | ------------------------- | --------- |\n| `stdio` | 客户端将服务器作为子进程启动，通过标准输入输出通信 | 本地工具、简单配置 |","table":"table-0"},"491":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-161","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#传输协议","content":"| 协议                      | 说明           | 适用场景  |\n| ----------------------- | ------------ | ----- |\n| `http`（streamable-http） | 通过 HTTP 请求通信 | 远程服务器 |","table":"table-0"