e` |\n| ----- | ------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 渐进式披露 | 手动控制                | 内置元数据→完整内容的两级加载    |","table":"table-2"},"531":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-201","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#两种方式的对比","content":"| 特性   | 自定义 `load_skill` 工具 | `SkillsMiddleware` |\n| ---- | ------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 适用场景 | 轻量、自定义 Skill        | 标准 Skill 目录结构      |","table":"table-2"},"532":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-202","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-的-harness-能力全景","content":"`create_agent` 是一个高度可扩展的 Harness，通过 `middleware=` 参数组合不同的中间件，可以实现与 Deep Agents 同等的全部能力。"},"533":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-203","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-的-harness-能力全景","content":"> 来源：LangChain `create_agent` Harness 配置"},"534":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-204","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-的-harness-能力全景","content":"官方将 Harness 能力分为六大类："},"535":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-205","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别     | 说明               | 中间件                                     |\n| -------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| **执行环境** | 工具、文件系统、沙箱、代码解释器 | `FilesystemMiddleware`、沙箱后端、QuickJS 解释器 |","table":"table-3"},"536":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-206","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别      | 说明                  | 中间件                                                             |\n| --------- | ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **上下文管理** | 摘要压缩、记忆、Skills、提示缓存 | `SummarizationMiddleware`、`MemoryMiddleware`、`SkillsMiddleware` |","table":"table-3"},"537":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-207","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别      | 说明           | 中间件                                       |\n| --------- | ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **规划与委派** | Todo 列表、子智能体 | `TodoListMiddleware`、`SubAgentMiddleware` |","table":"table-3"},"538":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-208","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别   | 说明         | 中间件           |\n| ------ | ---------- | ------------- |\n| **容错** | 重试、回退、调用限制 | 内置重试机制、自定义中间件 |","table":"table-3"},"539":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-209","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别   | 说明          | 中间件                      |\n| ------ | ----------- | ------------------------ |\n| **护栏** | PII 检测、内容控制 | `PiiDetectionMiddleware` |","table":"table-3"},"540":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-210","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#各能力对应的中间件官方示例","content":"| 能力类别     | 说明                   | 中间件                                                 |\n| -------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **人机协同** | Human-in-the-loop 审批 | `HumanInTheLoopMiddleware`（配置 `interrupt_on` 时自动添加） |","table":"table-3"},"541":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-211","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`      | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | ------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 定位   | 高度可定制的 Harness，极简核心 | 开箱即用的 Harness                     |","table":"table-4"},"542":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-212","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`               | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 文件系统 | 需手动添加 `FilesystemMiddleware` | 默认内置                              |","table":"table-4"},"543":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-213","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度   | `create_agent`           | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ------ | ------------------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| Skills | 需手动添加 `SkillsMiddleware` | 默认内置                              |","table":"table-4"},"544":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-214","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`           | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | ------------------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| 记忆   | 需手动添加 `MemoryMiddleware` | 默认内置                              |","table":"table-4"},"545":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-215","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`                  | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 摘要压缩 | 需手动添加 `SummarizationMiddleware` | 默认内置                              |","table":"table-4"},"546":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-216","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`             | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | -------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 子智能体 | 需手动添加 `SubAgentMiddleware` | 默认内置（`general-purpose`）           |","table":"table-4"},"547":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-217","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`      | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | ------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 人机协同 | 按需配置 `interrupt_on` | 按需配置 `interrupt_on`               |","table":"table-4"},"548":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-218","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度   | `create_agent`    | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ------ | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| MCP 支持 | ✅ 原生（`tools=` 传入） | ✅ 原生（`tools=` 传入）                 |","table":"table-4"},"549":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-219","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent` | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | -------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 灵活性  | 极高，按需组合        | 较高，通过参数微调                         |","table":"table-4"},"550":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-220","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"| 对比维度 | `create_agent`  | Deep Agents (`create_deep_agent`) |\n| ---- | --------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 需要精细控制 Agent 行为 | 快速搭建复杂多步骤任务                       |","table":"table-4"},"551":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-221","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#create_agent-vs-deep-agents","content":"> **总结**：Deep Agents 本质上就是 `create_deep_agent` 预装了一套默认中间件栈。如果你需要精细控制，使用 `create_agent` + 自定义中间件；如果想快速上手，使用 Deep Agents。两者都原生支持 MCP 工具接入。"},"552":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-222","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#记忆","content":"模型本事是没有记忆的，它记不住历史会话内容，我们可以通过技术手段，帮助模型记住会话历史，产生记忆。\n对于智能体而言，记忆分为两类：\n**短期记忆(Short-term memory)**：当前任务或会话的上下文\n**长期记忆(Long-term memory)**：跨任务或会话的经验与知识"},"553":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-223","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#short-term-memory","content":"由于短期记忆生命周期通常是当前会话，所以也被称为**会话记忆**。Agent 的会话记忆通常包含三部分：\n① 对话历史\n② 查询结果\n③ 任务状态"},"554":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-224","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#short-term-memory","content":"LangChain 提供了自动化的记忆管理方案：\n（1）LangChain 把会话记忆（Messages 列表）记录为 AgentState 的一部分\n（2）AgentState 通过 Checkpointer 对象来保存，每一次与AI的交互都会生成一个快照，记录为一个 checkpoint，把同一会话的所有 checkpoint 组合在一起，就是完整的会话历史了\n（3）为了区分不同的会话记忆，不同会话需要设定各自的`thread_id`，相同会话则使用相同`thread_id`\n（4）向 Agent 发起会话时必须指定自己的`thread_id`以唤起对应的会话记忆"},"555":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-225","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#inmemorysaver基于内存存储","content":"> 由于两次调用使用了相同的`thread_id`，被认定为是同一次对话，所以 LangChain 会在请求模型时携带历史对话的 Messages，模型就能根据历史消息来正确回答了"},"556":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-226","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#持久化-memory","content":"LangChain 也提供了很多持久化存储的 checkpointer，例如：\n**SqlLiteSaver** ：基于 sqlite 存储\n**PostgresSaver** ：基于 Postgres 存储\n**CosmosDBSaver** ：使用 Azure Cosmos DB 的实现\n具体可以参考文档：https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langgraph/persistence#checkpointer-libraries"},"557":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-227","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#持久化-memory","content":"**SqlLiteSaver 示例**："},"558":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-228","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#持久化-memory","content":"① 安装依赖"},"559":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-229","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#持久化-memory","content":"② 导入依赖并初始化"},"560":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-230","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#持久化-memory","content":"③ 创建 Agent，并设置 checkpointer"},"561":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-231","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#记忆管理策略","content":"由于会话记忆要保存会话的历史，并且在调用 LLM 时携带历史消息列表。而当会话越来越长时，历史消息就可能超过 LLM 的上下文限制。\n一旦会话历史超过上下文窗口，就会出现上下文丢失的情况，从而导致丢失记忆，而且即便不丢失，太长的上下文容易让模型出现**注意力分散**的问题，模型的响应速度、回答质量会大大降低。\n为了解决这种问题，通常有下面的手段：\n（1）**修剪消息**：移除前 N 条或者 N 条消息（在调用 LLM 之前）\n（2）**删除消息**：永久删除 LangGraph 状态中的消息\n（3）**总结消息**：总结历史记录中的早期消息，并用摘要替换他们\n（4）**自定义策略**：自定义策略。例如：消息筛选等"},"562":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-232","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#记忆管理策略","content":"> 具体参考官网：https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/short-term-memory#common-patterns"},"563":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-233","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#修剪消息","content":"修剪消息并不是真正的删除消息，在 AgentState 中的消息列表依然是完整的，只不过发送给 LLM 之前会进行修剪，只保留一部分消息。"},"564":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-234","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#删除消息","content":"删除消息与修剪消息不同：\n**修剪消息**：只是从 State 中选取一部分消息发送给模型\n**删除消息**：直接删除 State 中保存的消息，也就是说消息历史中不在存在"},"565":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-235","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"不管是修剪还是删除，都会导致一部分消息丢失，从未丢失记忆，所以就有了总结消息（Summarize messages）。"},"566":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-236","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"它的思路很简单就是把历史的消息利用大模型总结出摘要，然后把最新的消息拼接在一起作为新的消息列表发给大模型，这样既不会超出模型上下文窗口限制，还能尽量保留所有的记忆。"},"567":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-237","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"LangChain提供了总结消息的默认实现：**SummarizationMiddleware**"},"568":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-238","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"① 初始化`SummarizationMiddleware`和`checkpointer`"},"569":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-239","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"官方参数：\n`model`：会话摘要时要使用的模型"},"570":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-240","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"`trigger`：会话摘要的触发时机，有三种设置：\n&#8195;`fraction` (float): 模型上下文大小的比例（0-1）\n&#8195;`tokens` (int): 令牌数量\n&#8195;`messages` (int): 消息数量"},"571":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-241","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"`keep`：指触发摘要后要保留的消息，也就是总结摘要后要保留的消息，例如 Message 在 100 条的时候触发摘要总结，然后 keep 设置的是 20，那么就会将 100 条消息中的 81 条消息总结为 1 条摘要与剩下的 19 条组成 20 条 message。\n&#8195;`fraction` (float): 要保留的消息占模型上下文大小的比例（0-1）\n&#8195;`tokens` (int): 要保留的消息的令牌数量\n&#8195;`messages` (int): 要保留的消息数量"},"572":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-242","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"② 创建 Agent，设置middleware和checkpointer"},"573":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-243","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"③ 调用 Agent"},"574":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-244","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#总结消息","content":"测试结果："},"575":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-245","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#long-term-memory","content":"短期记忆记录的是会话级别（线程，Thread）的数据，会话间不共享。而长期记忆记录的是用户特定或者应用级别的数据，任何会话都可以随时访问。"},"576":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-246","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#long-term-memory","content":"**类型划分**：\n（1）Semantic Memory 语义记忆：即事实类记忆，记录事实、用户偏好、概念，如：用户喜欢简洁回答、用户常用中文等\n（2）Episodic Memory 情景记忆：即经验类记忆，记录 Agent 过去执行的动作\n（3）Procedural Memory 程序性记忆：即规则、做事方法，如：系统提示词、工作流程、工具调用规则"},"577":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-247","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#存储架构","content":"长期记忆的存储：`store -> namespace -> key -> value`"},"578":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-248","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#存储架构","content":"**Store**：记忆仓库\n**Namespace**：命名空间，数据类型是由任意长度的 `tuple[str,...]`（字符串元组） 表示的层级路径。用于给长期记忆分组和隔离。\n**Key**：键，namespace 下的唯一标识，单条记忆的唯一键，数据类型为字符串(str)\n**Value**：值，存储的指，类型为字段 dict[str, Any]"},"579":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-249","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#存储架构","content":"举例："},"580":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-250","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"**put**："},"581":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-251","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"**get**:"},"582":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-252","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"按照 `namespace + key` 精确查询，返回完整对象（Item 对象）"},"583":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-253","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"**举例**："},"584":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-254","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"① 基于 InMemoryStore"},"585":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-255","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"> Item 新增了 created_at 和 updated_at 字段，分别为数据新增和更改时间。"},"586":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-256","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#put--get","content":"② 基于 PostgresStore"},"587":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-257","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_comp