langchain/core_component#工具中使用","content":"② **基于PostgresStore**"},"606":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-276","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"中间件（Middleware）的钩子函数分为两类：**Node-style hooks** 和 **Wrap-style hooks**，都可以访问长期记忆。"},"607":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-277","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"① **Node-style hooks 中访问**"},"608":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-278","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"Node-style hooks 包括 `before_model`、`after_model` 等，通过 `Runtime` 对象访问长期记忆："},"609":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-279","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"② **Wrap-style hooks 中访问**"},"610":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-280","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"Wrap-style hooks 包括 `wrap_model_call`、`wrap_tool_call` 等，通过 `ModelRequest` 或 `ToolCallRequest` 对象访问长期记忆："},"611":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-281","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"**wrap_model_call**："},"612":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component-282","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/core_component#中间件中使用","content":"**wrap_tool_call**："},"613":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"page","content":"Deep Agent","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","LangChain"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent"},"614":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_