e_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#自定义子智能体","content":"自定义子智能体"},"637":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-23","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#compiledsubagent","content":"CompiledSubAgent"},"638":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-24","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#动态子智能体","content":"动态子智能体"},"639":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-25","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#人机协同human-in-the-loop","content":"人机协同（Human-in-the-Loop）"},"640":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-26","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#create_deep_agent-主要参数","content":"create_deep_agent 主要参数"},"641":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-27","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#默认中间件栈","content":"默认中间件栈"},"642":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-28","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#与-langgraph-的关系","content":"与 LangGraph 的关系"},"643":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-29","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#生产部署","content":"生产部署"},"644":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-30","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#相关资源","content":"相关资源"},"645":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-31","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#什么是-deep-agents","content":"Deep Agents 是 LangChain 生态中一个\"**开箱即用**\"（batteries-included）的 Agent Harness（智能体框架），能够构建处理**复杂多步骤任务**的智能体，内置了任务规划、虚拟文件系统、子智能体（subagent）派发、长期记忆等能力。"},"646":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-32","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#什么是-deep-agents","content":"核心定位：**Agent = Model + Harness**。Harness 是模型循环之外的一切——prompt、工具、中间件。"},"647":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-33","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#什么是-deep-agents","content":"> 官方推荐新需求**优先使用 Deep Agents**，除非你需要完全自定义的 Agent（此时用 `create_agent`）或混合确定性/智能体工作流（此时用 LangGraph）。"},"648":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-34","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#在-langchain-生态中的位置","content":"| 框架              | 定位                                   | 适用场景        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----------- |\n| **Deep Agents** | 开箱即用的 Harness，内置子智能体、文件系统、上下文压缩、人机协同 | 快速搭建复杂多步骤任务 |","table":"table-0"},"649":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-35","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#在-langchain-生态中的位置","content":"| 框架                             | 定位                  | 适用场景             |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **LangChain** (`create_agent`) | 高度可定制的 Harness，极简核心 | 需要完全自定义 Agent 行为 |","table":"table-0"},"650":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-36","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#在-langchain-生态中的位置","content":"| 框架            | 定位     | 适用场景           |\n| ------------- | ------ | -------------- |\n| **LangGraph** | 底层编排框架 | 需要混合确定性与智能体工作流 |","table":"table-0"},"651":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-37","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#在-langchain-生态中的位置","content":"| 框架            | 定位     | 适用场景                |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------- |\n| **LangSmith** | 可观测性平台 | 追踪、调试、评估所有框架的 Agent |","table":"table-0"},"652":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-38","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#各组件之间的关系","content":"**LangGraph** 是底层运行时，为上层提供持久化执行、流式处理等基础能力"},"653":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-39","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#各组件之间的关系","content":"**LangChain (`create_agent`)** 在 LangGraph 之上构建 Tool Calling Harness"},"654":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-40","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#各组件之间的关系","content":"**Deep Agents** 在 LangChain 之上构建，是最高层抽象，内置子智能体、文件系统等能力"},"655":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-41","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#各组件之间的关系","content":"**LangSmith** 横向覆盖所有框架（虚线表示可观测，非依赖），提供追踪、调试、评估"},"656":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-42","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#核心能力总览","content":"Deep Agents 提供六大内置能力："},"657":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-43","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#核心能力总览","content":"| 能力                          | 说明                        |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 执行环境（Execution Environment） | 工具调用、虚拟文件系统、可选沙箱、REPL/解释器 |","table":"table-1"},"658":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-44","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent#核心能力总览","content":"| 能力                    | 说明                             |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 数据连接（Connect to Data） | 按需加载记忆（Memory）、技能（Skills）和领域知识 |","table":"table-1"},"659":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent-45","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/deep_agent","tags":[],