","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#概述","content":"`工具(Tools)`：Agent 的手脚，执行模型自己做不到的外部操作"},"832":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-36","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#概述","content":"`系统提示词(System Prompt)`：Agent的角色，告诉模型该怎么想、参考什么上下文。"},"833":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-37","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#概述","content":"`中间件(Middleware)`：Agent的中枢，在执行流程的关键节点进行拦截、控制和增强"},"834":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-38","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#概述","content":"**声明如下**："},"835":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-39","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#什么是中间件","content":"Middleware（中间件），简单说就是 Agent 执行过程中的钩子函数，是 LangChain 1.x 的王牌工程化能力。借助中间件，开发和可以高度定制和控制 Agent 运行的每一个环节，是处理 Agent 生命周期的标准方式。"},"836":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-40","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#什么是中间件","content":"在 LangChain 的 Agent 执行循环中，比如 \"模型调用前\"、\"模型调用后\"、\"工具调用前\" 设置一些钩子（hooks），让你在不改 Agent 主体逻辑的情况下实现策略与治理。"},"837":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-41","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#什么是中间件","content":"| 无中间件架构 | 使用中间件架构 |\n| ------ | ------- |\n|        |         |","table":"table-0"},"838":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-42","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"中间件的价格在于把一些与业务无关，但与执行过程强相关的横切逻辑，从 Agent 主流程中分离出来，让其主体代码聚焦业务，而借助中间件实现拦截流程、修改流程、增强流程。"},"839":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-43","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"比如说实现如下功能："},"840":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-44","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"**日志与分析**： 追踪行为、调试、性能监控"},"841":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-45","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"**转换**： 修改提示词、工具选择、输出格式"},"842":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-46","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"**容错**： 重试、降级、早期终止"},"843":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-47","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#为什么需要中间件","content":"**安全**： 限流、守护规则、PII 检测"},"844":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-48","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#中间件分类","content":"LangChain 分为下面两类：\n**自定义中间件**：允许开发者自定义\n**内置中间件**：模型供应商无关的中间件 / 模型供应商定制的中间件"},"845":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-49","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"官网链接，大致分为下面六个类别："},"846":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-50","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 控成本、控配额、避免无限调用\n**解决的问题**: Agent太贵、太能跑、停不下来\n**包含的功能**:\n• `Model call limit`：限制模型调用次数，防止一次任务反复请求LLM，导致费用失控\n• `Tool call limit`：限制工具调用次数，避免Agent无限试错、死循环调工具\n• `Summarization`：在上下文快满时自动总结历史，减少token消耗\n• `Context editing`：裁剪上下文、清理工具调用痕迹，本质上也是为了节省上下文成本\n**业务场景理解**: 适合生产环境的成本治理、配额治理、长会话优化、SaaS产品控费"},"847":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-51","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 保证服务不中断、失败后尽量自动恢复\n**解决的问题**: 调用失败怎么办、模型挂了怎么办、工具超时怎么办\n**包含的功能**:\n• `Model fallback`：主模型失败时切换备用模型\n• `Model retry`：模型调用失败后自动重试\n• `Tool retry`：工具调用失败后自动重试\n**业务场景理解**: 适合线上生产系统，尤其是多模型、多工具依赖的Agent。本质上是在做高可用、容灾、鲁棒性建设"},"848":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-52","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 让Agent可控、可审、合规\n**解决的问题**: Agent乱执行、泄露敏感信息、做危险操作\n**包含的功能**:\n• `Human-in-the-loop`：在关键工具调用前暂停，等人工审批\n• `PII detection`：检测和处理个人敏感信息\n• `Model call limit / Tool call limit`：某种意义上也可归到风控，因为它能防止异常滥用\n**业务场景理解**: 适合企业内部系统、客服系统、审批流、数据查询类Agent。尤其是涉及：发邮件、调数据库、调财务/人事系统、导出敏感信息、执行外部动作等"},"849":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-53","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 提升Agent的决策质量和任务拆解能力\n**解决的问题**: Agent不够聪明、不会规划、不会先筛工具\n**包含的功能**:\n• `To-do list`：给Agent增加任务规划、分步骤执行和状态跟踪能力\n• `LLM tool selector`：当工具太多时，用子模型筛选最相关的几个工具交给主模型\n• `Subagent`：允许生成子Agent，把复杂任务拆给不同角色处理\n**业务场景理解**: 适合复杂任务流，比如：研究型Agent、多步骤分析、报告生成、多角色协作、长链路任务编排等。这类本质上是在增强Agent的\"脑子\"与\"组织能力\""},"850":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-54","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 给Agent更多\"手脚\"\n**解决的问题**: Agent只能聊天，不能真正操作环境\n**包含的功能**:\n• `Shell tool`：给Agent持久shell，会执行命令\n• `File search`：给Agent文件搜索能力，能做Glob/Grep\n• `Filesystem`：给Agent文件系统读写与长期存储能力\n**业务场景理解**: 适合工程Agent、代码Agent、本地自动化Agent、运维Agent。本质上是把Agent从\"纯推理\"扩展成\"能操作环境的执行体\""},"851":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-55","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#模型提供商无关的中间件分类","content":"**核心目标**: 方便开发、测试、验证Agent行为\n**解决的问题**: 主要不是直接服务业务，而是服务于研发和调试阶段\n**包含的功能**:\n• `LLM tool emulator`：用LLM模拟工具执行，便于测试（最典型）\n• `Summarization`：有时也可辅助调试长会话表现\n• `Context editing`：可用于测试上下文裁剪效果\n• `Human-in-the-loop`：也常用于调试高风险步骤\n**业务场景理解**: 适合开发阶段快速验证流程、做mock、减少真实工具依赖"},"852":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-56","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"在接近 token 上限时自动总结对话历史，保留最近的消息同时压缩较早的上下文。"},"853":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-57","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"**适用场景：** 长时间运行的对话、多轮对话、需要保留完整对话上下文的应用。"},"854":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-58","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"> **注意：** 摘要是文本导向的上下文压缩，不会对图片/音频/视频进行压缩。被 `keep` 保留的最近消息仍包含原始的多模态内容，而被摘要的较早消息仅以生成的文本摘要形式表示。"},"855":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-59","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"**配置参数：**"},"856":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-60","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数      | 类型                        | 默认值    | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `model` | `string \\| BaseChatModel` | **必填** | 用于生成摘要的模型，可以是模型标识字符串或 `BaseChatModel` 实例 |","table":"table-1"},"857":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-61","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数        | 类型                                     | 默认值 | 说明                                                                                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `trigger` | `ContextSize \\| TriggerClause \\| list` | 不触发 | 触发摘要的条件。支持 `fraction`（模型上下文比例 0-1）、`tokens`（绝对 token 数）、`messages`（消息数量）。单个元组为单阈值，字典为 AND 逻辑，列表为 OR 逻辑 |","table":"table-1"},"858":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-62","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数     | 类型            | 默认值                | 说明                                                  |\n| ------ | ------------- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `keep` | `ContextSize` | `(\"messages\", 20)` | 摘要后保留的上下文量。只能指定 `fraction`、`tokens`、`messages` 中的一个 |","table":"table-1"},"859":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-63","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数              | 类型         | 默认值  | 说明             |\n| --------------- | ---------- | ---- | -------------- |\n| `token_counter` | `function` | 字符计数 | 自定义 token 计数函数 |","table":"table-1"},"860":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-64","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数               | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明                             |\n| ---------------- | -------- | ---- | ------------------------------ |\n| `summary_prompt` | `string` | 内置模板 | 自定义摘要提示模板，需包含 `{messages}` 占位符 |","table":"table-1"},"861":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-65","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"| 参数                         | 类型       | 默认值    | 说明                 |\n| -------------------------- | -------- | ------ | ------------------ |\n| `trim_tokens_to_summarize` | `number` | `4000` | 生成摘要时包含的最大 token 数 |","table":"table-1"},"862":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-66","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#summarizationmiddleware","content":"**已废弃参数：** `max_tokens_before_summary`（改用 `trigger=(\"tokens\", value)`）、`messages_to_keep`（改用 `keep=(\"messages\", value)`）"},"863":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-67","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"在工具调用执行前暂停 Agent，等待人类审批、编辑或拒绝。"},"864":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-68","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"**适用场景：** 高风险操作（数据库写入、金融交易）、合规工作流、需要人类反馈的长对话。"},"865":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-69","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"> **警告：** HumanInTheLoop 需要配置 checkpointer 来维护中断期间的状态。\n> `Agent → 模型生成响应 → 中间件检查工具调用 → 触发 interrupt → 等待人类决策 → 恢复执行`"},"866":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-70","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"**配置参数：**"},"867":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-71","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"| 参数             | 类型     | 默认值    | 说明                                                                  |\n| -------------- | ------ | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `interrupt_on` | `dict` | **必填** | 工具名到审批配置的映射。值可以是 `True`（默认审批）、`False`（自动批准）或 `InterruptOnConfig` 对象 |","table":"table-2"},"868":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-72","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"| 参数                   | 类型       | 默认值                                  | 说明      |\n| -------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------ | ------- |\n| `description_prefix` | `string` | `\"Tool execution requires approval\"` | 中断消息的前缀 |","table":"table-2"},"869":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-73","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"**`InterruptOnConfig` 选项：**"},"870":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-74","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                                  |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `allowed_decisions` | 允许的决策列表：`'approve'`、`'edit'`、`'reject'`、`'respond'` |","table":"table-3"},"871":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-75","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"| 参数            | 说明                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------- |\n| `description` | 静态字符串或可调用函数，用于自定义描述 |","table":"table-3"},"872":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-76","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"| 参数     | 说明                                                                             |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `when` | 可选的断言函数，接收 `ToolCallRequest` 返回 `True` 中断或 `False` 自动批准（需要 `langchain>=1.3.3`） |","table":"table-3"},"873":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-77","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"**示例**："},"874":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-78","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#humanintheloopmiddleware","content":"**输出**："},"875":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-79","page_id":"/docs/ai/lang