ken 使用、提高模型聚焦度和准确性。"},"931":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-135","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"> **工作原理：** 此中间件使用结构化输出询问 LLM 哪些工具与当前查询最相关。结构化输出 schema 定义了可用工具的名称和描述。"},"932":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-136","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"**示例：**"},"933":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-137","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"**配置参数：**"},"934":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-138","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"| 参数      | 类型                        | 默认值       | 说明        |\n| ------- | ------------------------- | --------- | --------- |\n| `model` | `string \\| BaseChatModel` | Agent 主模型 | 用于工具选择的模型 |","table":"table-10"},"935":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-139","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"| 参数              | 类型       | 默认值  | 说明      |\n| --------------- | -------- | ---- | ------- |\n| `system_prompt` | `string` | 内置提示 | 选择模型的指令 |","table":"table-10"},"936":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-140","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"| 参数          | 类型       | 默认值 | 说明        |\n| ----------- | -------- | --- | --------- |\n| `max_tools` | `number` | 无限制 | 最多选择的工具数量 |","table":"table-10"},"937":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-141","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolselectormiddleware","content":"| 参数               | 类型             | 默认值  | 说明                          |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ---- | --------------------------- |\n| `always_include` | `list[string]` | `[]` | 始终包含的工具名称（不计入 max_tools 限制） |","table":"table-10"},"938":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-142","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"自动重试失败的工具调用，支持可配置的指数退避。"},"939":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-143","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"**适用场景：** 处理外部 API 调用的瞬时故障、提高网络依赖工具的可靠性、构建优雅处理临时错误的弹性 Agent。"},"940":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-144","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"指数退避（Exponential Backoff）的核心思想就是：当某个操作失败（通常是网络请求、API调用或数据库连接）时，系统不会立刻重试，也不会每次都等待相同的固定时间，而是让每一次重试的延迟时间按指数级增长。"},"941":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-145","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"**为什么不直接重试**？"},"942":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-146","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"想象一下，某个热门网站的服务器因为瞬间流量太大（比如抢票或秒杀）崩溃了。如果所有失败的客户端都立刻或每隔1秒就重试一次，这无异于对已经瘫痪的服务器进行了一场持续的 DDoS（分布式拒绝服务）攻击，服务器可能永远也缓不过来。"},"943":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-147","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"**示例：**"},"944":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-148","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"**配置参数：**"},"945":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-149","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数            | 类型       | 默认值 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | -------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `max_retries` | `number` | `2` | 最大重试次数（默认共 3 次尝试） |","table":"table-11"},"946":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-150","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数      | 类型                      | 默认值  | 说明                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------- | ---- | ------------------------ |\n| `tools` | `list[BaseTool \\| str]` | 所有工具 | 要应用重试逻辑的工具列表（工具实例或名称字符串） |","table":"table-11"},"947":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-151","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数         | 类型                                        | 默认值  | 说明                           |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---- | ---------------------------- |\n| `retry_on` | `tuple[type[Exception], ...] \\| callable` | 所有错误 | 异常类型元组或返回 `True` 表示应重试的可调用对象 |","table":"table-11"},"948":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-152","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数           | 类型                   | 默认值                | 说明                                                                       |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `on_failure` | `string \\| callable` | `\"return_message\"` | 重试耗尽后的行为：`\"return_message\"`（返回错误 ToolMessage）、`\"raise\"`（重新抛出异常）、自定义可调用对象 |","table":"table-11"},"949":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-153","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数               | 类型       | 默认值   | 说明                     |\n| ---------------- | -------- | ----- | ---------------------- |\n| `backoff_factor` | `number` | `2.0` | 指数退避乘数。设为 `0.0` 则为固定延迟 |","table":"table-11"},"950":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-154","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数              | 类型       | 默认值      | 说明         |\n| --------------- | -------- | -------- | ---------- |\n| `initial_delay` | `number` | `1.0`（秒） | 首次重试前的初始延迟 |","table":"table-11"},"951":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-155","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数          | 类型       | 默认值       | 说明                 |\n| ----------- | -------- | --------- | ------------------ |\n| `max_delay` | `number` | `60.0`（秒） | 重试间的最大延迟（限制指数退避增长） |","table":"table-11"},"952":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-156","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#toolretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数       | 类型        | 默认值    | 说明                      |\n| -------- | --------- | ------ | ----------------------- |\n| `jitter` | `boolean` | `True` | 是否添加随机抖动（`±25%`）以避免惊群效应 |","table":"table-11"},"953":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-157","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"自动重试失败的模型调用，支持可配置的指数退避。"},"954":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-158","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"**适用场景：** 处理模型 API 调用的瞬时故障、提高网络依赖模型请求的可靠性、构建优雅处理临时模型错误的弹性 Agent。"},"955":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-159","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"**示例：**"},"956":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-160","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"**配置参数：**"},"957":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-161","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数            | 类型       | 默认值 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | -------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `max_retries` | `number` | `2` | 最大重试次数（默认共 3 次尝试） |","table":"table-12"},"958":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-162","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数         | 类型                                        | 默认值  | 说明                           |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------- | ---- | ---------------------------- |\n| `retry_on` | `tuple[type[Exception], ...] \\| callable` | 所有错误 | 异常类型元组或返回 `True` 表示应重试的可调用对象 |","table":"table-12"},"959":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-163","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数           | 类型                   | 默认值          | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `on_failure` | `string \\| callable` | `\"continue\"` | 重试耗尽后的行为：`\"continue\"`（返回错误 AIMessage）、`\"error\"`（重新抛出异常）、自定义可调用对象 |","table":"table-12"},"960":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-164","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数               | 类型       | 默认值   | 说明                     |\n| ---------------- | -------- | ----- | ---------------------- |\n| `backoff_factor` | `number` | `2.0` | 指数退避乘数。设为 `0.0` 则为固定延迟 |","table":"table-12"},"961":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-165","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数              | 类型       | 默认值      | 说明         |\n| --------------- | -------- | -------- | ---------- |\n| `initial_delay` | `number` | `1.0`（秒） | 首次重试前的初始延迟 |","table":"table-12"},"962":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-166","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数          | 类型       | 默认值       | 说明       |\n| ----------- | -------- | --------- | -------- |\n| `max_delay` | `number` | `60.0`（秒） | 重试间的最大延迟 |","table":"table-12"},"963":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-167","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"| 参数       | 类型        | 默认值    | 说明                      |\n| -------- | --------- | ------ | ----------------------- |\n| `jitter` | `boolean` | `True` | 是否添加随机抖动（`±25%`）以避免惊群效应 |","table":"table-12"},"964":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-168","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#modelretrymiddleware","content":"**与 ToolRetryMiddleware 的区别：** `ModelRetryMiddleware` 重试的是 LLM 模型调用失败，`ToolRetryMiddleware` 重试的是工具执行失败。两者通常组合使用："},"965":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-169","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolemulator","content":"使用 LLM 模拟工具执行，替代实际工具调用生成 AI 回复。"},"966":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-170","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#llmtoolemulator","content":"**适用场景：** 在不执行真实工具的情况下测试 Agent 行为、在外部工具不可用或昂贵时开发 Agent、在实现实际工具之前原型化 Agent 工作流。"},"967":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-171","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware"