ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"| 参数              | 类型           | 说明                |\n| --------------- | ------------ | ----------------- |\n| `default_tools` | `BaseTool[]` | 所有子 Agent 共享的默认工具 |","table":"table-21"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-240","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"| 参数          | 类型           | 说明           |\n| ----------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `subagents` | `SubAgent[]` | 子 Agent 定义列表 |","table":"table-21"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-241","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**子 Agent 执行特性：**"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-242","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**全新上下文** — 每次调用创建新的 Agent 实例，拥有独立上下文"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-243","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**自主执行** — 子 Agent 独立运行直到完成"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-244","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**单次交接** — 返回一个最终报告给主 Agent"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-245","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**无状态消息** — 子 Agent 是无状态的，不能发送多条消息回来"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-246","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**上下文和 token 效率** — 繁重的子任务工作保持隔离，并被压缩为紧凑的结果"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-247","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"除了用户自定义的子 Agent，主 Agent 始终可以访问一个 `general-purpose` 子 Agent。该子 Agent 拥有与主 Agent 相同的指令和所有可用工具，主要目的是上下文隔离。"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-248","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#subagent","content":"**使用预构建 LangGraph 图作为子 Agent（Python）：**"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-249","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#自定义中间件","content":"某些复杂场景下，官方内置的中间件不能完全满足需求，此时可以通过实现 LangChain 暴露的中间件 `hook函数` 构建自定义中间件。"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-250","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#什么是-hook-函数","content":"Hook 函数，中文名长叫**钩子函数**，指的是：在某个既定流程的特定时机，被框架、系统或者主程序**自动调用**的扩展函数。"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-251","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"LangChain 中间件暴露了两大类共 6 个 hook 函数，分别对应 Agent 执行生命周期的不同切入点："},"1048":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-252","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类            | 钩子函数           | 触发时机               | 典型用途      |\n| ------------- | -------------- | ------------------ | --------- |\n| **节点式（Node）** | `before_agent` | Agent 开始前（每次调用仅一次） | 加载记忆、校验输入 |","table":"table-22"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-253","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类  | 钩子函数           | 触发时机    | 典型用途       |\n| --- | -------------- | ------- | ---------- |\n|     | `before_model` | 每次模型调用前 | 修改提示词、裁剪消息 |","table":"table-22"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-254","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类  | 钩子函数          | 触发时机    | 典型用途      |\n| --- | ------------- | ------- | --------- |\n|     | `after_model` | 每次模型响应后 | 校验输出、应用护栏 |","table":"table-22"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-255","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类  | 钩子函数          | 触发时机               | 典型用途      |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------------ | --------- |\n|     | `after_agent` | Agent 完成后（每次调用仅一次） | 保存结果、清理资源 |","table":"table-22"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-256","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类            | 钩子函数              | 触发时机     | 典型用途          |\n| ------------- | ----------------- | -------- | ------------- |\n| **包裹式（Wrap）** | `wrap_model_call` | 包裹每次模型调用 | 拦截请求/响应、重试、缓存 |","table":"table-22"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-257","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"| 分类  | 钩子函数             | 触发时机     | 典型用途            |\n| --- | ---------------- | -------- | --------------- |\n|     | `wrap_tool_call` | 包裹每次工具调用 | 拦截工具执行、修改参数/返回值 |","table":"table-22"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-258","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#hook-函数分类","content":"需要**顺序执行**的逻辑（日志、校验、状态更新） → 用 `Node-style hooks`\n需要**控制调用流程**的逻辑（重试、降级、缓存、动态切换模型/工具） → 用 `Wrap-style hooks`"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-259","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"节点式钩子在 Agent 执行的特定节点**顺序运行**，适合做日志记录、输入校验、输出校验、状态更新等线性逻辑。"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-260","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"每个 hook 函数签名为 `(state: AgentState, runtime: Runtime) -> dict | None`："},"1057":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-261","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"返回 `None` 表示不修改状态，继续执行"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-262","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"返回 `dict` 会合并到 Agent 状态中（键值映射到状态字段）"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-263","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"返回包含 `jump_to` 的字典可以跳转到指定节点（`\"end\"` / `\"tools\"` / `\"model\"`）"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-264","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"**四个 hook 的执行时机：**"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-265","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"**消息数量限制\\_示例：**"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-266","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"**可用的 jump 目标：**"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-267","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"| 目标      | 说明                                 |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `\"end\"` | 跳转到 Agent 执行结束（或第一个 `after_agent`） |","table":"table-23"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-268","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"| 目标        | 说明        |\n| --------- | --------- |\n| `\"tools\"` | 跳转到工具执行节点 |","table":"table-23"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-269","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"| 目标        | 说明                             |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `\"model\"` | 跳转到模型调用节点（或第一个 `before_model`） |","table":"table-23"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-270","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#node-style-hooks","content":"> **注意：** 使用 `jump_to` 需要在装饰器或 `@hook_config` 中声明 `can_jump_to` 列表，否则会抛出异常。"},"1067":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-271","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"包裹式钩子以**洋葱模型**包裹在模型/工具调用周围，拥有对调用流程的完全控制权——你可以决定 handler 被调用 **0 次**（短路）、**1 次**（正常流程）、或**多次**（重试逻辑）。"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-272","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"可用的 wrap 钩子："},"1069":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-273","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"| 钩子                | 包裹对象   | handler 签名                                        |\n| ----------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `wrap_model_call` | 每次模型调用 | `handler(request: ModelRequest) -> ModelResponse` |","table":"table-24"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-274","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"| 钩子               | 包裹对象   | handler 签名                                      |\n| ---------------- | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `wrap_tool_call` | 每次工具调用 | `handler(request: ToolRequest) -> ToolResponse` |","table":"table-24"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-275","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"**核心机制：** wrap 钩子接收 `request` 和 `handler` 两个参数。`handler` 代表被包裹的实际调用，你可以："},"1072":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-276","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"在调用前修改 `request`（通过 `request.override(...)` 创建新请求，不可变模式）"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-277","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"在调用后修改响应"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-278","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"跳过 `handler` 直接返回（短路）"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-279","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"多次调用 `handler`（重试）"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-280","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"替换 `handler` 的目标（动态切换模型/工具）"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-281","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"**模型调用重试\\_示例 1：**"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-282","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"**动态选择模型\\_示例 2：**"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-283","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"**动态修改系统提示词\\_示例 3：**"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-284","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#wrap-style-hooks","content":"> **`ModelRequest` 常用属性：**\n>\n> | 属性                     | 说明                                            |\n> | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n> | `request.messages`       | 当前对话消息列表                                |\n> | `request.model`          | 当前使用的模型实例                              |\n> | `request.tools`          | 当前可用的工具列表                              |\n> | `request.system_message` | 系统提示词（始终为 `SystemMessage` 对象）       |\n> | `request.state`          | 当前 Agent 状态                                 |\n> | `request.runtime`        | Runtime 对象，可访问上下文（`runtime.context`） |\n> | `request.override(...)`  | 创建修改后的新请求（不可变模式）                |"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-285","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#装饰器和类的选择","content":"LangChain 提供两种方式创建自定义中间件：**装饰器**和**类**。"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-286","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#装饰器和类的选择","content":"| 对比维度 | 装饰器写法        | 类写法                     |\n| ---- | ------------ | ----------------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 单个 hook、快速原型 | 多个 hook、复杂配置、需要同步+异步双版本 |","table":"table-25"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-287","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#装饰器和类的选择","content":"| 对比维度 | 装饰器写法    | 类写法        |\n| ---- | -------- | ---------- |\n| 代码量  | 少，一个函数即可 | 多，需要定义类和方法 |","table":"table-25"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-288","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#装饰器和类的选择","content":"| 对比维度 | 装饰器写法   | 类写法                |\n| ---- | ------- | ------------------ |\n| 可配置性 | 通过闭包或参数 | 通过 `__init__` 构造函数 |","table":"table-25"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-289","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/la