\n| -------- | --------------- | ---------- |\n| `wrap_*` | **嵌套**（第一个包裹所有） | 像套娃，外层包裹内层 |","table":"table-27"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-323","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#核心规则总结","content":"> **设计思想：** 这种\"正序进入、逆序退出\"的模式与 Express.js / Koa.js 的中间件模型完全一致。`before` 负责\"进入\"阶段的预处理，`after` 负责\"退出\"阶段的清理，`wrap` 则拥有对整个调用链的完全控制权。"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-324","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"下面展示一个典型的多中间件组合——从输入安全检查到输出合规校验的完整管线："},"1121":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-325","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"**执行流程解读：**"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-326","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"用户消息进入 → **PIIMiddleware**（输入层）先脱敏邮箱和信用卡号"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-327","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"**ModelCallLimitMiddleware** 检查本次运行是否超限"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-328","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"**SummarizationMiddleware** 判断是否需要压缩历史上下文"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-329","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"模型调用时 → **ModelRetryMiddleware** 包裹调用，失败自动重试"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-330","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"重试耗尽 → **ModelFallbackMiddleware** 切换到备用模型"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-331","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"工具调用时 → **ToolRetryMiddleware** 包裹 `database_tool` 的执行"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-332","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"模型返回工具调用 → **HumanInTheLoopMiddleware** 拦截 `send_email_tool` 等待审批"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-333","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"审批通过后执行 → 输出经过 **PIIMiddleware**（输出层）再次脱敏"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware-334","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/middleware#实际组合示例","content":"> **排列建议：** 将\"越通用、越靠输入侧\"的中间件放前面（如 PII 输入过滤、成本限制），将\"越具体、越靠输出侧\"的放后面（如人工审批、输出校验）。容错类中间件（retry / fallback）使用 wrap 钩子，位置对执行顺序影响较小，通常放在中间即可。"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"page","content":"RAG","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","LangChain"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#什么是-rag","content":"什么是 RAG"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"为什么需要 RAG"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-2","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-优缺点","content":"RAG 优缺点"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-3","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基本架构","content":"基本架构"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-4","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"RAG 的典型应用场景"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-5","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/a