s":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#检索类型","content":"检索类型"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-29","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#完整-rag-实战示例","content":"完整 RAG 实战示例"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-30","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#传统-rag-流程","content":"传统 RAG 流程"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-31","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#使用-lcel-组装-rag-链","content":"使用 LCEL 组装 RAG 链"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-32","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#进阶-rag-技术","content":"进阶 RAG 技术"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-33","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文档预处理","content":"文档预处理"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-34","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#多查询检索multi-query","content":"多查询检索（Multi-Query）"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-35","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#上下文压缩contextual-compression","content":"上下文压缩（Contextual Compression）"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-36","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag","content":"Agentic RAG"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-37","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#传统-rag-vs-agentic-rag","content":"传统 RAG vs Agentic RAG"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-38","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#实现示例","content":"实现示例"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-39","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag-的优势","content":"Agentic RAG 的优势"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-40","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"RAG vs 微调（Fine-tuning）"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-41","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#学习资源","content":"学习资源"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-42","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#什么是-rag","content":"RAG（Retrieval-Augmented Generation，检索增强生成）是一种将**外部知识检索**与**大语言模型生成**相结合的技术。核心思想是：在 LLM 生成回答之前，先从外部知识库中检索相关信息，然后将检索结果作为上下文提供给模型，从而生成更准确、更有依据的回答。"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-43","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#什么是-rag","content":"简单来说，RAG 就是让模型\"先查资料，再回答问题\"。"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-44","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"大语言模型存在一些固有的局限性，RAG 可以有效缓解这些问题："},"1177":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-45","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"| 问题       | 说明                    | RAG 如何解决     |\n| -------- | --------------------- | ------------ |\n| **知识截止** | 模型训练数据有时间截止点，无法获知最新信息 | 通过检索实时获取最新知识 |","table":"table-0"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-46","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"| 问题       | 说明             | RAG 如何解决       |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| **幻觉问题** | 模型可能\"编造\"不存在的事实 | 基于检索到的真实文档生成回答 |","table":"table-0"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-47","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"| 问题         | 说明              | RAG 如何解决   |\n| ---------- | --------------- | ---------- |\n| **领域知识不足** | 通用模型对专业领域知识覆盖有限 | 接入专业领域的知识库 |","table":"table-0"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-48","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"| 问题          | 说明               | RAG 如何解决      |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ------------- |\n| **上下文长度限制** | 无法将所有相关资料一次性输入模型 | 检索最相关的片段，精准投喂 |","table":"table-0"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-49","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"| 问题         | 说明       | RAG 如何解决     |\n| ---------- | -------- | ------------ |\n| **无法引用来源** | 回答缺乏可追溯性 | 基于检索文档回答，可溯源 |","table":"table-0"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-50","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"**幻觉问题的严重性**：\n&#8195;&#8195;大模型生成内容的不可控，尤其是在**金融**和**医疗领域**等领域，一次金额评估的错误，一次医疗诊断的失误，哪怕只出现一次都是致命的。 但对于非专业人士来说可能难以辨识。目前还没有能够百分之百解决这种情况的方案。"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-51","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"**幻觉产生的原因**："},"1184":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-52","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"训练知识存在偏差，这些错误信息被 LLM 学习后在输出中复现"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-53","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"LLM 训练时过度泛化，将普通的模式应用在特定场合导致不准确输出"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-54","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"LLM 本身没有真正学习到训练数据中深层次的含义，导致在一些需要深入理解或复杂推理的任务中出错"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-55","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#为什么需要-rag","content":"LLM缺乏某些领域的相关知识，在面临这些领域的相关问题时编造不存在的信息"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-56","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-优缺点","content":"**RAG的优点**：\n1）相比提示词工程，RAG有更丰富的上下文和数据样本，可以不需要用户提供过多的背景描述，就能生成比较符合用户预期的答案。\n2）相比于模型微调，RAG可以提升问答内容的时效性和可靠性\n3）在一定程度上保护了业务数据的隐私性。"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-57","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-优缺点","content":"**RAG的缺点**：\n1）由于每次问答都涉及外部系统数据检索，因此RAG的响应时延相对较高。\n2）引用的外部知识数据会消耗大量的模型Token资源。"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-58","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基本架构","content":"（1）**索引（Indexing）**\n&#8195;&#8195;将外部的知识源（如 PDF 文档、数据库、网页）切分成若干片段（chunks），通过嵌入模型（embedding model）将这些片段转换成向量，存入向量数据库（如 Faiss、Pinecone、Milvus）中，构建可快速搜索的索引。\n（2）**检索（Retrieval）**\n&#8195;&#8195;当用户提出问题时，首先用相同的嵌入模型将问题转为查询向量，在向量数据库中进行**相似性搜索**，找出与问题语义最相关的前 K 个文档片段。\n（3）**增强（Augmentation）**\n&#8195;&#8195;把检索到的相关片段与用户的原始问题拼接成一个提示模板（prompt），通常格式为："},"1191":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-59","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基本架构","content":"（4）**生成（Generation）**\n&#8195;&#8195;将组装好的提示送入大语言模型，模型结合外部知识和自身能力生成最终答案。同时，答案可以附带引用来源链接，增强可信度。"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-60","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"| 场景      | 说明                       |\n| ------- | ------------------------ |\n| 企业知识库问答 | 基于公司内部文档、规章制度、产品手册回答员工问题 |","table":"table-1"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-61","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"| 场景   | 说明                        |\n| ---- | ------------------------- |\n| 客服系统 | 实时从产品文档或历史工单中检索信息，生成个性化回复 |","table":"table-1"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-62","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"| 场景     | 说明                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------- |\n| 多轮对话助手 | 结合对话历史和外部检索，提供持续且准确的帮助 |","table":"table-1"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-63","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"| 场景     | 说明                         |\n| ------ | -------------------------- |\n| 科学研究辅助 | 从论文库中检索相关文献，辅助研究者快速获取摘要与结论 |","table":"table-1"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-64","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-的典型应用场景","content":"| 场景     | 说明                    |\n| ------ | --------------------- |\n| 个人知识管理 | 与笔记工具结合，在私人笔记中搜索并生成答案 |","table":"table-1"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-65","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-核心组件","content":"RAG 系统由以下核心组件构成，每个组件都有对应的 LangChain 实现："},"1198":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-66","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文档加载器document-loaders","content":"文档加载器负责从各种数据源读取数据，并将其转换为统一的 `Document` 对象。每个 `Document` 包含两个核心字段："},"1199":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-67","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文档加载器document-loaders","content":"`page_content`：文档的文本内容"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-68","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文档加载器document-loaders","content":"`metadata`：元数据（来源、页码等）"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-69","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用文档加载器","content":"LangChain 提供了丰富的文档加载器，覆盖文件、网页、数据库等多种数据源："},"1202":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-70","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用文档加载器","content":"**文件类加载器：**"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-71","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用文档加载器","content":"| 加载器          | 用途          | 安装包                   |\n| ------------ | ----------- | --------------------- |\n| `TextLoader` | 纯文本文件（.txt） | `langchain-community` |","table":"table-2"},"1204":