langchain/rag#文本切分器text-splitters","content":"**模型上下文窗口有限**：过长的文本无法放入上下文"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-144","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文本切分器text-splitters","content":"**检索精度**：较小的片段更容易匹配到相关内容"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-145","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#文本切分器text-splitters","content":"**避免信息稀释**：大段文本中关键信息可能被\"淹没\""},"1278":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-146","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"LangChain 提供了多种文本切分器，按照切分方式可以分为**三大类**。对于大多数场景，建议从 `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` 开始，这是官方推荐的默认选择："},"1279":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-147","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"| 类别         | 核心思路                             | 包含的切分器                           | 适用场景             |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| **基于文本结构** | 利用文本天然的层级结构（段落→句子→单词）递归切分，保持语义连贯 | `RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` | **通用文本（推荐默认选择）** |","table":"table-14"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-148","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"| 类别       | 核心思路                | 包含的切分器                                      | 适用场景      |\n| -------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| **基于长度** | 按照字符数或 Token 数量硬性切分 | `CharacterTextSplitter`、`TokenTextSplitter` | 需要精确控制大小时 |","table":"table-14"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-149","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"| 类别         | 核心思路                       | 包含的切分器                                                                     | 适用场景                        |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| **基于文档结构** | 按照文档的格式结构（标题、标签等）切分，保留逻辑组织 | `MarkdownTextSplitter`、`HTMLSectionSplitter`、`RecursiveJsonSplitter`、代码切分器 | Markdown / HTML / JSON / 代码 |","table":"table-14"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-150","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"| 类别         | 核心思路                             | 包含的切分器                 | 适用场景         |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------ |\n| **基于语义内容** | 利用 Embedding 模型，根据语义相似度找到自然的话题断点 | `SemanticChunker`（实验性） | 对语义连贯性要求高的场景 |","table":"table-14"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-151","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分策略总览","content":"> `pip install -U langchain-text-splitters` 安装后可使用前三大类切分器。"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-152","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文本结构text-structure-based","content":"文本天然具有层级结构（段落→句子→单词）。`RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter` 会**从高层到低层递归尝试切分**，尽量保持较大的文本单元不被破坏："},"1285":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-153","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文本结构text-structure-based","content":"先尝试按 `\\n\\n`（段落）切分"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-154","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文本结构text-structure-based","content":"如果段落仍然过大，按 `\\n`（行）切分"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-155","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文本结构text-structure-based","content":"如果仍然过大，按 ` `（空格）切分"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-156","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文本结构text-structure-based","content":"最后按字符切分"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-157","page_id":"