ble":"table-17"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-181","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"对于有固定格式的文档，按结构切分可以保留文档的逻辑组织，让每个片段在语义上更内聚。"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-182","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"按 Markdown 标题（`#`、`##`、`###`）层级切分，每个片段包含一个标题下的完整内容："},"1315":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-183","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"也可以更精细地使用 `MarkdownHeaderTextSplitter`，按指定标题层级切分并将标题信息写入 metadata："},"1316":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-184","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"按 HTML 标签切分，可选择只提取特定标签的内容："},"1317":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-185","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"也可以使用 `HTMLHeaderTextSplitter` 结合 BeautifulSoup 实现类似 Markdown 的按标题切分。"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-186","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"按 JSON 结构递归切分，遇到数组或嵌套对象时会深入拆分："},"1319":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-187","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于文档结构document-structure-based","content":"按代码的逻辑结构（函数、类、方法）切分，支持多种编程语言："},"1320":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-188","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"除了上述三类，LangChain 还提供了一种**基于语义的切分方式**。它使用 Embedding 模型计算句子之间的相似度，在语义发生\"跳跃\"的位置进行切分，使每个片段在语义上更内聚。"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-189","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"默认使用 `SentenceTransformersEmbedding`，也可以在 `langchain_experimental` 中使用更灵活的 `SemanticChunker`："},"1322":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-190","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"**`breakpoint_threshold_type` 参数说明：**"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-191","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"| 类型             | 说明                                |\n| -------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `\"percentile\"` | 相邻句子相似度差异超过该百分位时切断（默认 95，值越大片段越多） |","table":"table-18"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-192","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"| 类型                     | 说明             |\n| ---------------------- | -------------- |\n| `\"standard_deviation\"` | 差异超过 N 个标准差时切断 |","table":"table-18"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-193","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"| 类型                | 说明           |\n| ----------------- | ------------ |\n| `\"interquartile\"` | 差异超过 IQR 时切断 |","table":"table-18"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-194","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"| 类型           | 说明            |\n| ------------ | ------------- |\n| `\"gradient\"` | 基于相似度梯度的变化率切断 |","table":"table-18"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-195","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#基于语义内容semantic实验性","content":"> **注意：** `SemanticChunker` 在 `langchain_experimental` 中，属于实验性功能。它需要调用 Embedding 模型，速度较慢且有一定成本，但在对语义连贯性要求高的场景（如长文档问答）效果显著优于规则切分。"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-196","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分参数调优建议","content":"| 参数           | 建议值        | 说明               |\n| ------------ | ---------- | ---------------- |\n| `chunk_size` | 500 - 1500 | 太小丢失上下文，太大降低检索精度 |","table":"table-19"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-197","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分参数调优建议","content":"| 参数              | 建议值                  | 说明         |\n| --------------- | -------------------- | ---------- |\n| `chunk_overlap` | chunk_size 的 10%-20% | 确保跨片段信息不丢失 |","table":"table-19"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-198","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#切分参数调优建议","content":"| 参数                | 建议值    | 说明            |\n| ----------------- | ------ | ------------- |\n| `add_start_index` | `True` | 方便定位片段在原文中的位置 |","table":"table-19"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-199","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#embedding-模型文本嵌入","content":"Embedding 模型将文本转换为固定维度的数值向量，使得语义相近的文本在向量空间中距离更近。这是实现**语义检索**的基础。"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-200","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"**向量化** — 模型将每个输入字符串编码为一个高维向量（如 1536 维浮点数组）"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-201","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"**相似度计算** — 通过数学度量比较向量间的距离，判断语义的相关性"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-202","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"**常用相似度度量：**"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-203","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"| 度量方式      | 说明                          | 适用场景                  |\n| --------- | --------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| **余弦相似度** | 测量两个向量的夹角（-1 到 1，越接近 1 越相似） | **最常用**，适合绝大多数 RAG 场景 |","table":"table-20"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-204","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"| 度量方式     | 说明                | 适用场景      |\n| -------- | ----------------- | --------- |\n| **欧氏距离** | 测量两点间的直线距离（越小越相似） | 需要绝对距离的场景 |","table":"table-20"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-205","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#工作原理","content":"| 度量方式   | 说明                 | 适用场景            |\n| ------ | ------------------ | --------------- |\n| **点积** | 测量一个向量在另一个向量上的投影大小 | 向量已归一化时等价于余弦相似度 |","table":"table-20"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-206","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"LangChain 提供了统一的 `Embeddings` 接口，所有提供商的模型使用相同的方法调用。"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-207","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"有两种初始化方式："},"1340":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-208","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"**方式一：直接实例化**（传统方式，已在上面各 Tab 中展示）"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-209","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"**方式二：`init_embeddings()` 快速初始化**（LangChain v1 推荐）"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-210","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"通过简短的 **provider:model** 字符串选择提供商和模型，LangChain 会自动发现并实例化对应的 Embedding 模型："},"1343":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-211","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"**关键优势：**"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-212","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 对比维度 | 直接实例化          | `init_embeddings()` |\n| ---- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| 需要   | 从每个提供商的包中导入对应类 | 只导入一个函数             |","table":"table-21"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-213","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 对比维度  | 直接实例化                           | `init_embeddings()`             |\n| ----- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 写法复杂度 | `OpenAIEmbeddings(model=\"...\")` | `init_embeddings(\"openai:...\")` |","table":"table-21"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-214","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 对比维度    | 直接实例化             | `init_embeddings()` |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------------- |\n| 类型检查/补全 | ✅ 完整的 IDE 支持和类型提示 | 运行时根据字符串动态查找        |","table":"table-21"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-215","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 对比维度 | 直接实例化      | `init_embeddings()` |\n| ---- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 需要自定义配置参数时 | 快速原型、多提供商切换时        |","table":"table-21"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-216","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"> **`init_embeddings()` vs `init_chat_model()`** 是 LangChain v1 中推荐的统一初始化方式。注意 LangChain 会自动推断提供商 —— 如传 `\"openai:text-embedding-3-small\"` 会调用 `langchain-openai` 包，传 `\"huggingface:BAAI/bge-m3\"` 会调用 `langchain-huggingface` 包。"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-217","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"下面按不同提供商展示具体的初始化方法和参数："},"1350":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-218","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"**参数说明：**"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-219","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数      | 类型    | 默认值                        | 说明                                                         |\n| ------- | ----- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `model` | `str` | `\"text-embedding-ada-002\"` | 模型名称：`\"text-embedding-3-small\"`、`\"text-embedding-3-large\"` |","table":"table-22"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-220","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数           | 类型    | 默认值    | 说明                                                   |\n| ------------ | ----- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `dimensions` | `int` | `None` | 输出向量维度（`text-embedding-3-*` 支持截断，可设为 256/512/1024 等） |","table":"table-22"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-221","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数           | 类型    | 默认值    | 说明                       |\n| ------------ | ----- | ------ | ------------------------ |\n| `chunk_size` | `int` | `1000` | 单次请求批量处理的文本数量（文档较多时自动分批） |","table":"table-22"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-222","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"**参数说明：**"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-223","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数           | 类型    | 默认值 | 说明                                                                     |\n| ------------ | ----- | --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `model_name` | `str` | 必填  | HuggingFace 模型 ID，如 `\"BAAI/bge-m3\"`、`\"intfloat/multilingual-e5-large\"` |","table":"table-23"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-224","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数             | 类型     | 默认值  | 说明                            |\n| -------------- | ------ | ---- | ----------------------------- |\n| `model_kwargs` | `dict` | `{}` | 模型加载参数，如 `{\"device\": \"cuda\"}` |","table":"table-23"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-225","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数              | 类型     | 默认值  | 说明                                                        |\n| --------------- | ------ | ---- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `encode_kwargs` | `dict` | `{}` | 编码参数，如 `{\"normalize_embeddings\": True, \"batch_size\": 64}` |","table":"table-23"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-226","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"| 参数              | 类型     | 默认值     | 说明      |\n| --------------- | ------ | ------- | ------- |\n| `show_progress` | `bool` | `False` | 显示编码进度条 |","table":"table-23"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-227","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#初始化-embedding-模型","content":"> 部分开源模型需要区分 Query 和 Document 前缀提示词（如 E5、BGE 系列），可通过 `encode_kwargs={\"prompt\": \"passage: \"}` 配置。"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-228","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#核心方法","content":"`Embeddings` 接口提供两个核心方法，所有实现（OpenAI、HuggingFace、Ollama 等）用法一致："},"1361":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-229","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#核心方法","content":"| 方法                       | 返回值           | 说明              |\n| ------------------------ | ------------- | --------------- |\n| `embed_query(text: str)` | `list[float]` | 将单个查询/句子转换为一个向量 |","table":"table-24"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-230","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#核心方法","content":"| 方法                                  | 返回值                 | 说明                      |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `embed_documents(texts: list[str])` | `list[list[float]]` | 将多个文档转换为向量列表（**批量更高效**） |","table":"table-24"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-231","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#核心方法","content":"> **性能提示：** 索引大批量文档时，优先使用 `embed_documents` 而非循环调用 `embed_query`。OpenAI 等 API 提供商会自动批处理，LangChain 默认 `chunk_size=1000`，远快于逐条调用。"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-232","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                       | 提供商    | 维度   | 上下文长度 | 特点        |\n| ------------------------ | ------ | ---- | ----- | --------- |\n| `text-embedding-3-large` | OpenAI | 3072 | 8191  | 最高精度，成本较高 |","table":"table-25"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-233","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                       | 提供商    | 维度   | 上下文长度 | 特点              |\n| ------------------------ | ------ | ---- | ----- | --------------- |\n| `text-embedding-3-small` | OpenAI | 1536 | 8191  | 性价比高，**推荐起步选择** |","table":"table-25"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-234","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                       | 提供商    | 维度   | 上下文长度 | 特点        |\n| ------------------------ | ------ | ---- | ----- | --------- |\n| `text-embedding-ada-002` | OpenAI | 1536 | 8191  | 旧版，不推荐新项目 |","table":"table-25"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-235","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                   | 提供商    | 维度   | 上下文长度 | 特点      |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ---- | ----- | ------- |\n| `embed-english-v3.0` | Cohere | 1024 | 512   | 英文场景精度高 |","table":"table-25"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-236","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型            | 提供商  | 维度   | 上下文长度 | 特点              |\n| ------------- | ---- | ---- | ----- | --------------- |\n| `BAAI/bge-m3` | BAAI | 1024 | 8192  | 开源首选，支持多语言和稀疏检索 |","table":"table-25"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-237","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                       | 提供商  | 维度  | 上下文长度 | 特点     |\n| ------------------------ | ---- | --- | ----- | ------ |\n| `BAAI/bge-small-zh-v1.5` | BAAI | 512 | 512   | 轻量中文模型 |","table":"table-25"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-238","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                           | 提供商       | 维度       | 上下文长度 | 特点                         |\n| ---------------------------- | --------- | -------- | ----- | -------------------------- |\n| `intfloat/multilingual-e5-*` | Microsoft | 384-1024 | 512   | 开源多语言，需配合 query/passage 前缀 |","table":"table-25"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-239","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                      | 提供商   | 维度  | 上下文长度 | 特点                    |\n| ----------------------- | ----- | --- | ----- | --------------------- |\n| `nomic-embed-text-v1.5` | Nomic | 768 | 8192  | 开源，可本地部署（Ollama 一键拉取） |","table":"table-25"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-240","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用-embedding-模型对比","content":"| 模型                       | 提供商     | 维度        | 上下文长度 | 特点         |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | --------- | ----- | ---------- |\n| `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-*` | Alibaba | 1024-3584 | 8192  | 阿里开源，中英文优秀 |","table":"table-25"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-241","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#进阶用法","content":"**截断向量维度**（减小存储 & 加速检索）："},"1374":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-242","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#进阶用法","content":"**缓存 Embedding 结果**（避免重复计算，加速开发）："},"1375":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-243","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#进阶用法","content":"**自定义相似度计算**："},"1376":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-244","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"在实际项目中选择 Embedding 模型时，需要从多个维度综合权衡："},"1377":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-245","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**① 质量（Quality）**"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-246","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"参考 MTEB 排行榜，它从检索、聚类、分类、重排序等多个维度对 Embedding 模型进行基准测试，是行业标准参考。按你的语言和任务筛选（RAG 场景以检索任务为主）。"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-247","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"> ⚠️ 排行榜分数不一定能直接迁移到自己的数据。选定模型后建议在自有数据上跑小规模评估。"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-248","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**② 成本（Cost）**"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-249","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 类型         | 计费方式                   | 适用场景          |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| **托管 API** | 每百万 tokens 几美分到 \\$0.15 | 查询量大但不想运维基础设施 |","table":"table-26"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-250","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 类型       | 计费方式           | 适用场景             |\n| -------- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| **本地开源** | 零调用成本（硬件一次性投入） | 数据敏感不能出域、低预算长期运行 |","table":"table-26"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-251","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 类型        | 计费方式      | 适用场景                             |\n| --------- | --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| **自托管服务** | 硬件 + 运维成本 | 中等规模生产（单 GPU 用 TEI 托管通常比 API 便宜） |","table":"table-26"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-252","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**③ 延迟（Latency）**"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-253","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 方式           | 单次请求耗时    |\n| ------------ | --------- |\n| 托管 API（网络传输） | ~50-200ms |","table":"table-27"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-254","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 方式         | 单次请求耗时                          |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 本地小模型（CPU） | ~10-100ms（如 `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`） |","table":"table-27"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-255","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 方式         | 单次请求耗时    |\n| ---------- | --------- |\n| 本地大模型（CPU） | ~50-500ms |","table":"table-27"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-256","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 方式      | 单次请求耗时        |\n| ------- | ------------- |\n| 本地（GPU） | 通常更快于往返托管 API |","table":"table-27"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-257","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"批量索引时吞吐量比单次延迟更重要，可用 `encode_kwargs={\"batch_size\": 64}` 调优。"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-258","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**④ 向量维度（Dimensionality）**"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-259","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度  | 典型模型               | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| --- | ------------------ | --------- | ---- |\n| 384 | `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` | 最低        | 入门级  |","table":"table-28"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-260","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度  | 典型模型          | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| --- | ------------- | --------- | ---- |\n| 512 | `bge-small-*` | 低         | 小型够用 |","table":"table-28"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-261","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度  | 典型模型                                    | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- | --------- | ---- |\n| 768 | `all-mpnet-base-v2`, `nomic-embed-text` | 中等        | 良好   |","table":"table-28"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-262","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度   | 典型模型                           | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | --------- | ---- |\n| 1024 | `bge-large`, Cohere v3, Voyage | 中高        | 高    |","table":"table-28"},"1395":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-263","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度   | 典型模型                                 | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------ | --------- | ---- |\n| 1536 | `text-embedding-3-small`, Qwen3-0.6B | 高         | 很高   |","table":"table-28"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-264","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 维度    | 典型模型                                  | 存储 & 计算成本 | 精度趋势 |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------- | --------- | ---- |\n| 3072+ | `text-embedding-3-large`, Qwen3-4B/8B | 最高        | 最高   |","table":"table-28"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-265","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"`text-embedding-3-*` 系列支持**维度截断**：可将 3072 维截断到 256/512/1024 等，质量损失可控，是节省存储和检索计算的好手段。"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-266","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**⑤ 上下文长度（Context Length）**"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-267","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| Token 限制 | 典型模型                                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 512      | 经典 Sentence Transformers（`all-mpnet-base-v2`, classic BGE） |","table":"table-29"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-268","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| Token 限制 | 典型模型                                                                         |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 8192     | `bge-m3`, `nomic-embed-text`, `Qwen3-Embedding`, OpenAI `text-embedding-3-*` |","table":"table-29"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-269","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"如果 chunk 较长（满页技术文档、法律条款），必须选长上下文模型；短 chunk 时 512 限制基本够用。"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-270","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**⑥ 多语言支持**"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-271","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 类型    | 推荐模型                                                                  |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 开源多语言 | `BAAI/bge-m3`, `intfloat/multilingual-e5-*`, `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-*` |","table":"table-30"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-272","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"| 类型    | 推荐模型                                                        |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 托管多语言 | Cohere `embed-multilingual-v3`, OpenAI `text-embedding-3-*` |","table":"table-30"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-273","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"**⑦ Query/Document 前缀提示词**"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-274","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#选择模型时的考量因素","content":"E5、BGE、Qwen3-Embedding、GTE 等系列在训练时区分 Query 和 Document。以 E5 为例，Document 前需加 `\"query: \"` 前缀，Query 前需加 `\"passage: \"` 前缀。用错前缀是常见的质量退化原因，需在 `encode_kwargs` 中显式配置："},"1407":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-275","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"单向量稠密嵌入是 RAG 的默认范式，但在某些场景下可以考虑更高级的方案："},"1408":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-276","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"**① 稀疏检索 & 混合检索（Hybrid Retrieval）**"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-277","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"稠密向量在处理精确匹配查询（产品编码、命名实体、代码标识符）时不如关键词索引有效。混合检索将稠密向量索引与 BM25 或稀疏神经索引（如 SPLADE、`BAAI/bge-m3` 输出的稀疏向量）结合，取长补短："},"1410":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-278","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"| 检索方式     | 优势             | 局限             |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| **稠密向量** | 语义理解强、跨语言、改写鲁棒 | 精确匹配差（ID、专业术语） |","table":"table-31"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-279","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"| 检索方式          | 优势              | 局限        |\n| ------------- | --------------- | --------- |\n| **稀疏 (BM25)** | 精确匹配强、无需模型、解释性好 | 同义词/改写不鲁棒 |","table":"table-31"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-280","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"| 检索方式     | 优势             | 局限             |\n| -------- | -------------- | -------------- |\n| **混合检索** | 两者兼顾，覆盖语义和精确匹配 | 需要维护两套索引，复杂度略高 |","table":"table-31"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-281","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"**② 晚期交互 & 多向量（Late Interaction / Multi-Vector）**"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-282","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"ColBERT 风格的模型为**每个 token** 都生成一个向量（而非每个 chunk 一个），然后在查询时通过晚期交互方式计算 token 级别的相关性分数："},"1415":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-283","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"| 类型      | 特点                        | 代价      |\n| ------- | ------------------------- | ------- |\n| **单向量** | 每 chunk 一个向量，存储小、速度快，实现简单 | 精确度上限较低 |","table":"table-32"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-284","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"| 类型      | 特点                     | 代价         |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | ---------- |\n| **多向量** | 每 token 一个向量，对复杂查询精度更高 | 存储更大、索引更复杂 |","table":"table-32"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-285","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"当前开源模型：`jinaai/jina-colbert-v2`、`answerdotai/answerai-colbert-small-v1`、`lightonai/LateOn`。使用这些模型需要专门的索引支持（Vespa、Qdrant 多向量功能、或 PyLate）。LangChain 内置检索器以单向量嵌入为目标。"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-286","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#超越单向量稠密嵌入","content":"> ⚠️ 这些方案目前处于较前沿的阶段，除非有明确证据表明单向量检索在你的场景不够用，否则建议先用简单方案建立基线，再按需升级。"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-287","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#向量数据库vector-stores","content":"向量数据库用于存储 Embedding 向量，并提供高效的相似度检索能力。"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-288","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库     | 类型  | 特点                     |\n| ------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `FAISS` | 内存  | Facebook 开源，高性能，适合本地开发 |","table":"table-33"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-289","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库        | 类型     | 特点       |\n| ---------- | ------ | -------- |\n| `ChromaDB` | 内存/持久化 | 轻量级，开箱即用 |","table":"table-33"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-290","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库                   | 类型  | 特点                  |\n| --------------------- | --- | ------------------- |\n| `InMemoryVectorStore` | 内存  | LangChain 内置，无需额外安装 |","table":"table-33"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-291","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库        | 类型  | 特点        |\n| ---------- | --- | --------- |\n| `Pinecone` | 云服务 | 托管服务，无需运维 |","table":"table-33"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-292","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库        | 类型    | 特点     |\n| ---------- | ----- | ------ |\n| `Weaviate` | 自托管/云 | 支持混合检索 |","table":"table-33"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-293","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库      | 类型  | 特点          |\n| -------- | --- | ----------- |\n| `Milvus` | 自托管 | 高性能，适合大规模数据 |","table":"table-33"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-294","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库        | 类型            | 特点              |\n| ---------- | ------------- | --------------- |\n| `PGVector` | PostgreSQL 扩展 | 利用现有 PostgreSQL |","table":"table-33"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-295","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#常用向量数据库","content":"| 数据库      | 类型    | 特点          |\n| -------- | ----- | ----------- |\n| `Qdrant` | 自托管/云 | Rust 实现，高性能 |","table":"table-33"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-296","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#检索器retrievers","content":"检索器是 RAG 系统中负责根据用户问题查找相关文档的组件。`VectorStore` 可以直接转换为检索器："},"1429":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-297","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#检索类型","content":"| 检索类型         | 说明            |\n| ------------ | ------------- |\n| `similarity` | 基于向量相似度检索（默认） |","table":"table-34"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-298","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#检索类型","content":"| 检索类型  | 说明                 |\n| ----- | ------------------ |\n| `mmr` | 最大边际相关性（平