type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag-的优势","content":"| 特性   | 传统 RAG   | Agentic RAG |\n| ---- | -------- | ----------- |\n| 查询策略 | 直接使用用户问题 | 可改写、分解查询    |","table":"table-35"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-308","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag-的优势","content":"| 特性   | 传统 RAG | Agentic RAG |\n| ---- | ------ | ----------- |\n| 结果判断 | 无      | 判断是否需要再次检索  |","table":"table-35"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-309","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag-的优势","content":"| 特性    | 传统 RAG | Agentic RAG |\n| ----- | ------ | ----------- |\n| 多工具调用 | 不支持    | 支持多种检索工具    |","table":"table-35"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-310","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#agentic-rag-的优势","content":"| 特性   | 传统 RAG | Agentic RAG |\n| ---- | ------ | ----------- |\n| 复杂问题 | 效果一般   | 可分步推理       |","table":"table-35"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-311","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"RAG 和微调是两种让模型掌握特定知识的主要方式，各有优劣："},"1444":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-312","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度       | RAG          | 微调       |\n| -------- | ------------ | -------- |\n| **知识更新** | 实时更新，修改知识库即可 | 需要重新训练模型 |","table":"table-36"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-313","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度     | RAG          | 微调          |\n| ------ | ------------ | ----------- |\n| **成本** | 无需训练，运行时成本较高 | 训练成本高，推理成本低 |","table":"table-36"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-314","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度       | RAG        | 微调       |\n| -------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| **可解释性** | 可追溯到具体来源文档 | 难以追溯知识来源 |","table":"table-36"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-315","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度       | RAG           | 微调         |\n| -------- | ------------- | ---------- |\n| **适用场景** | 知识频繁更新、需要引用来源 | 特定风格/格式的生成 |","table":"table-36"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-316","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度       | RAG         | 微调     |\n| -------- | ----------- | ------ |\n| **幻觉控制** | 较好，基于检索文档生成 | 仍有幻觉风险 |","table":"table-36"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-317","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"| 维度        | RAG        | 微调         |\n| --------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| **上下文长度** | 受模型上下文窗口限制 | 知识内化在模型参数中 |","table":"table-36"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-318","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#rag-vs-微调fine-tuning","content":"**简单决策**：如果知识频繁更新或需要引用来源，选择 RAG；如果需要模型学习特定的输出风格或格式，选择微调。两者也可以结合使用。"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-319","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#学习资源","content":"LangChain RAG 教程"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-320","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#学习资源","content":"RAG From Scratch 系列"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-321","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#学习资源","content":"LangChain 检索文档"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-322","page_id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag#学习资源","content":"LangChain 文本切分器"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/ai/langchain/rag-323","pa