ntent":"**LangChain 1.x** 现在聚焦于 Agent 开发，核心入口是 create_agent，围绕 Agent 提供模型、工具、消息、结构化输出、Middleware` 和记忆管理等高层抽象。"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-70","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"**LangGraph** 是更底层的编排框架与 Agent Runtime，负责复杂工作流和有状态 Agent 的执行，提供持久化、流式输出、Durable Execution、Human-in-the-loop 等运行时能力。create_agent 底层基于 LangGraph` 实现。"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-71","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"二者的定位对比如下："},"1720":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-72","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"| 对比维度 | LangChain    | LangGraph              |\n| ---- | ------------ | ---------------------- |\n| 定位   | Agent 高层开发框架 | 底层编排框架 & Agent Runtime |","table":"table-0"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-73","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"| 对比维度 | LangChain      | LangGraph                    |\n| ---- | -------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 核心入口 | `create_agent` | `StateGraph` / `@entrypoint` |","table":"table-0"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-74","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"| 对比维度 | LangChain      | LangGraph              |\n| ---- | -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 结构直接的 Agent 应用 | 复杂工作流、持久化状态、长时间运行、人工介入 |","table":"table-0"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-75","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"| 对比维度 | LangChain    | LangGraph     |\n| ---- | ------------ | ------------- |\n| 流程控制 | Agent 循环自动管理 | 精细控制节点、边、条件分支 |","table":"table-0"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-76","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"| 对比维度 | LangChain | LangGraph |\n| ---- | --------- | --------- |\n| 学习成本 | 较低        | 较高        |","table":"table-0"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-77","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"> `LangChain` 提供易于使用的 Agent 高层抽象，`LangGraph` 提供可靠、可持久化且可精细控制的底层执行能力。"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-78","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#langgraph和langchain的版本迭代及定位","content":"对于大多数 Agent 项目，从 LangChain 的 create_agent 开始即可；需要复杂工作流编排、确定性步骤与 Agent 步骤混合、长时间运行或底层状态控制时，再引入 LangGraph。"},"1727":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-79","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"LangGraph 运行时主要由三个基本要素构成：State（状态）、Node（节点） 和 Edge（边）"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-80","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"**State（状态）**：LangGraph 运行过程中的共享数据结构，用于表示应用在某一时刻的状态快照。它承载了图运行所需的上下文信息、中间结果和后续节点需要读取的数据，是节点之间传递信息的核心载体。它与我们在学习 LangChain Agent 时使用的 State 是同一概念。"},"1729":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-81","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"**Node（节点）**：LangGraph 中的具体执行单元，通常实现为一个函数。节点会读取当前 State，执行相应的业务逻辑，并返回对 State 的局部更新。节点本身并不直接修改全局状态，状态的合并与提交由运行时统一完成。"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-82","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"**Edges（边）**：用于定义节点之间的流转关系，决定一个节点执行完成后下一步应该进入哪个节点。Edge 可以是固定流转，也可以根据当前 State 进行条件判断，从而实现分支、循环等复杂控制流程。"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-83","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"下图展示了一个非常简单的运行图，只有两个计算节点，其拓扑结构为"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-84","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#构成图的基本要素","content":"如下图所示"},"1733":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-85","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"LangGraph 的图运行过程基于 Superstep（超步） 来组织和推进。Superstep 可以理解为图运行过程中的一次”单步循环”。一次图运行过程从开始到结束，就是由一系列连续的 Superstep 串联而成。"},"1734":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-86","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"下文以 **node_1执行完毕后的Superstep** 为例说明。"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-87","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"每个 Superstep 通常可以分为三个阶段："},"1736":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-88","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"计划/路由阶段（Plan / Routing）：根据当前的 State（状态） 和 Edge（边） 的逻辑，确定本轮超步中应该被执行的节点。"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-89","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"执行阶段（Execution）：运行本轮被选中的节点。如果本轮有多个节点同时被触发，它们会并行执行。每个节点都会基于本轮开始时的状态快照进行计算，并输出各自对状态的局部更新。在本阶段中，一个节点产生的更新不会立即被其他节点读取到。"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-90","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"状态更新/提交阶段（Update / Commit）：当本轮所有节点都执行完成后，LangGraph 会将它们的输出统一合并到 State 中，生成新的状态快照。这个新状态会作为下一轮 Superstep 的输入。"},"1739":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-91","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"完整的运行流程查看："},"1740":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-92","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#图运行过程","content":"其中和Checkpoint相关的部分，学习相关内容后再看。"},"1741":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-93","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api-vs-functional-api","content":"LangGraph 提供了两种不同的 API 来构建运行图：`Graph API`（图式 API） 和 `Functional API`（函数式 API）。这两种 API 共享相同的底层运行时，可以在同一应用程序中协同使用，但它们针对不同的使用场景和开发偏好而设计。"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-94","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"Graph API 采用声明式方式构建工作流。开发者需要显式定义 State、Node 和 Edge，将业务流程组织成一个可视化的图结构。"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-95","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"当流程中存在较复杂的分支、多个节点之间共享状态、并行执行、结果汇聚，或者需要通过图结构帮助调试和团队协作时，更适合使用 Graph API。官方文档也明确建议，在需要复杂流程可视化、显式状态管理、多条件分支、并行路径以及团队协作时，优先选择 Graph API。"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-96","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"总之："},"1745":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-97","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"> Graph API 更适合构建结构清晰、节点关系复杂、需要长期维护的工作流。"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-98","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"典型场景包括："},"1747":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-99","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"| 场景      | 说明                        |\n| ------- | ------------------------- |\n| 多节点复杂流程 | 流程中存在多个处理节点，需要清晰表达节点之间的关系 |","table":"table-1"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-100","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"| 场景     | 说明                      |\n| ------ | ----------------------- |\n| 条件分支较多 | 根据 State 中的不同字段决定后续执行路径 |","table":"table-1"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-101","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"| 场景        | 说明              |\n| --------- | --------------- |\n| 并行执行与结果汇聚 | 多个节点并行运行，之后汇总结果 |","table":"table-1"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-102","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"| 场景      | 说明                   |\n| ------- | -------------------- |\n| 多组件共享状态 | 多个节点都需要读写同一个全局 State |","table":"table-1"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-103","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#graph-api","content":"| 场景      | 说明               |\n| ------- | ---------------- |\n| 需要图结构展示 | 便于调试、讲解、文档化和团队协作 |","table":"table-1"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-104","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#functional-api","content":"Functional API 采用命令式方式构建工作流，更接近普通 Python 函数调用。开发者可以使用 `@entrypoint` 定义工作流入口，使用 `@task` 定义可被检查点记录的任务，然后在函数内部使用普通的 `if/else`、循环和函数调用来组织流程。官方文档指出，当已有过程式代码需要最小改造、流程主要是线性的、分支逻辑较简单、希望快速原型验证时，更适合使用 Functional API。"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-105","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#functional-api","content":"可以这样理解："},"1754":{"id":