%A8#校验行为","content":"学习LangChain的结构化输出时我们提到：Pydantic对格式要求最严格，如果模型返回的内容不符合结构化Schema的要求，则抛出`ValidationError`。而其余方式都不会对模型的返回结果进行校验，即便模型返回的内容不符合结构化要求，也会原样返回给用户。"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-158","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#校验行为","content":"而作为LangGraph计算图的状态时，这三种方式都要求字段名称完全一致。只是处理方式不同。具体规则如下"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-159","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#typeddict-1","content":"TypedDict将输入字段视为字典的`Key`，不匹配时抛出`KeyError`异常。"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-160","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#dataclass-1","content":"dataclass将输入字段视为类的`属性`，不匹配时抛出`TypeError（类型错误）`异常。"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-161","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#pydantic-1","content":"Pydantic对输入字段进行校验，不匹配时抛出`ValidationError`异常。"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-162","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#节点返回字段不匹配","content":"图节点返回的是对于状态的更新，如果返回字段和状态字段不匹配，上述三种Schema定义方式的行为是统一的：状态更新会被忽略。"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-163","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#推荐用法","content":"在实际使用中，推荐优先使用 `TypedDict` 定义 LangGraph 状态图的 State Schema。"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-164","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#推荐用法","content":"大多数官方案例也采用 `TypedDict` 方式定义状态 `Schema`。这种方式写法简洁、结构清晰，能够直接描述状态中包含哪些字段，以及每个字段对应的数据类型，非常适合用于定义图运行过程中的共享状态。"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-165","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#推荐用法","content":"相比普通 `dict`，`TypedDict` 可以提供更明确的字段约束和类型提示；相比 `dataclass`，`TypedDict` 更贴近 LangGraph 中状态的更新方式，因为节点通常返回的是表示“部分状态更新”的字典，而不是完整对象；相比 `Pydantic BaseModel`，它又更加轻量，不会引入额外的数据校验开销。因此，在没有复杂校验需求的情况下，`TypedDict` 是定义 LangGraph State Schema 的首选方式。"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-166","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#什么是state-reducer","content":"State Reducer 是 LangGraph 中用于合并状态更新的核心机制。在 LangGraph 的 `StateGraph` 中，每个节点可以读取和写入共享状态，而 Reducer 定义了如何将多个节点对同一状态键的更新合并"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-167","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#什么是state-reducer","content":"Reducer 的核心特征："},"1816":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-168","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#什么是state-reducer","content":"函数签名：`(Value, Value) -> Value`，接收当前值和更新值，返回合并后的新值"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-169","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#什么是state-reducer","content":"注解定义：通过 `Annotated[Type, reducer_function]` 为状态键指定 Reducer"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-170","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#什么是state-reducer","content":"默认行为：未指定 Reducer 的状态键使用覆盖策略（Last-Write-Wins）"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-171","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"Reducer 本质上是一个二元合并函数，用于定义当同一个字段产生多个更新值时，LangGraph 应该如何将这些值合并为一个最终结果。"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-172","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"函数签名：`(Value, Value) -> Value`"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-173","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"示例代码如下："},"1822":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-174","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"其中，`my_reducer` 用于处理 `list[str]` 类型的数据。它接收两个列表参数："},"1823":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-175","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"`left`：当前已累计的状态值；"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-176","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"`right`：本次待合并的新值。"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-177","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"函数内部通过 `left + right` 将两个列表合并，并返回合并后的结果。"},"1826":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-178","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"因此，该 Reducer 的作用是：当某个状态字段存在多次列表更新时，将这些列表内容追加合并，而不是直接覆盖原值。"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-179","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#定义reducer函数","content":"运行结果如下"},"1828":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-180","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"在 LangGraph 中，Reducer 通常通过 Python 的 `typing.Annotated` 与状态字段进行关联。"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-181","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"`Annotated[]` 是 Python 提供的一种类型注解扩展机制，用于在原始类型之外附加额外的元数据信息。需要注意的是，`Annotated[]` 本身并不规定这些元数据的具体含义，它只负责在类型注解中保留这些信息。"},"1830":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-182","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"严格来说，`Annotated` 的第一个参数是被注解的原始类型，后续参数是附加的元数据。至于这些元数据表示什么、如何解析，则由使用它的框架或工具自行决定。"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-183","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"在 LangGraph 中，框架利用这一机制，将状态字段的类型和 Reducer 规则同时声明在字段定义中。其基本形式如下："},"1832":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-184","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"其中："},"1833":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-185","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#将reducer和状态字段关联","content":"`Type`：表示状态字段的数据类型；"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5