ocs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"在某些场景下，我们可能并不希望继续执行 `Reducer` 的聚合逻辑，而是希望本次更新直接覆盖旧值。这时可以使用 `Overwrite`。"},"1893":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-245","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"`Overwrite` 的作用是：告诉 LangGraph 本次状态更新不走该字段原本定义的 `Reducer`，而是直接用新值覆盖状态中的旧值。"},"1894":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-246","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"需要注意的是，`Overwrite` 只影响当前这一次更新，并不会修改状态字段本身的 `Reducer` 定义。后续节点如果继续正常返回该字段的更新值，仍然会按照原来的 `Reducer` 逻辑进行合并。"},"1895":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-247","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"示例代码如下："},"1896":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-248","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"输出如下"},"1897":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-249","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"上述代码中："},"1898":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-250","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"`logs` 字段绑定了 `operator.add()` 函数"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-251","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"如果没有 `Overwrite`，则最终输出的 `logs` 的值应为 `['START', 'node_a', 'node_b', 'node_c']`"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-252","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"`node_b` 返回更新时，用 `Overwrite` 包裹了 `logs` 字段的值，那么当前状态的 `logs` 会被 `[\"node_b\"]` 覆盖，因此最终输出的 `logs` 字段值变成了 `['node_b', 'node_c']`"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-253","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#overwrite绕过reducer","content":"`id` 字段按照默认行为，保留最后一次更新的值。"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-254","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"`LangGraph` 支持在一个图中使用多个状态 Schema，用于区分图的外部输入、外部输出、内部共享状态以及节点间的临时状态。"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-255","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"常见状态类型可以分为以下几类："},"1904":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-256","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"全局状态 / 内部状态：图内部主要使用的状态，创建 `StateGraph` 时传递给 `state_schema` 参数。它通常包含图运行过程中需要读写的大部分字段。"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-257","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"输入状态：图对外接收输入时使用的状态，创建 `StateGraph` 时传递给 `input_schema` 参数。它用于约束调用图时允许传入哪些字段。"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-258","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"输出状态：图最终对外返回结果时使用的状态，创建 `StateGraph` 时传递给 `output_schema` 参数。它用于约束图运行结束后只返回哪些字段。"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-259","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"私有状态：图内部节点之间传递的临时状态，通常不作为图的输入，也不作为图的最终输出。它可以通过节点函数的入参类型注解声明，并在节点返回值中写入。"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-260","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态类型","content":"需要注意，输入状态和输出状态主要面向图的边界，即“图如何接收外部输入”和“图如何返回外部结果”；而全局状态和私有状态主要面向图内部节点之间的数据传递。"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-261","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"本节主要说明 `LangGraph` 状态设计中的规范。以下规则属于工程上的最佳实践，违反这些规范未必一定导致程序报错，但容易降低代码的可读性和可维护性。"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-262","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"输入状态和输出状态通常应是全局状态的子集\n输入状态描述图对外需要接收的数据，输出状态描述图最终需要返回的数据。通常情况下，它们都应该是全局状态的一部分。\n如："},"1911":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-263","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"其中，`InputState` 和 `OutputState` 的所有字段均存在于 `OverAllState` 中。"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-264","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"私有状态和全局状态应尽量避免字段重名\n私有状态的定位是图内部某些节点之间传递的临时字段。如果私有状态字段和全局状态字段重名，虽然某些情况下程序仍然可以运行，但容易让人误以为该字段是全局共享字段，从而造成理解混乱。\n因此，推荐让私有状态字段和全局状态字段保持清晰边界。"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-265","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"节点函数应明确声明入参状态类型和返回状态类型\n节点函数的第一个参数通常是当前节点可读取的状态。通过类型注解声明该参数，可以明确表达该节点需要读取哪些字段。\n同时，给节点函数声明返回状态类型，也可以帮助阅读者理解该节点会更新哪些字段。\n例如："},"1914":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-266","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"节点函数中不应该访问入参状态类型中不存在的字段\n节点实际接收到的状态会按照其入参类型进行裁剪。因此，如果节点入参声明为 `InputState`，就不应该在节点内部访问 `InputState` 中不存在的字段。\n例如："},"1915":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-267","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"如果在该函数中访问："},"1916":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-268","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"而 `nickname` 不属于 `InputState`，运行时就可能抛出 `KeyError`。"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-269","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#设计规范","content":"节点函数返回的字典应尽量和返回类型注解保持一致\n从 Python 类型注解的角度看，函数返回类型只是静态提示，运行时不会自动强制校验。\n从 LangGraph 的运行机制看，节点返回的是对状态的部分更新，不是完整状态。只要返回字段已经被图记录为可用状态字段，LangGraph 就可以将其作为状态更新处理。\n不过，从工程规范上讲，节点返回字典中的字段最好和函数返回类型注解保持一致，这样更利于阅读、调试和维护。"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-270","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#源码层面的约束","content":"本节从底层机制角度说明 `LangGraph` 如何记录、裁剪和更新状态。"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-271","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"`LangGraph` 的状态并不是简单保存在一个普通字典中，而是会被拆分成多个可读写的状态字段。每个状态字段在底层通常对应一个 `Channel`。"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-272","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"这些状态字段会在不同阶段被记录到状态图中。"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-273","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"`StateGraph` 记录状态字段的核心方法是 `_add_schema()`\n`_add_schema()` 会解析传入的状态 Schema，并将其中声明的字段记录到图中，使这些字段成为图运行时可以读写的状态字段。"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-274","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"创建 `StateGraph` 时，会记录 `state_schema`、`input_schema` 和 `output_schema` 中的字段\n当创建状态图时："},"1923":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-275","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"LangGraph 会解析这些 Schema，并将其中涉及的字段加入图的状态管理体系。"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-276","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8#状态的记录","content":"调用 `add_node()` 添加节点时，也可能记录节点入参声明的状态 Schema\n当添加节点时，`LangGraph` 会根据节点函数第一个参数的类型注解推断该节点的输入状态类型。\n如果这个输入状态类型之前没有被图记录过，LangGraph 也会通过 `_add_schema()` 将其加入图中。\n这也是私有状态能够生效的原因。\n例如："},"1925":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8-277","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-LangGraph%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/01-Lan