ontent":"相比手动调用多次 **`add_node`** 和 **`add_edge`**，**`add_sequence`** 更适合用于构建简单的线性执行流程。"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-105","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"在 LangGraph 中，图的终止并不完全依赖某个真实执行的特殊节点。"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-106","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"从运行机制上看，LangGraph 会在每个 **`SuperStep`** 开始时，根据当前发生更新的 **`Channel`** 以及节点之间的触发关系，计算本轮需要执行的任务列表。如果没有新的节点被激活，也就没有新的任务需要执行，图运行自然结束。"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-107","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"需要注意的是，**`END` 并不是运行阶段真正执行的节点**。也就是说，指向 **`END`** 的边不会像指向普通节点的边那样，触发一个真实的节点任务。它更多用于表达图结构中的“终止语义”：当前路径执行到这里即可结束。"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-108","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"因此，在一些简单的线性流程中，即使省略指向 **`END`** 的边，最后一个节点执行完成后，如果没有后续节点被触发，图也可以正常结束。"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-109","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"示例如下："},"2108":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-110","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"输出如下"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-111","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"在这个例子中，虽然没有显式添加："},"2110":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-112","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"但是 **`node_b`** 执行完成后，没有新的节点被触发，图运行会自然结束。"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-113","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"不过，**可以省略指向 `END` 的边，并不表示 `END` 没有意义**。"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-114","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"显式添加 **`END`** 边可以让图结构更加完整，也能更清晰地表达“流程到此结束”的语义。尤其是在分支、条件跳转、循环退出等场景中，显式指向 **`END`** 通常更利于阅读和维护。"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-115","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"和 **`END`** 不同，**`START` 通常不能省略**。因为 **`START`** 不只是一个语义上的起点标记，它还用于告诉 LangGraph：图运行时应当从哪些节点开始执行。也就是说，下面这条边是启动图执行的关键："},"2114":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-116","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"如果没有从 **`START`** 出发的边，或者没有通过其他方式指定入口节点，LangGraph 就无法确定图的初始执行节点。"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-117","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#省略指向-end-的边","content":"因此，在实际开发中，建议保留指向 **`END`** 的边。虽然在某些简单流程中省略这些边也能正常运行，但显式添加它们，可以让图结构更加完整、语义更加清晰，便于后续维护。"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-118","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#静态分支static-branch","content":"**定义**：节点的下游候选节点 **在图编译阶段就完全确定**，只是运行时根据条件选择哪条边执行。"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-119","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#静态分支static-branch","content":"特点："},"2118":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-120","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#静态分支static-branch","content":"下游节点集合固定，数量、目标在编译时确定"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-121","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#静态分支static-branch","content":"运行时可选择**一个或多个**下游目标"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-122","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A