，运行时会根据 **`updated_channels`** 判断是否还有新的节点需要被触发。"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-201","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#底层实现机制","content":"如果 **`updated_channels`** 和 **`trigger_to_nodes`** 的 key 没有交集，说明当前没有新的普通节点需要继续执行，常规运行流程已结束。"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-202","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#底层实现机制","content":"此时，**`LangGraph`** 运行时会调用所有 **`Channel`** 的 **`finish()`** 方法。"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-203","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#底层实现机制","content":"对于普通 **`Channel`** ，**`finish()`** 通常不会产生新的触发效果；但对于 **`LastValueAfterFinish`** 类型通道，首次调用 **`finish()`** 时，会将内部的 **`finished`** 标记设置为 **`True`**，并返回 **`True`**。"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-204","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#底层实现机制","content":"一旦 **`finished=True`**，该通道的 **`is_available()`** 就会变为 **`