docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-393","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"**`LangGraph`** 运行节点时，会向节点函数注入运行时配置对象 **`config`**。该对象通常使用 **`RunnableConfig`** 类型标注，用于记录本次运行的配置信息和部分运行时元数据。"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-394","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"节点函数的第一个参数必须是运行时状态。如果需要访问运行时配置，可以在状态参数之后声明额外参数 **`config`**。此时，**`LangGraph`** 会在调用节点函数之前，将运行时配置对象以关键字参数的方式传入节点函数。"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-395","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"**`config`** 的元数据中记录了当前节点所在的 **`SuperStep`** 序号，可以通过下面的方式获取："},"2394":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-396","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"需要注意的是，这里的步骤编号对应图运行过程中的 **`SuperStep`**，从 `1` 开始计数。对于顺序执行的节点，不同节点通常位于不同的 **`SuperStep`**；对于并行执行的节点，多个节点可能处于同一个 **`SuperStep`**，因此它们读取到的 **`langgraph_step`** 可能相同。"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-397","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"**示例如下**"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-398","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"运行结果如下"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-399","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#运行时配置对象config","content":"可以看到，**`node_a`**、**`node_b`**、**`node_c`** 是顺序执行的三个节点，因此分别处于第 **`1`**、**`2`**、**`3`** 个 **`SuperStep`**。"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-400","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#配置递归限制","content":"**`recursion_limit`** 表示单次图运行过程中允许执行的最大 **`SuperStep`** 数量。可以在调用运行图时通过 **`config`** 显式配置："},"2399":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-401","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#配置递归限制","content":"需要注意的是，**`recursion_limit` 的默认值可能随版本变化、运行环境切换而变化**。"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-402","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#版本的变化","content":"官方文档提到：从 **`LangGraph 1.0.6`** 开始，**`recursion_limit`** 默认为 **`1000`**，本项目运行在 **`LangGraph 1.1.2`** 版本，实测发现 **`recursion_limit`** 默认为 **`10000`**。"},"2401":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-403","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"阅读源码可知，**`LangGraph`** 运行时可能从多个来源读取默认值"},"2402":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-404","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"如下："},"2403":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-405","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"| 来源                                    | 默认值      | 说明                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`langchain_core.runnables.config`** | **`25`** | **`RunnableConfig`** 中定义的默认值，**`LangChain Agent`** 运行时生效 |","table":"table-2"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-406","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"| 来源                                | 默认值         | 说明                                                         |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`langgraph._internal._config`** | **`10000`** | **`LangGraph`** 本地图运行时内部配置中的默认值，自定义 **`LangGraph`** 图结构时生效 |","table":"table-2"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-407","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"| 来源                               | 默认值         | 说明                                 |\n| -------------------------------- | ----------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **`langgraph_api.utils.config`** | **`10011`** | **`LangGraph API / 服务侧`**相关配置中的默认值 |","table":"table-2"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-408","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#环境的变化","content":"对于自定义图结构的 **`LangGraph`** 运行时，其默认值取自 **`langgraph._internal._config`**，所以调试看到的默认值为 **`10000`**。"},"2407":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-409","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#最佳实践","content":"在实际开发中，建议显式传入 **`recursion_limit`**，避免不同版本、不同运行入口或不同部署方式下默认值不同导致实际运行结果和预期不符。"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-410","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"**`RemainingSteps`** 是 **`LangGraph`** 提供的特殊托管值，表示**剩余可用步数**，由运行时维护。"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-411","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"**`LangGraph`** 运行时会根据当前步数和 **`recursion_limit`** 计算剩余步数，并填充到 **`RemainingSteps`** 类型的状态字段中。开发者可以在状态中声明一个 **`RemainingSteps`** 类型的字段，来获取**剩余可用步数**。"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-412","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"借助 **`RemainingSteps`**，开发者可以在图内部提前判断剩余步数是否充足，并根据剩余步数动态路由。例如，当剩余步数较少时，不再继续循环，而是路由到 **`END`** 或兜底节点，从而让运行图正常结束。"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-413","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"这种方式是在达到递归限制之前主动处理，因此称为 **主动方法（Proactive Approach）**。"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-414","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"**示例如下**"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-415","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"**输出如下**"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-416","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"本例中，**`recursion_limit`** 被显式设置为 **`10`**。"},"2415":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-417","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"第 **`1`** 个 **`SuperStep`** 执行时，剩余步数为 **`9`**；第 **`2`** 个 **`SuperStep`** 执行时，剩余步数为 **`8`**；依次类推... 当前**超步序号**和**剩余步数之和**等于 **`recursion_limit`**。"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-418","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"第 **`8`** 个 SuperStep 执行时，剩余步数为 **`2`**。此时路由函数判断剩余步数较少，不再继续循环，而是路由到 **`END`**，运行图正常结束。"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-419","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优雅退出主动方法proactive-approach","content":"这种方式在运行图内部主动处理，不会抛出异常，因此是**优雅退出**的**主动方法**。"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-420","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#异常中断被动方法reactive-approach","content":"如果图中存在循环结构，并且运行图在达到停止条件之前耗尽了允许的最大步数，**`LangGraph`** 会抛出 **`GraphRecursionError`**。"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-421","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#异常中断被动方法reactive-approach","content":"开发者可以在图外部捕获该异常，处理递归限制超限的情况。由于这种方式是在异常已经发生之后再处理，因此称为 **被动方法（`Reactive Approach`）**。"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-422","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#异常中断被动方法reactive-approach","content":"**示例如下**"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-423","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#异常中断被动方法reactive-approach","content":"**运行结果如下**"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-424","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#异常中断被动方法reactive-approach","content":"本例中，**`loop_node`** 的下游仍然是 **`loop_node`** 本身，因此运行图会不断循环。由于没有