raph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优先级节点级配置覆盖默认配置","content":"**`step_a`** 没有显式指定 **`error_handler`**，因此使用默认的 **`default_error_handler`**；"},"2709":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-711","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#优先级节点级配置覆盖默认配置","content":"**`step_b`** 显式指定了 **`error_handler=custom_error_handler`**，节点级配置覆盖默认配置，因此使用 **`custom_error_handler`**。"},"2710":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-712","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#适用范围矩阵","content":"并非所有默认配置都对所有类型的节点生效。**错误处理节点**（即通过 **`add_node(error_handler=...)`** 注册的兜底节点）会被排除在部分默认配置之外，以避免不安全行为。"},"2711":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C-713","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/02-LangGraph%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%B5%81%E4%B8%8E%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C#适用范围矩阵","content":"| **`set_node_defaults`** 参数 | 对普通节点生效 | 对错误处理节点生效 | 原因                |\n| -------------------------- | ------- | --------- | ----------------- |\n| **`retry_policy`**         | ✅       | ✅         | 兜底节点遇到临时性故障时也应当重试 |","table":"table-8"},"2712":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgra