                           |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| **`Checkpoint`** | 检查点，超步边界上的底层状态快照，保存 **`Channel`** 的值、版本等信息。 |","table":"table-0"},"2864":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-128","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#核心组件","content":"| 概念                       | 作用                                                                  |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`CheckpointMetadata`** | 与 **`Checkpoint`** 关联的元数据，如超步编号 **`step`**、父检查点 **`ID parents`** 等。 |","table":"table-0"},"2865":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-129","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#核心组件","content":"| 概念                 | 作用                        |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| **`Checkpointer`** | 检查点存储器，负责存储检查点、元数据、配置等信息。 |","table":"table-0"},"2866":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-130","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#核心组件","content":"| 概念           | 作用                                                                                                                                                  |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`thread`** | 此处的线程不同于操作系统的线程，是指 **`LangGraph`** 中一条逻辑上的、可持久化的执行线，也可以理解为会话。一个会话可以包含多次调用，并在执行过程中生成多个检查点。因此，要将多次调用组织在一个会话中，必须为该 **`thread`** 配置 **`checkpointer`**。 |","table":"table-0"},"2867":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-131","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#核心组件","content":"| 概念              | 作用                                                                                                                                                                           |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`thread_id`** | **`thread`** 的唯一标识，用于区分不同的会话。复用同一个 **`thread_id`**，就表示多次调用共享同一条持久化执行线，也就是共享同一个会话历史。此处的 **`thread`/`thread_id`** 和 **`LangChain Agent`** 中提到的 **`thread`/`thread_id`** 是同一概念。 |","table":"table-0"},"2868":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-132","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#核心组件","content":"| 概念                  | 作用                                                                                                                               |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------