1%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"**`LangGraph`** 提供了基于内存的检查点存储器 **`InMemorySaver`**。它将检查点数据保存在当前 **`Python`** 进程的内存中，进程结束则数据丢失，适合快速开发、调试。"},"2904":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-168","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"在 **`Jupyter`** 场景下，只要 **`Jupyter`** 内核没有被重启，并且 **`InMemorySaver()`** 实例没有被重新创建，内存中的检查点数据就会继续存在。"},"2905":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-169","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"反之，如果重新执行完整代码，导致 **`checkpointer = InMemorySaver()`** 被重新执行，那么之前保存在内存中的检查点也会被清空。"},"2906":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-170","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"**示例如下**"},"2907":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-171","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"**输出如下**"},"2908":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-172","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"本例中，三次调用使用了相同的 **`thread_id`**，所以后两次调用能够读取前面已经保存的消息历史。最终模型可以知道“用户是老王”，也可以知道“自己被要求扮演小王”。"},"2909":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-173","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于内存的检查点存储器","content":"需要注意的是，如果重新执行完整代码，**`InMemorySaver()`** 实例会被重新创建，历史检查点会被清空。因此，消息列表不会继续累加，而是会基于新的空状态重新开始。"},"2910":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-174","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"本节将 **`PostgreSQL`** 作为检查点后端，对应的 **`Checkpointer`** 实现为 **`PostgresSaver`**。"},"2911":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-175","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"和 **`InMemorySaver`** 不同，**`PostgresSaver`** 会将检查点保存到 **`PostgreSQL`** 数据库中。只要数据库中的记录没有被删除，即使 **`Python`** 程序结束、连接对象重建，历史检查点也仍然存在。"},"2912":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-176","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"在学习 **`LangChain`** 时，我们已经介绍了 **`PostgreSQL`** 的部署和 **`PostgresSaver`** 的用法。此处直接给出案例，不再赘述。"},"2913":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-177","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"**示例如下**"},"2914":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-178","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"**运行结果如下**"},"2915":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-179","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"如果多次运行这段代码，并且始终使用相同的 **`thread_id`**，那么历史消息会不断累加。这是因为检查点已经被保存到了 **`PostgreSQL`** 中，重新创建 **`Python`** 连接对象并不会清空数据库中的历史记录。"},"2916":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-180","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"再次运行结果如下所示。"},"2917":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-181","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"因此，**`PostgresSaver`** 和 **`InMemorySaver`** 的关键区别在于："},"2918":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-182","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"**`InMemorySaver`**：状态保存在当前进程内存中，进程结束或对象重建后丢失。"},"2919":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-183","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"**`PostgresSaver`**：状态保存在 **`PostgreSQL`** 中，只要数据库记录存在，程序重启后仍可读取。"},"2920":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-184","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器","content":"所以，基于数据库的 **`Checkpointer`** 可靠性更高、更适合需要长期保存会话状态的场景。"},"2921":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-185","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"启用 **`Checkpointer`** 后，**`LangGraph`** 会在执行过程中保存检查点。"},"2922":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-186","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"检查点写入**越及时**，系统在异常中断后可恢复的状态**越完整**，**容灾能力越强**；但更及时的持久化通常也意味着**更多中间写入**，或**额外的**阻塞式**等待**，带来**额外的性能开销和响应延迟**（从调用者的角度考虑）。"},"2923":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-187","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"**`LangGraph`** 支持三种持久化模式，采用不同的检查点保存时机，在容灾能力和性能开销、响应时效性之间作取舍。"},"2924":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-188","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"**`exit`**：退出模式。只在计算图正常结束、异常退出、被中断（如 **`Human-In-The-Loop`** 中断）时保存检查点。**不能处理中途进程崩溃的场景**。这种模式响应性能开销最小，但容灾能力最弱。"},"2925":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-189","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"**`async`**：异步模式。默认模式，顾名思义，检查点在后台异步写入。"},"2926":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-190","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"它会在每个超步结束后写入**完整检查点（主检查点）**，并在图中任务执行完毕后记录**中间结果**。"},"2927":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-191","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"和 **`exit`** 模式相比，增加了性能开销，但写入操作发生在后台，不会引入明显的响应延迟，同时提升了容灾能力。"},"2928":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-192","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#概述-1","content":"**`sync`**：同步模式。"},"2929":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-193","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"