-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#根据id查看特定检查点","content":"当前场景下，我们已经获取了完整检查点列表，然后从中取了某个检查点的 **`checkpoint_id`**，然后调用 **`get_state()`** 查到了它对应的快照。"},"3020":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-284","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#根据id查看特定检查点","content":"这看起来有些“绕”，因为我们本来就已经拿到了完整的历史快照。但在实际场景中，这个方法仍然很有意义。"},"3021":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-285","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#根据id查看特定检查点","content":"例如，在后续的 **检查点回溯-分叉** 场景中，我们经常会基于历史检查点创建新的检查点，拿到该检查点的、带有 **`checkpoint_id`** 的配置信息 **`config`**。此时就可以将 **`config`** 传递给 **`graph.get_state()`**，从而便捷而精确地查看该检查点的快照。"},"3022":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-286","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#多轮对话","content":"最基础的使用场景是多轮对话。前文示例已经实现了一个简单的多轮对话流程，这里不再展开。"},"3023":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-287","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86