ocs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-447","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#准备长期记忆","content":"这里使用 **`USERS_NS`** 作为顶层命名空间，`store.search(USERS_NS)` 会查询所有以 **`(\"users\",)`** 开头的记忆数据。返回的每条数据都是一个 **`Item`** 实例。"},"3184":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-448","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#准备长期记忆","content":"需要注意："},"3185":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-449","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#准备长期记忆","content":"**`namespace`** 使用元组是硬性约束，天然表达层级结构。本例使用两层命名空间 **`(\"users\", \"Alice\")`**，清晰区分了**领域（`users`）**和**实体（用户名）**，而具体存储什么类型的数据则由 **`key`** 参数表达（如 **`\"preferences\"`**）。"},"3186":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-450","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#准备长期记忆","content":"**`(*USERS_NS, \"Alice\")`** 的写法表示对已有元组进行解包，再拼接新的命名空间片段。"},"3187":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%