"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#检查点表结构说明","content":"该表由 **`LangGraph`** 内部管理，用户无需手动操作。未来 **`LangGraph`** 版本升级时，若表结构有变更，**`setup()`** 会根据此版本号自动执行对应的迁移 **`SQL`**。"},"3427":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-691","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#检查点表结构说明","content":"> **四张表的关系**：\n>\n> - **`checkpoints`** 存储每次 **`graph.invoke()`** 产生的检查点快照；\n> - **`checkpoint_writes`** 存储每个检查点下各节点任务的通道写入记录（一条检查点通常对应多条写入）；\n> - **`checkpoint_blobs`** 存储通道级别的大型二进制数据，以 **(thread_id, checkpoint_ns, channel, version)** 为维度，可跨检查点复用；\n> - **`checkpoint_migrations`** 仅用于数据库表结构版本管理。\n>\n> **`LangGraph`** 通过 **`thread_id`** + **`checkpoint_ns`** + **`checkpoint_id`** 联合定位和恢复状态。"},"3428":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-692","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#写入检查点数据查询","content":"运行「基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器」的示例代码后，可以直接在数据库中查看写入的数据："},"3429":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-693","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#写入检查点数据查询","content":"通过这些查询，可以直观地理解 **`PostgresSaver`** 是如何将 **`LangGraph`** 的检查点数据持久化到 **`PostgreSQL`** 中的。"},"3430":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-694","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#写入检查点数据查询","content":"> **Windows 终端编码问题**：\n> 在中文 **`Windows`** 的 **`CMD`** 或 **`PowerShell`** 中使用 **`psql`** 查询 **`checkpoint`**（**`jsonb`**）字段时，如果数据中包含 emoji 等 4 字节 **`UTF-8`** 字符，可能会报错：\n>\n> ```text :no-line-numbers\n> 错误:  编码\"UTF8\"的字符0x0xf0 0x9f 0xa4 0x94在编码\"GBK\"没有相对应值\n> ```\n>\n> 这是因为 **`Windows`** 终端默认编码为 **`GBK`**，无法处理 4 字节 **`UTF-8`** 字符。解决方案：\n>\n> ```sql :no-line-numbers\n> -- 查询前先切换客户端编码\n> SET client_encoding = 'UTF8';\n> ```\n>\n> 或在 **`PowerShell`** 中先执行 **`chcp 65001`** 切换到 **`UTF-8`** 编码，再启动 **`psql`**。"},"3431":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-695","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#补充说明","content":"**`setup()`** 是幂等的——多次调用不会重复创建表，也不会清空已有数据；"},"3432":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-696","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#补充说明","content":"实际项目中，建议将 **`setup()`** 作为独立的数据库初始化/迁移步骤执行，而不是每次启动应用时都调用（这也是「基于持久化数据库的检查点存储器」代码注释中提到的建议）；"},"3433":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-697","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#补充说明","content":"如果需要主动清理某个线程的检查点数据，可以使用 **`checkpointer.delete_thread(thread_id)`** 方法，或者从数据库层面删除对应记录；"},"3434":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86-698","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/03-LangGraph%E6%8C%81%E4%B9%85%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8E%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86#补充说明","content":"关于连接池：如果需要在生产环境中处理高并发请求，建议使用 **`psycopg_pool`** 提供的连接池功能，而不是每次创建新连接。"},"3435":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","type":"page","content":"中断与工具与部署","breadcrumbs":["主页","AI","LangGraph"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2"},"3436":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-0","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#中断","content":"中断"},"3437":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-1","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6