E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#单节点串行中断模式","content":"中断恢复时，整个被中断的节点函数都会重新运行。"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-127","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#单节点串行中断模式","content":"单个节点中串行地多次调用 **`interrupt()`** 函数时，检查点存储器会记录历史的 **`resume`** 信息，**`LangGraph`** 运行时会读取这些信息，并在 **`interrupt()`** 函数中维护索引，按照节点内调用 **`interrupt()`** 函数的顺序，逐个取出历史 **`resume`** 的值，并将它们作为 **`interrupt()`** 函数的返回值。"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-128","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#单节点串行中断模式","content":"所以，已经被恢复的 **`interrupt()`** 不会被重复触发。并且，由此可以推断，我们要保证历史 **`resume`** 可以被正确应用，就应保证中断恢复前后的多次 **`interrupt()`** 相对顺序保持不变。"},"3565":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-129","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#单节点串行中断模式","content":"当历史 **`resume`** 耗尽后，本次恢复运行时传入的 **`resume`** 会作为本次中断的返回值，然后节点函数继续运行。"},"3566":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-130","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-