4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#手动处理工具调用","content":"> **注意**\n>\n> 上面的手动实现会按照 **`tool_calls`** 的顺序串行执行工具，主要用于展示底层流程。**`ToolNode`** 在同步调用中可通过执行器并行处理多个工具调用，在异步调用中则使用 **`asyncio.gather()`** 并发执行。"},"3784":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-348","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#手动处理工具调用","content":"**运行结果如下**"},"3785":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-349","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#用toolnode处理工具调用","content":"上一节的工具节点完成了以下工作：读取最后一条 **`AIMessage`** 中的 **`tool_calls`**，根据工具名称查找并执行对应工具，再把执行结果封装成与原工具调用一一对应的 **`ToolMessage`**。"},"3786":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-350","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#用toolnode处理工具调用","content":"这种实现适合帮助我们理解工具调用的基本流程，但它只覆盖了最简单的场景。实际项目还需要处理无效工具名、参数校验、异常处理、运行时参数注入、**`Command`** 传播以及多个工具调用的并行执行等问题。"},"3787":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-351","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","t