ggraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-374","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#在工具中更新状态","content":"**运行结果如下**"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-375","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#工具节点执行与容错机制","content":"**`ToolNode`** 提供同步工具调用包装器 **`wrap_tool_call`**，用于在工具执行前后插入自定义逻辑。"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-376","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#工具节点执行与容错机制","content":"它与 **`LangChain Agent`** 中间件 **`wrap_tool_call`** 的核心机制相同：接收当前工具调用请求 **`request`** 和真正执行工具的回调 **`execute`**，可以选择不调用、调用一次或多次 **`execute(request)`**，并最终返回 **`ToolMessage`** 或 **`Command`**。"},"3813":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2-377","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E4%B8%8E%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2#工具节点执行与容错机制","content":"因此，**`wrap_tool_call`** 可以用于重试、缓存、请求改写、短路返回和自定义控制流等场景。异步工具链路还可以使用对应的 **`awrap_tool_call`**。"},"3814":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/04-LangGraph%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8E