aph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#什么是流式执行","content":"简而言之：流式执行就是"},"3903":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-80","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#什么是流式执行","content":"> 边执行、边产生事件、边向调用方返回结果。"},"3904":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-81","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#什么是langgraph的流式执行","content":"**`LangGraph`** 的流式执行是指，状态图计算过程中，将节点输出、状态更新、消息增量、自定义事件或调试信息等写入流式队列，并在特定的时机将流式队列中的信息返还给调用者。"},"3905":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-82","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#什么是langgraph的流式执行","content":"在同步执行中，这些数据最终进入内部的**同步流式队列**；在异步执行中，则进入对应的**异步队列**。调用方通过**迭代器**逐条消费这些数据，因此不必等到整张图执行完毕后再获得反馈。"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-83","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#langgraph的流式执行api","content":"**`LangGraph`** 提供了两套流式执行 **`API`**"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-84","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#streamastream","content":"获取 **`LangGraph`** 执行过程中的业务数据或运行时数据"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-85","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],