9%B9%E6%80%A7#streamastream","content":"| 维度   | `stream()`   | `astream()`                       |\n| ---- | ------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| 运行环境 | 普通 Python 脚本 | `asyncio` 事件循环（Jupyter、FastAPI 等） |","table":"table-0"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-91","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#streamastream","content":"| 维度    | `stream()`            | `astream()`           |\n| ----- | --------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 参数与输出 | 相同 `stream_mode`，语义一致 | 相同 `stream_mode`，语义一致 |","table":"table-0"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-92","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#streamastream","content":"| 维度   | `stream()`   | `astream()`           |\n| ---- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| 适用场景 | 同步批处理、CLI 工具 | `async` 服务端、结合其他异步 IO |","table":"table-0"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-93","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#astream_events","content":"获取图运行过程中产生的 **`Runnable`** 标准事件（组件生命周期、父子调用关系、输入输出等）。详见 **`astream_events`**。"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-94","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#streamastream-1","content":"**`astream`** 是 **`stream`** 的异步版本。二者使用相同的流模式，且在参数一致时，输出数据的语义和封装格式一致；区别主要在于调用方分别使用同步迭代和异步迭代进行消费。"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%A