A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景三多次调用同一子图","content":"每次调用子图时 `messages` 状态都是独立的。**Per-invocation 适用于父图中多次调用同一子图的场景，调用间互不干扰。**"},"4104":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-281","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景三多次调用同一子图","content":"**Per-thread 行为**（改为 `builder.compile(checkpointer=True)`）：同一节点内的多次子图调用，历史按调用位置独立——即第一次子图调用的历史是连续的，第二次子图调用的历史也是连续的，但两次之间独立。**如果调用顺序发生变化，检查点历史会相互干扰。**"},"4105":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-282","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景三多次调用同一子图","content":"> **策略差异**"},"4106":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-283","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景三多次调用同一子图","content":"| 策略                 | 编译参数                           | 多次调用同一子图   |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------ | ---------- |\n| Per-invocation（默认） | `subgraph = builder.compile()` | ✅ 每次调用完全隔离 |","table":"table-16"},"4107":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-284","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景三多次调用同一子图","content":"| 策略         | 编译参数                                            | 多次调用同一子图       |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| Per-thread | `subgraph = builder.compile(checkpointer=True)` | ❌ 历史按位置关联，可能