荐","content":"**运行结果**"},"4114":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-291","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景五独立节点调用不同子图推荐","content":"每个子图有独立的父图节点，命名空间为各自的节点名，完全隔离。**这是 Per-thread 模式下多次调用不同子图的推荐做法。**"},"4115":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-292","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景六stateless-模式","content":"子图完全无状态，不保存检查点，中断和多轮对话均不适用。适用于纯计算、无需追踪历史的场景。"},"4116":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-293","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景六stateless-模式","content":"**Stateless 运行结果**"},"4117":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-294","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景六stateless-模式","content":"渲染的图结构中，子图节点内部没有展开子图拓扑——无状态模式的子图内部状态不可访问。"},"4118":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-295","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#场景六stateless-模式","content":"**Per-thread 对比结果**（仅改为 `builder.compile(checkpointer=True)`）："},"4119":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-296","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%