`\\|1`, `\\|2` …   |","table":"table-17"},"4124":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-301","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#per-invocation和per-thread的设计哲学","content":"| 维度   | **`Per-invocation`** | **`Per-thread`**                                                            |\n| ---- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 注意事项 | —                    | 调用顺序变化会导致检查点历史相互干扰；`get_state_history()` 存在 Bug，父图检查点仍记录 `:<任务ID>` 格式，需额外处理 |","table":"table-17"},"4125":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-302","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#总结","content":"| 特性                  | **`Per-invocation (default)`** | **`Per-thread`** | **`Stateless`** |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------- | --------------- |\n| **`checkpointer=`** | **`None`**                     | **`True`**       | **`False`**     |","table":"table-18"},"4126":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-303","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7#总结","content":"| 特性  | **`Per-invocation (default)`** | **`Per-thread`** | **`Stateless`** |\n| --- | ------------------------------ | ---------------- | --------------- |\n| 中断  | ✅                              | ✅                | ❌               |","table":"table-18"},"4127":{"id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7-304","page_id":"/docs/ai/langgraph/05-LangGraph%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7","tags