ag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"最简单的分块策略：按固定 token/字符数切割，加入 overlap 保证上下文连贯。"},"4432":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-83","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**适用场景**：同质化文档（纯文本新闻、客户评论、日志数据）  \n**缺点**：不考虑语义边界，可能从句子中间截断，破坏完整性"},"4433":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-84","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"LangChain 默认分块策略。按优先级尝试不同分隔符（`\\n\\n` → `\\n` → `.` → ` `），在最大尺寸约束下尽量保留自然边界。"},"4434":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-85","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**适用场景**：通用文档（最常用、最稳健的基线方法，**实际生产首选**）"},"4435":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-86","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"基于 Embedding 相似度的动态分块算法："},"4436":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-87","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"将文本按句子切分"},"4437":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-88","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"计算相邻句子（含 buffer 窗口）的 Embedding 相似度"},"4438":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-89","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"相似度显著下降处（超过均值 + k×标准差）作为分块边界"},"4439":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-90","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**优势**：语义完整性高，chunk 内部主题一致，避免人工设定边界  \n**劣势**：依赖 Embedding 模型质量；计算成本高于固定分块（约慢 10x）"},"4440":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-91","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"由 Dense X Retrieval 论文提出。将文档分解为**原子性命题（atomic propositions）**：每个命题是一个完整、自包含的事实陈述，无需上下文即可理解。"},"4441":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-92","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**优势**：命题粒度极细，检索精度最高；每个命题自包含，避免代词歧义  \n**劣势**：需要 LLM 进行命题提取，成本高（约 0.001 元/命题）；粒度过细可能丢失上下文"},"4442":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-93","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"RAPTOR（Recursive Abstractive Processing for Tree-Organized Retrieval）核心思想："},"4443":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-94","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"将文档分为小 chunk（**叶节点**）"},"4444":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-95","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"对叶节点聚类，用 LLM 生成摘要（**父节点**）"},"4445":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-96","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"递归向上构建摘要树"},"4446":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-97","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"检索时同时在**所有层级**检索，支持细节查询（叶节点）和宏观查询（摘要节点）"},"4447":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-98","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**优势**：解决了\"既要细粒度又要宏观理解\"的两难问题"},"4448":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-99","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"Late Chunking 是 JinaAI 提出的创新方法，解决传统分块丢失上下文的问题："},"4449":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-100","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**传统方式**：先分块 → 分别 Embed → 丢失跨块上下文"},"4450":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-101","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**Late Chunking**：先对**完整文档** Embed（获得全局上下文感知的 token embeddings）→ 再在 embedding 层面分块（对每块的 token embedding 做 mean pooling）"},"4451":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-102","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**优势**：保留了长程上下文信息，尤其适合代词指代、专有名词跨句引用的场景  \n**要求**：必须使用支持长上下文的模型（如 jina-embeddings-v3 或 BGE-M3）"},"4452":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-103","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略 | chunk_size 建议  | overlap 建议 | 适用场景      |\n| ---- | -------------- | ---------- | --------- |\n| 固定大小 | 256-512 tokens | 10%-20%    | 快速原型、同质文本 |","table":"table-2"},"4453":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-104","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略 | chunk_size 建议  | overlap 建议    | 适用场景       |\n| ---- | -------------- | ------------- | ---------- |\n| 递归字符 | 512-1024 chars | 100-200 chars | **通用默认方案** |","table":"table-2"},"4454":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-105","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略 | chunk_size 建议 | overlap 建议 | 适用场景     |\n| ---- | ------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 语义分块 | 动态（均值约 500）   | 无需 overlap | 主题多样的长文档 |","table":"table-2"},"4455":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-106","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略 | chunk_size 建议 | overlap 建议 | 适用场景     |\n| ---- | ------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 命题分块 | ~100 chars/命题 | N/A        | 高精度知识库问答 |","table":"table-2"},"4456":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-107","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略 | chunk_size 建议 | overlap 建议 | 适用场景    |\n| ---- | ------------- | ---------- | ------- |\n| 层级分块 | 叶 256 + 摘要动态  | 0          | 多粒度检索需求 |","table":"table-2"},"4457":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-108","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"| 分块策略          | chunk_size 建议 | overlap 建议 | 适用场景      |\n| ------------- | ------------- | ---------- | --------- |\n| Late Chunking | 与语义分块配合       | N/A        | 上下文依赖强的文档 |","table":"table-2"},"4458":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-109","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"**经验法则：**"},"4459":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-110","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"不同业务最优 chunk_size 差异巨大，必须用 **Ragas** 在真实数据上实测"},"4460":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-111","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"生产中可并存多种粒度（层级分块），支持不同类型问题"},"4461":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-112","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#智能分块策略","content":"overlap 过大会引入噪声，过小会导致上下文断裂，10%-20% 是经验最优区间"},"4462":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-113","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"Embedding 模型将文本映射到高维向量空间，决定语义相似度计算质量。选型核心考量：维度、最大输入长度、多语言支持、推理速度。"},"4463":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-114","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"| 模型         | 维度   | 最大长度 | 中文能力  | MTEB 排名 | 推荐场景                  |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---- | ----- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| **BGE-M3** | 1024 | 8192 | ★★★★★ | Top 5   | **中文 RAG 首选**，多语言，三模式 |","table":"table-3"},"4464":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-115","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"| 模型               | 维度   | 最大长度 | 中文能力  | MTEB 排名 | 推荐场景          |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ---- | ----- | ------- | ------------- |\n| **BGE-large-zh** | 1024 | 512  | ★★★★★ | Top 10  | 纯中文，速度快，资源少时用 |","table":"table-3"},"4465":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-116","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"| 模型                | 维度   | 最大长度  | 中文能力 | MTEB 排名 | 推荐场景  |\n| ----------------- | ---- | ----- | ---- | ------- | ----- |\n| **E5-mistral-7b** | 4096 | 32768 | ★★★  | Top 3   | 英文长文档 |","table":"table-3"},"4466":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-117","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"| 模型               | 维度   | 最大长度  | 中文能力  | MTEB 排名 | 推荐场景            |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ----- | ----- | ------- | --------------- |\n| **GTE-Qwen2-7B** | 3584 | 32768 | ★★★★★ | Top 3   | 中英文长文档，**质量最高** |","table":"table-3"},"4467":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-118","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"| 模型                         | 维度   | 最大长度 | 中文能力 | MTEB 排名 | 推荐场景         |\n| -------------------------- | ---- | ---- | ---- | ------- | ------------ |\n| **text-embedding-3-large** | 3072 | 8192 | ★★★★ | Top 10  | 无 GPU 时用 API |","table":"table-3"},"4468":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-119","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"**BGE-M3 的三种检索模式**（核心差异化特性）："},"4469":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-120","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"**Dense（稠密）**：常规向量检索，速度最快"},"4470":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-121","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"**Sparse（稀疏）**（SPLADE-like）：稀疏向量，可替代 BM25，精确匹配强"},"4471":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-122","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#embedding-模型选型与微调","content":"**ColBERT**：多向量检索，每个 token 一个向量，效果最好但存储成本高"},"4472":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-123","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"BM25 与 Dense 检索的互补性："},"4473":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-124","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"|        | BM25                   | Dense          |\n| ------ | ---------------------- | -------------- |\n| **优势** | 精确关键词匹配，专有名词/缩写效果好，可解释 | 语义理解，同义词泛化，多语言 |","table":"table-4"},"4474":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-125","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"|        | BM25             | Dense       |\n| ------ | ---------------- | ----------- |\n| **劣势** | 无语义理解，词汇不匹配即 0 分 | 对低频词/新术语泛化差 |","table":"table-4"},"4475":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-126","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"|        | BM25       | Dense     |\n| ------ | ---------- | --------- |\n| **适合** | 产品型号、人名、术语 | 概念查询、意图理解 |","table":"table-4"},"4476":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-127","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"混合检索通过 **RRF（Reciprocal Rank Fusion）** 融合两路结果，公式："},"4477":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-128","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"$$\\text{RRF}(d) = \\sum_{r \\in R} \\frac{1}{k + \\text{rank}_r(d)}$$"},"4478":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-129","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"| 符号  | 含义   |\n| --- | ---- |\n| $d$ | 某个文档 |","table":"table-5"},"4479":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-130","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"| 符号  | 含义                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ |\n| $R$ | 所有检索路数的集合（如 BM25、向量检索两路） |","table":"table-5"},"4480":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-131","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"| 符号                 | 含义                              |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| $\\text{rank}_r(d)$ | 文档 $d$ 在第 $r$ 路检索结果中的排名（从 1 开始） |","table":"table-5"},"4481":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-132","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"| 符号  | 含义          |\n| --- | ----------- |\n| $k$ | 平滑常数，通常取 60 |","table":"table-5"},"4482":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-133","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"假设文档 $d$ 在两路检索中的排名："},"4483":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-134","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"BM25 排名第 3"},"4484":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-135","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"向量检索排名第 1"},"4485":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-136","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"取 $k = 60$："},"4486":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-137","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"$$\\text{RRF}(d) = \\frac{1}{60 + 3} + \\frac{1}{60 + 1} = \\frac{1}{63} + \\frac{1}{61} \\approx 0.01587 + 0.01639 = 0.03226$$"},"4487":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-138","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"最终按 RRF 分数降序排列，取 Top-K 作为混合检索结果。"},"4488":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-139","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"**BM25/Dense 权重**：业务初期建议 BM25:Dense = 3:7；可通过 A/B 测试在业务数据上调优"},"4489":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-140","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#混合检索","content":"**RRF k=60**：论文推荐值，通常无需调整（调整收益极小）"},"4490":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-141","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"用户原始 query 常存在问题："},"4491":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-142","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"拼写错误、口语化表达（\"怎么弄\" → \"如何配置\"）"},"4492":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-143","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"歧义、代词指代（\"它的参数\"）"},"4493":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-144","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"过于简短，缺乏检索关键词"},"4494":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-145","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"改写策略：用 LLM 将原始 query 扩展/规范化，增加同义词，明确歧义。"},"4495":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-146","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#query-rewriting查询改写","content":"示例"},"4496":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-147","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"HyDE（Hypothetical Document Embeddings）核心思路："},"4497":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-148","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"用 LLM 根据 query 生成一篇**假设性文档**（LLM 认为能回答该 query 的文档片段）"},"4498":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-149","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"对假设文档进行 Embedding（而非对 query 直接 Embedding）"},"4499":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-150","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"用假设文档的 Embedding 去检索真实文档"},"4500":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-151","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"**为什么有效**：query 和文档在语义空间分布不同（一问一答），假设文档与真实文档更接近（同为陈述型文本），缩小 query-doc 分布差距（asymmetric gap 问题）。"},"4501":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-152","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hyde假设文档嵌入","content":"示例"},"4502":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-153","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#multi-query多路查询","content":"对同一问题从不同角度生成多个 query，各自独立检索后对结果取并集（去重），提高召回率。"},"4503":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-154","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#multi-query多路查询","content":"核心思路：用户的问题可能只命中了文档的某种表述方式，多角度查询增加命中概率。"},"4504":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-155","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#multi-query多路查询","content":"示例"},"4505":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-156","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#step-back-prompting后退提示","content":"Step-Back 思路：对于具体问题，先\"退一步\"提出更抽象的背景问题，同时检索背景知识和具体细节，融合后回答。"},"4506":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-157","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#step-back-prompting后退提示","content":"**适用场景**：需要理解原理才能回答细节的问题（如\"为什么 HNSW 的 M=32 比 M=16 精度高\"需要先理解 HNSW 原理）"},"4507":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-158","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#step-back-prompting后退提示","content":"示例"},"4508":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-159","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"| 技术              | 延迟增加       | 效果提升 | 成本增加        | 推荐场景     |\n| --------------- | ---------- | ---- | ----------- | -------- |\n| Query Rewriting | +100-300ms | ★★★  | 低（gpt-mini） | **默认开启** |","table":"table-6"},"4509":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-160","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"| 技术   | 延迟增加       | 效果提升 | 成本增加 | 推荐场景    |\n| ---- | ---------- | ---- | ---- | ------- |\n| HyDE | +300-500ms | ★★★★ | 中    | 专业领域知识库 |","table":"table-6"},"4510":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-161","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"| 技术          | 延迟增加        | 效果提升 | 成本增加 | 推荐场景         |\n| ----------- | ----------- | ---- | ---- | ------------ |\n| Multi-Query | +500-1000ms | ★★★★ | 中-高  | 高召回需求（客服、搜索） |","table":"table-6"},"4511":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-162","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"| 技术        | 延迟增加       | 效果提升 | 成本增加 | 推荐场景      |\n| --------- | ---------- | ---- | ---- | --------- |\n| Step-Back | +300-500ms | ★★★  | 中    | 需要背景知识辅助时 |","table":"table-6"},"4512":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-163","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"**生产建议**：Query Rewriting 成本最低、副作用最小，应默认开启"},"4513":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-164","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"HyDE 对知识密集型任务（医疗、法律、技术文档）效果显著，但存在幻觉风险（假设文档内容不准确）"},"4514":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-165","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项","content":"Multi-Query 的 n_queries 建议设 3（>3 边际收益递减，延迟线性增加）"},"4515":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-166","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#两阶段检索架构","content":"检索分两阶段，分别优化速度和精度："},"4516":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-167","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#两阶段检索架构","content":"**阶段一（召回）**：Bi-Encoder 快速检索 top-100\n**阶段二（精排）**：Cross-Encoder 精细评分 top-100，取 top-5"},"4517":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-168","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#两阶段检索架构","content":"**为什么 Cross-Encoder 更准确**：Bi-Encoder 独立编码，无法看到 query 和 doc 的交互；Cross-Encoder 联合编码，注意力机制可以直接对比两者的词汇和语义关系。"},"4518":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-169","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#cross-encoder-re-ranking","content":"示例"},"4519":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-170","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#colbert-多向量检索","content":"ColBERT（Contextualized Late Interaction over BERT）兼顾精度和效率："},"4520":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-171","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#colbert-多向量检索","content":"**存储阶段**：文档中每个 token 各自生成一个向量，存储 (seq_len, dim) 矩阵"},"4521":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-172","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#colbert-多向量检索","content":"**检索阶段**：MaxSim 操作——对 query 每个 token，找文档所有 token 向量中的最大相似度，求和"},"4522":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-173","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#colbert-多向量检索","content":"$$\\text{Score}(q, d) = \\sum_{i=1}^{|q|} \\max_{j=1}^{|d|} ; \\mathbf{q}_i \\cdot\\mathbf{d}_j$$"},"4523":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-174","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#colbert-多向量检索","content":"**优势**：接近 Cross-Encoder 精度，但延迟接近 Bi-Encoder；对长文档效果尤佳"},"4524":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-175","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#延迟对比参考值a100-gpu单条-query","content":"| 方法              | 延迟（100 文档） | 精度 NDCG@10 |\n| --------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| Bi-Encoder only | ~10ms      | 基线         |","table":"table-7"},"4525":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-176","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#延迟对比参考值a100-gpu单条-query","content":"| 方法          | 延迟（100 文档） | 精度 NDCG@10 |\n| ----------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| + BM25 混合检索 | ~15ms      | +5-10%     |","table":"table-7"},"4526":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-177","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#延迟对比参考值a100-gpu单条-query","content":"| 方法                     | 延迟（100 文档） | 精度 NDCG@10 |\n| ---------------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| + Cross-Encoder rerank | ~150-300ms | +15-25%    |","table":"table-7"},"4527":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-178","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#延迟对比参考值a100-gpu单条-query","content":"| 方法                   | 延迟（100 文档） | 精度 NDCG@10 |\n| -------------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| + BGE-Reranker-v2-m3 | ~200-400ms | +15-25%    |","table":"table-7"},"4528":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-179","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#延迟对比参考值a100-gpu单条-query","content":"| 方法                 | 延迟（100 文档） | 精度 NDCG@10 |\n| ------------------ | ---------- | ---------- |\n| + ColBERT (BGE-M3) | ~50-100ms  | +12-20%    |","table":"table-7"},"4529":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-180","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项-1","content":"**召回数量黄金比例**：recall_top_k = final_top_k × (10-20)，即要 top-5 则召回 50-100 条"},"4530":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-181","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项-1","content":"**max_length 选择**：日常场景 512 足够；长文档（合同/报告）用 1024（延迟约翻倍）"},"4531":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-182","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项-1","content":"**流式返回**：先推送 Bi-Encoder top-5（低延迟），后台重排完成后推送更新（改善体验）"},"4532":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-183","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项-1","content":"**模型热加载**：Cross-Encoder 加载一次约 3-5s，必须作为服务常驻，不能按需加载"},"4533":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-184","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World）是最主流的 ANN（近似最近邻）索引算法，在精度和速度上取得最优平衡。"},"4534":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-185","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"**三个关键参数：**"},"4535":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-186","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"| 参数    | 作用阶段 | 默认值 | 调优建议                                   |\n| ----- | ---- | --- | -------------------------------------- |\n| **M** | 建索引  | 16  | 低维(&lt;256)用16，高维(>512)用32；越大精度越高，内存越多 |","table":"table-8"},"4536":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-187","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"| 参数                  | 作用阶段 | 默认值 | 调优建议                      |\n| ------------------- | ---- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| **ef_construction** | 建索引  | 100 | 100（默认）；高精度场景用200；只影响写入速度 |","table":"table-8"},"4537":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-188","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"| 参数            | 作用阶段 | 默认值 | 调优建议                         |\n| ------------- | ---- | --- | ---------------------------- |\n| **ef_search** | 查询   | 10  | 实时场景50-100，离线精排200+；直接影响检索延迟 |","table":"table-8"},"4538":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-189","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#hnsw-参数调优","content":"**内存估算（Qdrant HNSW）：**"},"4539":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-190","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"在向量检索时结合元数据 pre-filtering，实现精准召回。典型场景："},"4540":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-191","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"多租户隔离（用户只能访问自己部门的文档）"},"4541":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-192","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"时间范围过滤（只检索最近 30 天文档）"},"4542":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-193","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"文档类型过滤（只在合同文档中检索）"},"4543":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-194","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"权限控制（按标签过滤）"},"4544":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-195","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"> ⚠️ **关键**：必须先为过滤字段创建 Payload 索引，否则会触发全量扫描，延迟从毫秒级退化到秒级！"},"4545":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-196","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#metadata-filter元数据过滤","content":"示例"},"4546":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-197","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"生产环境文档库是动态变化的，需要高效处理："},"4547":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-198","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"**新增文档**：添加新向量点"},"4548":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-199","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"**文档更新**：删除旧版本 + 插入新版本（Qdrant 支持 upsert）"},"4549":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-200","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"**文档删除**：按 ID 或按元数据批量删除"},"4550":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-201","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"**批量更新**：合并小批量为大批量，减少 IO 开销"},"4551":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-202","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#增量更新策略","content":"示例"},"4552":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-203","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数     | 推荐值                  | 说明                  |\n| ------ | -------------------- | ------------------- |\n| HNSW M | 16（&lt;1M条），32（>1M条） | M 越大：精度↑，内存↑，建索引速度↓ |","table":"table-9"},"4553":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-204","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数              | 推荐值              | 说明              |\n| --------------- | ---------------- | --------------- |\n| ef_construction | 100（默认），200（高精度） | 只影响写入质量，不影响查询延迟 |","table":"table-9"},"4554":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-205","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数        | 推荐值                 | 说明            |\n| --------- | ------------------- | ------------- |\n| ef_search | 50-100（实时），200+（离线） | 直接影响查询延迟，调优必测 |","table":"table-9"},"4555":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-206","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数      | 推荐值        | 说明                            |\n| ------- | ---------- | ----------------------------- |\n| INT8 量化 | **强烈推荐开启** | 内存节省 4x，速度提升 2-3x，精度损失 &lt;2% |","table":"table-9"},"4556":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-207","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数                 | 推荐值   | 说明                   |\n| ------------------ | ----- | -------------------- |\n| indexing_threshold | 20000 | 小于此数用暴力搜索（小数据集反而更精确） |","table":"table-9"},"4557":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-208","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数         | 推荐值                | 说明                       |\n| ---------- | ------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| write wait | False（批量），True（重要） | 批量导入用 False，单条重要写入用 True |","table":"table-9"},"4558":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-209","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数         | 推荐值      | 说明                          |\n| ---------- | -------- | --------------------------- |\n| Payload 索引 | **必须创建** | 未索引字段过滤 = 全量扫描 = 延迟从 ms → s |","table":"table-9"},"4559":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-210","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"| 参数  | 推荐值                    | 说明            |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 分片数 | ceil(data_size_GB / 5) | 每分片建议 ~5GB 数据 |","table":"table-9"},"4560":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-211","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"**监控告警建议（Qdrant）：**"},"4561":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-212","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"`index_ratio < 0.9`：索引积压，检查 `indexing_threshold` 设置"},"4562":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-213","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"`p99 latency > 200ms`：调大 `ef_search` 或考虑扩容"},"4563":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-214","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"内存使用率 > 80%：开启 INT8 量化，或将 `on_disk=True`，或扩容"},"4564":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-215","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#生产环境注意事项汇总","content":"`segments_count > 100`：触发手动合并（`optimizer.optimize()`）"},"4565":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-216","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估指标","content":"RAG 系统的评估需要覆盖 **检索** 和 **生成** 两个核心环节，形成完整的评估体系。"},"4566":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-217","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估体系总览","content":"| 评估维度     | 核心问题             | 关键指标                       |\n| -------- | ---------------- | -------------------------- |\n| **检索质量** | 检索到的内容是否正确、是否全面？ | Precision、Recall、Relevance |","table":"table-10"},"4567":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-218","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估体系总览","content":"| 评估维度     | 核心问题                  | 关键指标                          |\n| -------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| **生成质量** | 生成的答案是否忠于上下文、是否回答了问题？ | Faithfulness、Answer Relevance |","table":"table-10"},"4568":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-219","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估体系总览","content":"| 评估维度      | 核心问题      | 关键指标                   |\n| --------- | --------- | ---------------------- |\n| **端到端质量** | 最终答案是否正确？ | Correctness、Similarity |","table":"table-10"},"4569":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-220","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-precision上下文精确率","content":"衡量检索到的上下文中，**与问题相关的比例**。即\"检索到的内容里有多少是真正有用的\"。"},"4570":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-221","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-precision上下文精确率","content":"实际计算中，考虑排名位置的加权版本："},"4571":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-222","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-precision上下文精确率","content":"其中 $\\text{rel}(k)$ 表示第 $k$ 个文档是否相关（0 或 1），$\\text{Precision@k}$ 表示前 $k$ 个文档中的精确率。"},"4572":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-223","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-precision上下文精确率","content":"**指标低的原因**：Embedding 模型语义理解不足、检索策略不当（如纯向量检索缺少关键词匹配）、Chunk 切分导致语义断裂。\n**优化方向**：使用混合检索（向量 + BM25）、优化 Embedding 模型、调整 Top-K 参数、改进 Chunk 策略。"},"4573":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-224","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-recall上下文召回率","content":"衡量所有相关文档中，**被检索到的比例**。即\"该找到的内容是否都找到了\"。"},"4574":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-225","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-recall上下文召回率","content":"**指标低的原因**：知识库覆盖不全、查询改写（Query Rewriting）缺失、Embedding 模型对某些领域语义不敏感、Top-K 设置过小。\n**优化方向**：增加知识库覆盖、使用查询扩展（HyDE、Multi-Query）、增大 Top-K、使用多路召回。"},"4575":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-226","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-relevance上下文相关性","content":"衡量检索到的上下文与用户问题的 **整体相关程度**，通常由 LLM 进行打分评判。"},"4576":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-227","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#context-relevance上下文相关性","content":"**指标低的原因**：用户查询意图模糊、Chunk 切分过大（包含大量无关信息）、缺乏查询意图理解。\n**优化方向**：加入查询意图分类、优化 Chunk 大小与重叠、使用 Reranker 对结果重排序。"},"4577":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-228","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"衡量生成的答案是否 **忠于检索到的上下文**，不包含上下文之外的\"幻觉\"信息。这是 RAG 最核心的指标。"},"4578":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-229","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"评估流程："},"4579":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-230","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"将答案拆分为若干独立声明（Claims）"},"4580":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-231","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"逐一检查每个声明是否能从上下文中找到支撑"},"4581":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-232","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"计算有支撑的声明占比"},"4582":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-233","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"**示例**："},"4583":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-234","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#faithfulness忠实度","content":"> - **上下文**：「公司成立于 2020 年，注册资本 500 万」\n> - **答案**：「公司成立于 2020 年，注册资本 500 万，位于北京」\n> - **声明 1**：公司成立于 2020 年 → ✅ 有支撑\n> - **声明 2**：注册资本 500 万 → ✅ 有支撑\n> - **声明 3**：位于北京 → ❌ 无支撑（幻觉）\n> - **Faithfulness = 2/3 ≈ 0.67**\n>\n> **指标低的原因**：LLM 幻觉严重、Prompt 未约束\"仅基于上下文回答\"、上下文信息不足导致模型自行补充。\n>\n> **优化方向**：在 Prompt 中明确要求\"仅基于提供的上下文回答，若信息不足则回答不知道\"、使用更强的模型、增加上下文信息量。"},"4584":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-235","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-relevance答案相关性","content":"衡量生成的答案是否 **真正回答了用户的问题**，而非答非所问。"},"4585":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-236","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-relevance答案相关性","content":"评估方法：让 LLM 根据答案反向生成若干可能的问题，计算这些问题与原始问题的语义相似度。相似度越高，说明答案越切题。"},"4586":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-237","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-relevance答案相关性","content":"**指标低的原因**：查询理解不足、答案过于笼统或偏离主题、Prompt 模板设计不当。\n**优化方向**：优化 Prompt 模板、加入查询意图识别、对答案进行相关性后处理。"},"4587":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-238","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-correctness答案正确性","content":"衡量最终答案与标准答案（Ground Truth）的 **正确程度**，需要标注数据支撑。"},"4588":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-239","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-correctness答案正确性","content":"通常结合 LLM 评判和 F1 分数计算。"},"4589":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-240","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#answer-similarity答案相似度","content":"衡量生成答案与标准答案的 **语义相似度**。"},"4590":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-241","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标                | 评估对象 | 计算方式        | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ----------------- | ---- | ----------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Context Precision | 检索结果 | 相关文档 / 检索文档 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4591":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-242","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标             | 评估对象 | 计算方式          | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| -------------- | ---- | ------------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Context Recall | 检索结果 | 检索到的相关 / 全部相关 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4592":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-243","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标                | 评估对象 | 计算方式   | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ----------------- | ---- | ------ | ------ | ---- |\n| Context Relevance | 检索结果 | LLM 打分 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4593":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-244","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标           | 评估对象 | 计算方式          | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ------------ | ---- | ------------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Faithfulness | 生成答案 | 有支撑的声明 / 全部声明 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4594":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-245","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标               | 评估对象 | 计算方式    | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Answer Relevance | 生成答案 | 反向问题相似度 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4595":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-246","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标                 | 评估对象 | 计算方式        | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ------------------ | ---- | ----------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Answer Correctness | 端到端  | F1 / LLM 评判 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4596":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-247","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#指标速查表","content":"| 指标                | 评估对象 | 计算方式    | 取值范围   | 越高越好 |\n| ----------------- | ---- | ------- | ------ | ---- |\n| Answer Similarity | 端到端  | 语义余弦相似度 | [0, 1] | ✅    |","table":"table-11"},"4597":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-248","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"当各项指标偏低时，可按以下方向逐步优化："},"4598":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-249","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"**优化优先级建议**："},"4599":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-250","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"**先调检索，再调生成** — 检索是基础，检索不到正确信息，生成再好也无用"},"4600":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-251","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"**先调 Prompt，再换模型** — Prompt 优化成本最低，效果立竿见影"},"4601":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-252","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"**先加 Reranker，再改检索策略** — Reranker 是性价比最高的检索优化手段"},"4602":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-253","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#综合优化策略","content":"**建立评估-优化闭环** — 定期评估 → 发现瓶颈 → 针对优化 → 再次评估"},"4603":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-254","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架    | 语言     | 核心特点                      | 适用场景      |\n| ----- | ------ | ------------------------- | --------- |\n| RAGAS | Python | 业界标准，指标全面，支持 LLM-as-Judge | 通用 RAG 评估 |","table":"table-12"},"4604":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-255","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架      | 语言     | 核心特点            | 适用场景   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------- | ------ |\n| TruLens | Python | 可观测性强，支持实时监控和反馈 | 生产环境监控 |","table":"table-12"},"4605":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-256","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架       | 语言     | 核心特点                   | 适用场景  |\n| -------- | ------ | ---------------------- | ----- |\n| DeepEval | Python | 类 Pytest 风格，易于集成 CI/CD | 自动化测试 |","table":"table-12"},"4606":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-257","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架        | 语言        | 核心特点                | 适用场景         |\n| --------- | --------- | ------------------- | ------------ |\n| LangSmith | Python/TS | LangChain 官方平台，可视化强 | LangChain 生态 |","table":"table-12"},"4607":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-258","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架              | 语言     | 核心特点                       | 适用场景  |\n| --------------- | ------ | -------------------------- | ----- |\n| Phoenix (Arize) | Python | 可观测性 + 追踪，支持 OpenTelemetry | 调试与分析 |","table":"table-12"},"4608":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-259","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#评估框架","content":"| 框架       | 语言     | 核心特点              | 适用场景  |\n| -------- | ------ | ----------------- | ----- |\n| rag-eval | Python | NVIDIA 出品，支持多种检索器 | 大规模评估 |","table":"table-12"},"4609":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-260","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"将评估集成到 RAG 系统的开发和运维流程中："},"4610":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-261","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"**评估数据集构建要点**："},"4611":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-262","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"**数量**：至少 50-100 条覆盖典型场景的 QA 对"},"4612":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-263","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"**多样性**：覆盖简单事实、复杂推理、多文档聚合、无答案场景"},"4613":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-264","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"**标注**：每条需有 `question`、`ground_truth`、`reference_contexts`"},"4614":{"id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced-265","page_id":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/ai/rag_advanced#自动化评估流程","content":"**维护**：随知识库更新定期补充新样本"},"4615":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","type":"page","content":"命