ORITY：线程优先级（1~10），数字越大，优先级越高\n> &#8195;STATE：线程的状态\n> &#8195;CPU%：线程占用的 cpu 使用率，采样 100ms\n> &#8195;TIME：线程运行总时间，数据格式为`分:秒` > &#8195;INTERRUPTED：线程当前的中断位状态\n> &#8195;DAEMON：是否为 daemon 线程"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"**作用**：查看当前 JVM 中的线程堆栈信息"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"**参数说明**："},"4658":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"| 参数名称 | 参数说明  |\n| ---- | ----- |\n| `数字` | 线程 ID |","table":"table-1"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-43","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"| 参数名称   | 参数说明              |\n| ------ | ----------------- |\n| `[n:]` | 指定最忙的前 N 个线程并打印堆栈 |","table":"table-1"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-44","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"| 参数名称  | 参数说明          |\n| ----- | ------------- |\n| `[b]` | 找出当前阻塞其它线程的线程 |","table":"table-1"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-45","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"| 参数名称          | 参数说明                   |\n| ------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `[i <value>]` | 指定 cpu 占比统计的采样间隔，单位为毫秒 |","table":"table-1"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/command#thread-线程","content":"| 参数名称    | 参数说明      |\n| ------- | --------- |\n| `--all` | 显示所有匹配的线程 |","table":"table-1"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/command-47","pa