速安装"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用-arthas-boot推荐","content":"使用 arthas-boot（推荐）"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用assh","content":"使用`as.sh`"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#全量安装","content":"全量安装"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#卸载","content":"卸载"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Arthas 是 Alibaba 开源的 Java 诊断工具，能帮助开发人员快速定位并解决 Java 开发过程中遇到的问题。"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","content":"当你遇到以下类似问题而束手无策时，Arthas 可以帮助你解决：  \n&#8195;① 这个类从哪个 jar 包加载的？为什么会报各种类相关的 Exception？\n&#8195;② 我改的代码为什么没有执行到？难道是我没 commit？分支搞错了？\n&#8195;③ 遇到问题无法在线上 debug，难道只能通过加日志再重新发布吗？\n&#8195;④ 线上遇到某个用户的数据处理有问题，但线上同样无法 debug，线下无法重现！\n&#8195;⑤ 是否有一个全局视角来查看系统的运行状况？\n&#8195;⑥ 有什么办法可以监控到 JVM 的实时运行状态？\n&#8195;⑦ 怎么快速定位应用的热点，生成火焰图？\n&#8195;⑧ 怎样直接从 JVM 内查找某个类的实例？"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Arthas 支持`JDK 6+`，支持 Linux/Mac/Windows，采用命令行交互模式，同时提供丰富的 Tab 自动补全功能，进一步方便进行问题的定位和诊断。"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#快速安装","content":"官网文档地址：Arthas Install"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用-arthas-boot推荐","content":"下载`arthas-boot.jar`，然后用`java -jar`的方式启动："},"4710":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用-arthas-boot推荐","content":"打印帮助信息："},"4711":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用-arthas-boot推荐","content":"> 如果下载速度比较慢，可以使用 aliyun 的镜像：\n>\n> ```shell :no-line-numbers\n> java -jar arthas-boot.jar --repo-mirror aliyun --use-http\n> ```"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用assh","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Arthas 支持在 Linux/Unix/Mac 等平台上一键安装，请复制以下内容，并粘贴到命令行中，敲`回车`执行即可："},"4713":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#使用assh","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;上述命令会下载启动脚本文件`as.sh`到当前目录，你可以放在任何地方或将其加入到 $PATH 中。直接在 shell 下面执行`./as.sh`，就会进入交互界面。也可以执行`./as.sh -h`来获取更多参数信息。"},"4714":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#全量安装","content":"&#8195;&#8195;上面的快速安装方式，你会发现下载的包很小，但是在实际运行的时候还会去下载一些额外的包，如果你的设备访问互联网很慢，可以使用下面的全量安装方式。"},"4715":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#全量安装","content":"&#8195;&#8195;最新版本下载：Arthas"},"4716":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#全量安装","content":"&#8195;&#8195;解压后的目录有`arthas-boot.jar`，然后用`java -jar`的方式启动；此外还有脚本`as.sh`(Linux/Unix/Mac)和`as.bat`(windows)，各自运行平台脚本的方式也可以启动。"},"4717":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#全量安装","content":"> 主机解压命令：`unzip arthas-packaging-bin.zip`，当启动时，在`arthas-packaging-bin`同级目录下，有个`log`的文件夹，这个用于记录`arthas`日志。"},"4718":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#卸载","content":"① Linux/Unix/Mac 平台"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/arthas/introduce#卸载","content":"② Windows 平台直接删除用户目录下面的`.arthas`和`logs/arthas`目录"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","type":"page","content":"索引的数据结构","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL高级篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index#为什么使用索引","content":"为什么使用索引"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index#索引的优缺点","content":"索引的优缺点"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index#索引概述","content":"索引概述"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_index","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/data_structure_of_inde