bose，提供更多的详细信息输出  \n> -h：--hash，软件包安装的时候列出哈希标记，展示进度条"},"5106":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-79","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"④ 可能遇到的报错，使用`yum remove mysql-libs`，清除之前安装过的依赖即可"},"5107":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-80","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"② 查看 MySQL 版本"},"5108":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-81","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"③ 服务的初始化"},"5109":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-82","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"为了保证数据库目录与文件的所有者为 mysql 登录用户，如果你是以 root 身份运行 mysql 服务，需要执\n行下面的命令初始化："},"5110":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-83","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"> 说明： `--initialize` 选项默认以\"安全\"模式来初始化，则会为 root 用户生成一个密码并将 该密码标记为过期，登录后你需要设置一个新的密码。生成的 临时密码 会往日志中记录一份"},"5111":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-84","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"查看密码："},"5112":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-85","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"④ 启动 MySQL，查看状态"},"5113":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-86","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"mysqld 这个可执行文件就代表着 MySQL 服务器程序，运行这个可执行文件就可以直接启动一个服务器进程"},"5114":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-87","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"查看进程：`ps -ef | grep mysqld`"},"5115":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-88","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"⑤ 查看服务是否自启动"},"5116":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-89","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#安装过程","content":"> 默认是 enable，如果不是可以运行下面命令进行设置："},"5117":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-90","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#首次登录","content":"通过命令`mysql -hlocalhost -P3306 -uroot -p`进行登录，在`Enter password:`输入初始化密码(上面 mysqld.log 中获取的密码)"},"5118":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-91","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改密码","content":"因为初始化密码默认是过期的，所以查看数据库会报错，修改密码："},"5119":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-92","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改密码","content":"5.7 版本之后（不含 5.7），mysql 加入了全新的密码安全机制，设置新密码太简单会报错。"},"5120":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-93","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改密码","content":"改为更复杂的密码规则之后，设置成功，可以正常使用数据库了"},"5121":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-94","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#设置远程登录","content":"在远程连接 MySQL 数据库时，可能会遇到连接不上的情况，需要进行问题排查。"},"5122":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-95","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#确认网络","content":"**关闭防火墙或开放端口**："},"5123":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-96","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#确认网络","content":"方式一：关闭防火墙"},"5124":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-97","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#确认网络","content":"方式二：开放端口"},"5125":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-98","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#linux-下修改配置","content":"在 Linux 系统 MySQL 下测试，可以看到 root 用户的当前主机配置信息为 localhost"},"5126":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-99","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#linux-下修改配置","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Host 列指定了允许用户登录所使用的 IP，比如`user=root Host=192.168.1.1`，表示 root 用户只能通过 192.168.1.1 的客户端去访问。 `user=root Host=localhost`表示只能通过本机客户端去访问。而`%`是个通配符，如果`Host=192.168.1.%`，就表示只要 IP 地址前缀是`192.168.1.`的客户端都可以连接。如果`Host=%`，表示所有 IP 都有连接权限。"},"5127":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-100","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#linux-下修改配置","content":"注意：在生产环境下不能为了省事将 host 设置为%，这样做会存在安全问题，具体的设置可以根据生产环境的 IP 进行设置。"},"5128":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-101","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#linux-下修改配置","content":"&#8195;&#8195;进行上面排查后，重新进行连接，如果连接报错`'caching_sha2_password' cannot be loaded`，分析是 MySQL 密码加密方法变了。解决方法参考 ：基础篇环境搭建"},"5129":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-102","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#mysql-不同版本设置密码可能出现","content":"MySQL5.7 中：成功"},"5130":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-103","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#mysql-不同版本设置密码可能出现","content":"MySQL8.0 中：失败"},"5131":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-104","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#mysql-8-之前的安全策略","content":"在 MySQL 8.0 之前，MySQL 使用的是 validate_password 插件检测、验证账号密码强度，保障账号的安全性。"},"5132":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-105","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#方式一在参数文件-mycnf-中添加参数","content":"> ① plugin library 中的 validate_password 文件名的后缀名根据平台不同有所差异。 对于 Unix 和 Unix-like 系统而言，它的文件后缀名是`.so`，对于 Windows 系统而言，它的文件后缀名是`.dll`\n>\n> ② 修改参数后必须重启 MySQL 服务才能生效\n>\n> ③ 参数 FORCE_PLUS_PERMANENT 是为了防止插件在 MySQL 运行时的时候被卸载。当你卸载插件时就会报错。如下所示："},"5133":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-106","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#方式二运行时命令安装","content":"> 此方法也会注册到元数据，也就是 mysql.plugin 表中，所以不用担心 MySQL 重启后插件会失效"},"5134":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-107","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#validate_password-说明","content":"&#8195;&#8195;MySQL 8.0 引入了服务器组件（Components）这个特性，validate_password 插件已用服务器组件重新实现。8.0.25 版本的数据库中，默认自动安装 validate_password 组件。"},"5135":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-108","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#validate_password-说明","content":"未安装插件前，执行如下两个指令，执行效果："},"5136":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-109","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#validate_password-说明","content":"安装插件后，执行如下两个指令，执行效果："},"5137":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-110","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#validate_password-说明","content":"关于`validate_password`组件对应的系统变量说明："},"5138":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-111","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#validate_password-说明","content":"> 提示：组件和插件的默认值可能有所不同。例如，MySQL 5.7. validate_password_check_user_name 的默认值为 OFF。"},"5139":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-112","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改安全策略","content":"修改密码验证安全强度："},"5140":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-113","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改安全策略","content":"此外，还可以修改密码中字符的长度："},"5141":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-114","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"&#8195;&#8195;如果你创建密码是遇到`Your password does not satisfy the current policy requirements`，可以通过函数组件去检测密码是否满足条件： 0-100。当评估在 100 时就是说明使用上了最基本的规则：大写+小写+特殊字符+数字组成的 8 位以上密码"},"5142":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-115","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"如果没有安装 validate_password 组件或插件的话，那么这个函数永远都返回 0。 关于密码复杂度对应的密码复杂度策略。如下表格所示："},"5143":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-116","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"| Password Test Return | Value |\n| -------------------- | ----- |\n| Length &lt; 4        | 0     |","table":"table-1"},"5144":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-117","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"| Password Test Return                         | Value |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| Length ≥ 4 and &lt; validate_password.length | 25    |","table":"table-1"},"5145":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-118","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"| Password Test Return     | Value |\n| ------------------------ | ----- |\n| Satisfies policy 1 (LOW) | 50    |","table":"table-1"},"5146":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-119","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"| Password Test Return        | Value |\n| --------------------------- | ----- |\n| Satisfies policy 2 (MEDIUM) | 75    |","table":"table-1"},"5147":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-120","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#密码强度测试","content":"| Password Test Return        | Value |\n| --------------------------- | ----- |\n| Satisfies policy 3 (STRONG) | 100   |","table":"table-1"},"5148":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-121","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#卸载插件或组件","content":"**卸载插件**："},"5149":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-122","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#卸载插件或组件","content":"**卸载组件**："},"5150":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-123","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改步骤","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在 MySQL8.0 版本之前，默认字符集为`latin1`，`utf8`字符集指向的是`utf8mb3`。网站开发人员在数据库设计的时候往往会将编码修改为 utf8 字符集。如果遗忘修改默认的编码，就会出现乱码的问题。从 MySQL8.0 开始，数据库的默认编码将改为`utf8mb4`，从而避免上述乱码的问题。"},"5151":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-124","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改步骤","content":"**查看默认使用的字符集**："},"5152":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-125","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改步骤","content":"> MySQL 5.7 默认的客户端和服务器都用了latin1 ，不支持中文，保存中文会报错。"},"5153":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-126","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改步骤","content":"**修改字符集**："},"5154":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-127","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#修改步骤","content":"> 注意：此处修改后，原库和原表的设定不会发生变化，参数修改只对新建的数据库生效。"},"5155":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-128","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#已有库或表字符集变更","content":"> 注意：原有的数据如果是用非`utf8`编码的话，数据本身编码不会发生改变。已有数据需要导出或删除，然后重新插入。"},"5156":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-129","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"MySQL 有四个级别的字符集和比较规则，分别是：服务器级别、数据库级别、表级别、列级别"},"5157":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-130","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"| 字符集级别                  | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | --------- |\n| `character_set_server` | 服务器级别的字符集 |","table":"table-2"},"5158":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-131","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"| 字符集级别                    | 说明        |\n| ------------------------ | --------- |\n| `character_set_database` | 当前数据库的字符集 |","table":"table-2"},"5159":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-132","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"| 字符集级别                  | 说明             |\n| ---------------------- | -------------- |\n| `character_set_client` | 服务器解码请求时使用的字符集 |","table":"table-2"},"5160":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-133","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"| 字符集级别                      | 说明                                                                |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `character_set_connection` | 服务器处理请求时会把请求字符串从 character_set_client 转为 character_set_connection |","table":"table-2"},"5161":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-134","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#各级别的字符集","content":"| 字符集级别                   | 说明                 |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `character_set_results` | 服务器向客户端返回数据时使用的字符集 |","table":"table-2"},"5162":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-135","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#服务器级别character_set_server","content":"&#8195;&#8195;启动服务器程序时通过启动选项或者在服务器程序运行过程中使用 SET 语句修改这两个变量的值，在配置文件中可以这么写："},"5163":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-136","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#服务器级别character_set_server","content":"&#8195;&#8195;当服务器启动的时候读取这个配置文件后这两个系统变量的值便修改了。"},"5164":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-137","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#数据库级别character_set_database","content":"&#8195;&#8195;创建和修改数据库的时候可以指定该数据库的字符集和比较规则，具体语法如下："},"5165":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-138","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#表级别","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在创建和修改表的时候指定表的字符集和比较规则，语法如下："},"5166":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-139","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#表级别","content":"> 如果创建和修改表的语句中没有指明字符集和比较规则，将使用该表所在数据库的字符集和比较规则作为该表的字符集和比较规则。"},"5167":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-140","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#列级别","content":"&#8195;&#8195;对于存储字符串的列，同一个表中的不同的列也可以有不同的字符集和比较规则。我们在创建和修改列定义的时候可以指定该列的字符集和比较规则，语法如下："},"5168":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-141","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#小结","content":"我们介绍的这 4 个级别字符集和比较规则的联系如下：  \n&#8195;① 如果创建或修改列时没有显式的指定字符集和比较规则，则该列默认用表的字符集和比较规则；  \n&#8195;② 如果创建表时没有显式的指定字符集和比较规则，则该表默认用数据库的字符集和比较规则；  \n&#8195;③ 如果创建数据库时没有显式的指定字符集和比较规则，则该数据库默认用服务器的字符集和比较规则。"},"5169":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-142","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#utf8-与-utf8mb4","content":"&#8195;&#8195;utf8 字符集表示一个字符需要使用 1 ～ 4 个字节，但是我们常用的一些字符使用 1 ～ 3 个字节就可以表示了，而字符集表示一个字符所用的最大字节长度，在某些方面会影响系统的存储和性能，所以设计 MySQL 的设计者偷偷的定义了两个概念：  \n&#8195;① `utf8mb3`：阉割过的 utf8 字符集，只使用 1 ～ 3 个字节表示字符。  \n&#8195;② `utf8mb4`：正宗的 utf8 字符集，使用 1 ～ 4 个字节表示字符。"},"5170":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-143","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#比较规则","content":"> 最后一列`Maxlen`，它代表该种字符集表示一个字符最多需要几个字节"},"5171":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-144","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#比较规则","content":"&#8195;&#8195;上表中，MySQL 版本一共支持 41 种字符集，其中的`Default collation`列表示这种字符集中一种默认的比较规则，里面包含着该比较规则主要作用于哪种语言，比如`utf8_polish_ci`表示以波兰语的规则比较，`utf8_spanish_ci`是以西班牙语的规则比较，`utf8_general_ci`是一种通用的比较规则。后缀表示该比较规则是否区分语言中的重音、大小写。具体如下："},"5172":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-145","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall#比较规则","content":"| 后缀    | 英文释义                 | 描述    |\n| ----- | -------------------- | ----- |\n| `_ai` | `accent insensitive` | 不区分重音 |","table":"table-3"},"5173":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/advanced/install_and_uninstall-146"