ding","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#删除表","content":"删除表"},"5780":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"清空表"},"5781":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#内容扩展","content":"内容扩展"},"5782":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"扩展一 MySQL 字段命名"},"5783":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展二-如何理解清空表删除表等操作需谨慎","content":"扩展二 如何理解清空表、删除表等操作需谨慎?"},"5784":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展三-mysql8-新特性-ddl-的原子化","content":"扩展三 MySQL8 新特性-DDL 的原子化"},"5785":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#练习","content":"练习"},"5786":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#一条数据存储的过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;存储数据是处理数据的第一步。只有正确地把数据存储起来，我们才能进行有效的处理和分析。否则，只能是一团乱麻，无从下手。"},"5787":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#一条数据存储的过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;那么，怎样才能把用户各种经营相关的、纷繁复杂的数据，有序、高效地存储起来呢？ 在 MySQL 中，一个完整的数据存储过程总共有 4 步，分别是创建数据库、确认字段、创建数据表、插入数据。"},"5788":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#一条数据存储的过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;我们要先创建一个数据库，而不是直接创建数据表呢？"},"5789":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#一条数据存储的过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;因为从系统架构的层次上看，MySQL 数据库系统从大到小依次是数据库服务器、数据库、数据表、数据表的行与列。"},"5790":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#一条数据存储的过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;MySQL 数据库服务器之前已经安装。所以，我们就从创建数据库开始。"},"5791":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#标识符命名规则","content":"(1) 数据库名、表名不得超过 30 个字符，变量名限制为 29 个  \n(2) 必须只能包含`A–Z, a–z, 0 – 9 , _`共 63 个字符  \n(3) 数据库名、表名、字段名等对象名中间不要包含空格  \n(4) 同一个 MySQL 软件中，数据库不能同名；同一个库中，表不能重名；同一个表中，字段不能重名  \n(5) 必须保证你的字段没有和保留字、数据库系统或常用方法冲突。如果坚持使用，请在 SQL 语句中使用着重号(`)引起来  \n(6) 保持字段名和类型的一致性：在命名字段并为其指定数据类型的时候一定要保证一致性，假如数据类型在一个表里是整数，那在另一个表里可就别变成字符型了"},"5792":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#mysql-中的数据类型","content":"MySQL数据类型精讲点击跳转"},"5793"