ase/create_management_table#重命名字段","content":"举例："},"5836":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#删除字段","content":"举例："},"5837":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#删除字段","content":"与添加、修改字段不同的是删除字段一次只能有一个字段被删除，此外在删除字段时，被修改的表至少要保留一个字段。"},"5838":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#重命名表","content":"**方式一**："},"5839":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#重命名表","content":"举例："},"5840":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#重命名表","content":"**方式二**："},"5841":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-78","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#重命名表","content":"举例："},"5842":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-79","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#删除表","content":"举例："},"5843":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-80","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#删除表","content":"(1) 数据和结构都被删除  \n(2) 所有正在运行的相关事务被提交  \n(3) 所有相关索引被删除  \n(4) `DROP TABLE table_name;` 语句不能被回滚"},"5844":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-81","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"**方式一**："},"5845":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-82","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"举例："},"5846":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-83","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"**方式二**："},"5847":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-84","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"举例："},"5848":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-85","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"(1) `TRUNCATE TABLE`语句可以删除表中所有的行，并释放表的存储空间"},"5849":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-86","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"(2) `DELETE FROM`语句也可以删除表中所有的行，但不能释放表的存储空间"},"5850":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-87","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"(3) `TRUNCATE`语句不能回滚，而使用`DELETE`语句可以实现回滚"},"5851":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-88","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"(3) 相比而言，`TRUNCATE TABLE`语句速度更快，因为它是数据定义语言，直接提交，不会产生回滚信息，也不会触发表的删除触发器"},"5852":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-89","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"> 阿里开发规范：\n>\n> 【参考】TRUNCATE TABLE 比 DELETE 速度快，且使用的系统和事务日志资源少，但 TRUNCATE 无事务且不触发 TRIGGER，有可能造成事故，故不建议在开发代码中使用此语句。\n>\n> 【说明】TRUNCATE TABLE 在功能上与不带 WHERE 子句的 DELETE 语句相同。"},"5853":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-90","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"① DCL 中`COMMIT`和`ROLLBACK`  \n**COMMIT**：一旦执行 COMMIT，则数据就被永久的保存在数据库中，意味着数据不可以回滚  \n**ROLLBACK**：一旦执行 ROLLBACK，则可以实现数据的回滚，回滚到最近的一次 COMMIT 之后"},"5854":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-91","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"② 对比`TRUNCATE TABLE`和`DELETE FROM`  \n**相同点**：都可以实现对表中所有数据的删除，同时保留表结构  \n**不同点**：  \n&#8195;&#8195;TRUNCATE TABLE： 一旦执行此操作，表数据全部清除。同时，数据是不可以回滚的；  \n&#8195;&#8195;DELETE FROM：一旦执行此操作，表数据可以全部清除(不带 WHERE)。同时，数据是可以实现回滚；"},"5855":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-92","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#清空表","content":"③ DDL 和 DML 说明  \n&#8195;&#8195;DDL 的操作一旦执行，就不可回滚，指令`SET autocommit = FALSE`对 DDL 操作失效；  \n&#8195;&#8195;DML 的操作默认情况，一旦执行，也是不可回滚的，但是，如果在执行 DML 之前，执行了`SET autocommit = FALSE`，则执行的 DML 操作就可以实现回滚。"},"5856":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-93","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【强制】表名、字段名必须使用小写字母或数字，禁止出现数字开头，禁止两个下划线中间只出现数字。数据库字段名的修改代价很大，因为无法进行预发布，所以字段名称需要慎重考虑。  \n正例：aliyun_admin，rdc_config，level3_name  \n反例：AliyunAdmin，rdcConfig，level_3_name"},"5857":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-94","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【强制】禁用保留字，如 desc、range、match、delayed 等，请参考 MySQL 官方保留字。"},"5858":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-95","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【强制】表必备三字段：id, gmt_create, gmt_modified。"},"5859":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-96","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"> 说明：其中 id 必为主键，类型为 BIGINT UNSIGNED、单表时自增、步长为 1。gmt_create,gmt_modified 的类型均为 DATETIME 类型，前者现在时表示主动式创建，后者过去分词表示被动式更新"},"5860":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-97","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【推荐】表的命名最好是遵循\"业务名称\\_表的作用\"。  \n正例：alipay_task 、 force_project、 trade_config"},"5861":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-98","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【推荐】库名与应用名称尽量一致。"},"5862":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-99","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"【参考】合适的字符存储长度，不但节约数据库表空间、节约索引存储，更重要的是提升检索速度。  \n正例：无符号值可以避免误存负数，且扩大了表示范围。"},"5863":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-100","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"| 对象  | 年龄区间    | 类型               | 字节  | 表示范围         |\n| --- | ------- | ---------------- | --- | ------------ |\n| 人   | 150 岁之内 | tinyint unsigned | 1   | 无符号值：0 到 255 |","table":"table-2"},"5864":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-101","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"| 对象  | 年龄区间 | 类型                 | 字节  | 表示范围           |\n| --- | ---- | ------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| 龟   | 数百岁  | smallint unnsigned | 2   | 无符号值：0 到 65535 |","table":"table-2"},"5865":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-102","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"| 对象   | 年龄区间 | 类型           | 字节  | 表示范围            |\n| ---- | ---- | ------------ | --- | --------------- |\n| 恐龙化石 | 数千万年 | int unsigned | 4   | 无符号值：0 到 约 43 亿 |","table":"table-2"},"5866":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-103","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展一-mysql-字段命名","content":"| 对象  | 年龄区间    | 类型              | 字节  | 表示范围                  |\n| --- | ------- | --------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| 太阳  | 约 50 亿年 | bigint unsigned | 8   | 无符号值：0 到 约 10 的 19 次方 |","table":"table-2"},"5867":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-104","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展二-如何理解清空表删除表等操作需谨慎","content":"&#8195;&#8195;`表删除`操作将把表的定义和表中的数据一起删除，并且 MySQL 在执行删除操作时，不会有任何的确认信息提示，因此执行删除操时应当慎重。在删除表前，最好对表中的数据进行备份，这样当操作失误时可以对数据进行恢复，以免造成无法挽回的后果。"},"5868":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-105","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展二-如何理解清空表删除表等操作需谨慎","content":"&#8195;&#8195;同样的，在使用`ALTER TABLE`进行表的基本修改操作时，在执行操作过程之前，也应该确保对数据进行完整的备份，因为数据库的改变是无法撤销的，如果添加了一个不需要的字段，可以将其删除；相同的，如果删除了一个需要的列，该列下面的所有数据都将会丢失。"},"5869":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-106","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展三-mysql8-新特性-ddl-的原子化","content":"在 MySQL 8.0 版本中，InnoDB 表的 DDL 支持事务完整性，即 DDL 操作要么成功要么回滚。DDL 操作回滚日志写入到 data dictionary 数据字典表 mysql.innodb_ddl_log（该表是隐藏的表，通过 show tables 无法看到）中，用于回滚操作。通过设置参数，可将 DDL 操作日志打印输出到 MySQL 错误日志中。"},"5870":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-107","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展三-mysql8-新特性-ddl-的原子化","content":"分别在 MySQL 5.7 版本和 MySQL 8.0 版本中创建数据库和数据表，结果如下："},"5871":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-108","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展三-mysql8-新特性-ddl-的原子化","content":"(1) 在 MySQL 5.7 版本中，测试步骤如下： 删除数据表 book1 和数据表 book2，结果如下："},"5872":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table-109","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/create_management_table#扩展三-mysql