量  \n(19) 统计每一种 note 的数量，并合计总量  \n(20) 统计库存量前三名的图书  \n(21) 找出最早出版的一本书  \n(22) 找出 novel 中价格最高的一本书  \n(23) 找出书名中字数最多的一本书，不含空格"},"5924":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing#综合案例","content":"**答案**："},"5925":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing#综合案例","content":"点击展开查看"},"5926":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_processing#综合案例","content":"① 分页显示公式：`(当前页数 - 1) * 每页条数, 每页条数`(知识回顾)  \n② 统计总数`WITH ROLLUP`(知识回顾)  \n③ `CASE...WHEN...THEN...`的使用(知识回顾)  \n④ 字符串函数(知识回顾)"},"5927":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","type":"page","content":"数据查询","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query"},"5928":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query#sql-概述","content":"SQL 概述"},"5929":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query#sql-背景","content":"SQL 背景"},"5930":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query#sql-语言排行榜","content":"SQL 语言排行榜"},"5931":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query#sql-分类","content":"SQL 分类"},"5932":{"id":"/docs/bac