ha2_password`"},"6273":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/environment_building-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/environment_building","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/environment_building#authentication-plugin-caching_sha2_password-cannot-be-loaded","content":"**解决**：  \n(1) 升级图形化工具使其支持  \n(2) 用户登录密码加密规则还原为`mysql_native_password`"},"6274":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base"},"6275":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"目录"},"6276":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"<Card title=\"数据库概述\" href=\"/docs/backend/database/base/database_overview\" description=\"入门(可跳)\" />"},"6277":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"<Card title=\"环境搭建\" href=\"/docs/backend/database/base/environment_building\" description=\"入门(可跳)\" />"},"6278":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"<Card title=\"数据查询\" href=\"/docs/backend/database/base/data_query\" description=\"数据查询\" />"},"6279":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"<Card title=\"运算符\" href=\"/docs/backend/database/base/operator\" description=\"运算符\" />"},"6280":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base#目录","content":"<Card title=\"排序与分页\" href=\"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_pag