content":"| 函数         | 用法                                                         |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `MD5(str)` | 返回字符串 str 的 md5 加密后的值，也是一种加密方式。若参数为 NULL，则会返回 NULL，加密结果不可逆 |","table":"table-18"},"6602":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function-151","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function#加密与解密函数","content":"| 函数         | 用法                                                                   |\n| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `SHA(str)` | 从原明文密码 str 计算并返回加密后的密码字符串，当参数为 NULL 时，返回 NULL。不可逆，SHA 加密算法比 MD5 更加安全 |","table":"table-18"},"6603":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function-152","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function#加密与解密函数","content":"| 函数                            | 用法                                                |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `ENCODE(value,password_seed)` | 返回使用 password_seed 作为加密密码加密 value [MySQL 8.0 中启用] |","table":"table-18"},"6604":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function-153","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function#加密与解密函数","content":"| 函数                            | 用法                                                |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `DECODE(value,password_seed)` | 返回使用 password_seed 作为加密密码解密 value [MySQL 8.0 中启用] |","table":"table-18"},"6605":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function-154","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/one_line_function#mysql-信息函数","content":"| 函数         