end/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#算数运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用          | 示例              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------- | --------------- |\n| `+` | 加法运算符 | 计算两个值或表达式的和 | `SELECT a + b;` |","table":"table-0"},"6643":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#算数运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用          | 示例              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------- | --------------- |\n| `-` | 减法运算符 | 计算两个值或表达式的差 | `SELECT a - b;` |","table":"table-0"},"6644":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#算数运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用           | 示例              |\n| --- | ----- | ------------ | --------------- |\n| `*` | 乘法运算符 | 计算两个值或表达式的乘积 | `SELECT a * b;` |","table":"table-0"},"6645":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#算数运算符","content":"| 运算符       | 名称    | 作用          | 示例                               |\n| --------- | ----- | ----------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `/`或`DIV` | 除法运算符 | 计算两个值或表达式的商 | `SELECT a / b;``SELECT a DIV b;` |","table":"table-0"},"6646":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#算数运算符","content":"| 运算符       | 名称        | 作用           | 示例                               |\n| --------- | --------- | ------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `%`或`MOD` | 求模(求余)运算符 | 计算两个值或表达式的余数 | `SELECT a % b;``SELECT a MOD b;` |","table":"table-0"},"6647":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#加法与减法运算符","content":"**由运算结果可以得出如下结论**："},"6648":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#加法与减法运算符","content":"> ① 一个整数类型的值对整数进行加法和减法操作，结果还是一个整数；  \n> ② 一个整数类型的值对浮点数进行加法和减法操作，结果是一个浮点数；  \n> ③ 加法和减法的优先级相同，进行先加后减操作与进行先减后加操作的结果是一样的；  \n> ④ 在 Java 中，+的左右两边如果有字符串，那么表示字符串的拼接。但是在 MySQL 中+只表示数值相加。如果遇到非数值类型，先尝试转成数值，如果转失败，就按 0 计算。（补充：MySQL 中字符串拼接要使用字符串函数`CONCAT()`实现）"},"6649":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#乘法与除法运算符","content":"**由运算结果可以得出如下结论**："},"6650":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#乘法与除法运算符","content":"> ① 一个数乘以整数 1 和除以整数 1 后仍得原数；  \n> ② 一个数乘以浮点数 1 和除以浮点数 1 后变成浮点数，数值与原数相等；  \n> ③ 一个数除以整数后，不管是否能除尽，结果都为一个浮点数；  \n> ④ 一个数除以另一个数，除不尽时，结果为一个浮点数，并保留到小数点后 4 位；  \n> ⑤ 乘法和除法的优先级相同，进行先乘后除操作与先除后乘操作，得出的结果相同；  \n> ⑥ 在数学运算中， 0 不能用作除数，在 MySQL 中，一个数除以 0 为 NULL。"},"6651":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"&#8195;&#8195;比较运算符用来对表达式左边的操作数和右边的操作数进行比较，比较的结果为真则返回 1 ，比较的结果为假则返回 0 ，其他情况则返回 NULL。"},"6652":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用                |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------- |\n| `=` | 等于运算符 | 判断两个值、字符串或表达式是否相等 |","table":"table-1"},"6653":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符   | 名称      | 作用                   |\n| ----- | ------- | -------------------- |\n| `<=>` | 安全等于运算符 | 安全的判断两个值、字符串或表达式是否相等 |","table":"table-1"},"6654":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符       | 名称     | 作用                 |\n| --------- | ------ | ------------------ |\n| `<>`或`!=` | 不等于运算符 | 判断两个值、字符串或表达式是否不相等 |","table":"table-1"},"6655":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用                    |\n| --- | ----- | --------------------- |\n| `<` | 小于运算符 | 判断前面的是否小于后面的值、字符串或表达式 |","table":"table-1"},"6656":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 名称      | 作用                       |\n| ---- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `<=` | 小于等于运算符 | 判断前面的是否小于或等于后面的值、字符串或表达式 |","table":"table-1"},"6657":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 名称    | 作用                    |\n| --- | ----- | --------------------- |\n| `>` | 大于运算符 | 判断前面的是否大于后面的值、字符串或表达式 |","table":"table-1"},"6658":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#比较运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 名称      | 作用                       |\n| ---- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `>=` | 大于等于运算符 | 判断前面的是否大于或等于后面的值、字符串或表达式 |","table":"table-1"},"6659":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"（1）等号运算符(`=`)判断等号两边的值、字符串或表达式是否相等，如果相等则返回 1 ，不相等则返回 0；"},"6660":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"（2）在使用等号运算符时，遵循如下规则："},"6661":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"如果等号两边的值、字符串或表达式都为字符串，则 MySQL 会按照字符串进行比较，其比较的是每个字符串中字符的 ANSI 编码是否相等；"},"6662":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-43","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"如果等号两边的值都是整数，则 MySQL 会按照整数来比较两个值的大小；"},"6663":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-44","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"如果等号两边的值一个是整数，另一个是字符串，则 MySQL 会将字符串转化为数字进行比较；"},"6664":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-45","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#等号运算符","content":"如果等号两边的值、字符串或表达式中有一个为 NULL，则比较结果为 NULL。"},"6665":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#安全等于运算符","content":"&#8195;&#8195;安全等于运算符(`<=>`)与等于运算符(`=`)的作用是相似的，`==`唯一的区别是`<=>`可以用来对 NULL 进行判断。在两个操作数均为 NULL 时，其返回值为 1，而不为 NULL；当一个操作数为 NULL 时，其返回值为 0，而不为 NULL。"},"6666":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-47","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#不等于运算符","content":"&#8195;&#8195;不等于运算符(`<>`或`!=`)用于判断两边的数字、字符串或者表达式的值是否不相等，如果不相等则返回 1，相等则返回 0。不等于运算符不能判断 NULL 值，如果两边的值有任意一个为 NULL，或两边都为 NULL，则结果为 NULL。"},"6667":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-48","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符       | 名称   | 作用      |\n| --------- | ---- | ------- |\n| `IS NULL` | 为空运算 | 判断值是否为空 |","table":"table-2"},"6668":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-49","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符           | 名称    | 作用       |\n| ------------- | ----- | -------- |\n| `IS NOT NULL` | 不为空运算 | 判断值是否不为空 |","table":"table-2"},"6669":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-50","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符     | 名称     | 作用        |\n| ------- | ------ | --------- |\n| `LEAST` | 最小值运算符 | 在多值中返回最小值 |","table":"table-2"},"6670":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-51","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符        | 名称     | 作用        |\n| ---------- | ------ | --------- |\n| `GREATEST` | 最大值运算符 | 在多值中返回最大值 |","table":"table-2"},"6671":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-52","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符           | 名称       | 作用            |\n| ------------- | -------- | ------------- |\n| `BETWEEN AND` | 两值之间的运算符 | 判断一个值是否存在两值之间 |","table":"table-2"},"6672":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-53","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符      | 名称    | 作用      |\n| -------- | ----- | ------- |\n| `ISNULL` | 为空运算符 | 判断值是否为空 |","table":"table-2"},"6673":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-54","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 名称    | 作用        |\n| ---- | ----- | --------- |\n| `IN` | 属于运算符 | 判断列表是否包含值 |","table":"table-2"},"6674":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-55","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符      | 名称     | 作用         |\n| -------- | ------ | ---------- |\n| `NOT IN` | 不属于运算符 | 判断列表是否不包含值 |","table":"table-2"},"6675":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-56","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符    | 名称      | 作用          |\n| ------ | ------- | ----------- |\n| `LIKE` | 模糊匹配运算符 | 判断值是否模糊匹配规则 |","table":"table-2"},"6676":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-57","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符      | 名称       | 作用             |\n| -------- | -------- | -------------- |\n| `REGEXP` | 正则表达式运算符 | 判断值是否符合正则表达式规则 |","table":"table-2"},"6677":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-58","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#非符号运算符","content":"| 运算符     | 名称       | 作用             |\n| ------- | -------- | -------------- |\n| `RLIKE` | 正则表达式运算符 | 判断值是否符合正则表达式规则 |","table":"table-2"},"6678":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-59","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#最小--最大值运算符","content":"`GREATEST`和`LEAST`函数都使用`N`个参数，并分别返回最大和最小值。  \n语法："},"6679":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-60","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#最小--最大值运算符","content":"**以下比较规则适用于这两个函数**："},"6680":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-61","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#最小--最大值运算符","content":"> ① 如果任何参数为 NULL，则两个函数都将立即返回 NULL，而不进行任何比较  \n> ② 如果在 INT 或 REAL 上下文中使用函数，或者所有参数都是整数值或 REAL 值，那么它们将分别作为 INT 和 REAL 来比较  \n> ③ 如果参数由数字和字符串组成，则函数将它们作为数字进行比较  \n> ④ 如果至少一个参数是非二进制(字符)字符串，则函数将将参数作为非二进制字符串进行比较  \n> ⑤ 在所有其他情况下，函数将参数作为二进制字符串进行比较"},"6681":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-62","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#like-运算符","content":"&#8195;&#8195;LIKE 运算符主要用来匹配字符串，通常用于模糊匹配，如果满足条件则返回 1，否则返回 0。如果给定的值或者匹配条件为 NULL，则返回结果为 NULL。"},"6682":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-63","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#like-运算符","content":"如果使用`\\`表示转义，要省略`ESCAPE`；如果不是`\\`，则要加上`ESCAPE`。"},"6683":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-64","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#regexp--rlike-运算符","content":"**语法格式**：`expr REGEXP / RLIKE 匹配条件`"},"6684":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-65","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#regexp--rlike-运算符","content":"如果`expr`满足匹配条件，返回 1；如果不满足，则返回 0。若`expr`或匹配条件任意一个为 NULL，则结果为 NULL。"},"6685":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-66","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#逻辑运算符","content":"| 运算符       | 作用  | 示例              |\n| --------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `NOT`或`!` | 逻辑非 | `SELECT NOT A;` |","table":"table-3"},"6686":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-67","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#逻辑运算符","content":"| 运算符        | 作用  | 示例                                |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| `AND`或`&&` | 逻辑与 | `SELECT A AND B;``SELECT A && B;` |","table":"table-3"},"6687":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-68","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#逻辑运算符","content":"| 运算符         | 作用  | 示例                                 |\n| ----------- | --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `OR`或`\\|\\|` | 逻辑或 | `SELECT A OR B;``SELECT A \\|\\| B;` |","table":"table-3"},"6688":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-69","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#逻辑运算符","content":"| 运算符   | 作用   | 示例              |\n| ----- | ---- | --------------- |\n| `XOR` | 逻辑异或 | `SELECT XOR A;` |","table":"table-3"},"6689":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-70","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#逻辑异或运算符","content":"> 相异为真"},"6690":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-71","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 作用  | 示例              |\n| --- | --- | --------------- |\n| `&` | 按位与 | `SELECT A & B;` |","table":"table-4"},"6691":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-72","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 作用  | 示例               |\n| ---- | --- | ---------------- |\n| `\\|` | 按位或 | `SELECT A \\| B;` |","table":"table-4"},"6692":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 作用   | 示例              |\n| --- | ---- | --------------- |\n| `^` | 按位异或 | `SELECT A ^ B;` |","table":"table-4"},"6693":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符 | 作用   | 示例           |\n| --- | ---- | ------------ |\n| `~` | 按位取反 | `SELECT ~A;` |","table":"table-4"},"6694":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 作用   | 示例               |\n| ---- | ---- | ---------------- |\n| `<<` | 按位左移 | `SELECT A << 2;` |","table":"table-4"},"6695":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"| 运算符  | 作用   | 示例               |\n| ---- | ---- | ---------------- |\n| `>>` | 按位右移 | `SELECT A >> 2;` |","table":"table-4"},"6696":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#位运算符","content":"> 位运算符是在二进制数上进行计算的运算符。位运算会先将操作数变成二进制数，进行位运算。然后再将计算结果从二进制数变回十进制数。"},"6697":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator-78","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/operator#运算符的优先级","content":"数字编号越大，优先级越高，优先级高的运算符先进行计算。可以看到，赋值运算符的优先级最低，使用`()`括起来的表达式的优先级最高。"},"6698":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"page","content":"存储过程与函数","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function"},"6699":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#存储过程概述","content":"存储过程概述"},"6700":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"理解"},"6701":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#分类","content":"分类"},"6702":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#存储过程的使用","content":"存储过程的使用"},"6703":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"语法分析"},"6704":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#调用存储过程","content":"调用存储过程"},"6705":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"示例"},"6706":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#存储函数的使用","content":"存储函数的使用"},"6707":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"语法分析"},"6708":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#调用存储函数","content":"调用存储函数"},"6709":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"示例"},"6710":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#对比存储函数和存储过程","content":"对比存储函数和存储过程"},"6711":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#存储过程和函数的查看修改和删除","content":"存储过程和函数的查看、修改和删除"},"6712":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"查看"},"6713":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#修改","content":"修改"},"6714":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#删除","content":"删除"},"6715":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#关于存储过程使用的争议","content":"关于存储过程使用的争议"},"6716":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"优点"},"6717":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"缺点"},"6718":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","content":"MySQL 从 5.0 版本开始支持存储过程和函数。存储过程和函数能够将复杂的 SQL 逻辑封装在一起，应用程序无须关注存储过程和函数内部复杂的 SQL 逻辑，而只需要简单地调用存储过程和函数即可。"},"6719":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"**含义**：存储过程(Stored Procedure)，就是一组经过预先编译的 SQL 语句的封装。"},"6720":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"**执行过程**：存储过程预先存储在 MySQL 服务器上，需要执行的时候，客户端只需要向服务器端发出调用存储过程的命令，服务器端就可以把预先存储好的这一系列 SQL 语句全部执行。"},"6721":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"**好处**：  \n&#8195;① 简化操作，提高了 SQL 语句的复用性，减少了开发人员的压力；  \n&#8195;② 减少操作过程中的失误，提高效率；  \n&#8195;③ 减少网络传输量(客户端不需要把所有的 SQL 语句通过网格发给服务器)；  \n&#8195;④ 减少了 SQL 语句暴露在网上的风险，也提高了数据查询的安全性；"},"6722":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"**与视图、函数的对比**：  \n&#8195;&#8195;它和视图有着同样的优点，清晰、安全，还可以减少网络传输量。不过它和视图不同，视图是虚拟表，通常不对底层数据表直接操作，而存储过程是程序化的 SQL，可以直接操作底层数据表，相比于面向集合的操作方式，能够实现一些更复杂的数据处理。"},"6723":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#理解","content":"&#8195;&#8195;一旦存储过程被创建出来，使用它就像使用函数一样简单，我们直接通过调用存储过程名即可。相较于函数，存储过程是没有返回值的。"},"6724":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#分类","content":"存储过程的参数类型可以是 IN、OUT 和 INOUT。根据这点分类如下：  \n① 没有参数（无参数无返回）  \n② 仅仅带 IN 类型（有参数无返回）  \n③ 仅仅带 OUT 类型（无参数有返回）  \n④ 既带 IN 又带 OUT（有参数有返回）  \n⑤ 带 INOUT（有参数有返回）"},"6725":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#分类","content":"> 注意：IN、OUT、INOUT 都可以在一个存储过程中带多个。"},"6726":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"**语法**："},"6727":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"**说明**：  \n(1) 参数名(param_name)前面的符号说明"},"6728":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"> `IN`：当前参数为输入参数，也可以叫入参；  \n> `OUT`：当前参数为输出参数，也可以叫出参；  \n> `INOUT`：当前参数既可以为输入参数，也可以为输出参数；"},"6729":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"(2) 形参类型(type)可以是 MySQL 数据类型中的任一类型；"},"6730":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"(3) `characteristics`表示创建存储过程时指定的对存储过程的约束条件"},"6731":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"> ① `LANGUAGE SQL`：说明存储过程执行体是由 SQL 语句组成的，当前系统支持的语言为 SQL；  \n> ② `[NOT] DETERMINISTIC`：指明存储过程执行的结果是否确定。每次执行存储过程，相同的输入会得到相同的输出，则表示结果是确定的(DETERMINISTIC)；反之则是不确定(NOT DETERMINISTIC)，如果没有指定默认为`NOT DETERMINISTIC`；  \n> ③ `{ CONTAINS SQL | NO SQL | READS SQL DATA | MODIFIES SQL DATA }`：指明子程序使用 SQL 语句的限制；默认情况下，系统会指定为`CONTAINS SQL`；\n>\n> - `CONTAINS SQL`：表示当前存储过程的子程序包含 SQL 语句，但是并不包含读写数据的 SQL 语句；\n> - `NO SQL`：表示当前存储过程的子程序中不包含任何 SQL 语句；\n> - `READS SQL DATA`：表示当前存储过程的子程序中包含读数据的 SQL 语句；\n> - `MODIFIES SQL DATA`：表示当前存储过程的子程序中包含写数据的 SQL 语句。\n>\n> ④ `SQL SECURITY { DEFINER | INVOKER }`：执行当前存储过程的权限，即指明哪些用户能够执行当前存储过程；如果没有设置相关的值，则 MySQL 默认指定值为`DEFINER`；\n>\n> - `DEFINER`：表示只有当前存储过程的创建者或者定义者才能执行当前存储过程；\n> - `INVOKER`：表示拥有当前存储过程的访问权限的用户能够执行当前存储过程。\n>\n> ⑤ `COMMENT 'string'`：注释信息，可以用来描述存储过程。"},"6732":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"(4) 存储过程体中可以有多条 SQL 语句，如果仅仅一条 SQL 语句，则可以省略 BEGIN 和 END；复杂的可能包含下面内容："},"6733":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析","content":"(5) 可能需要设置新的结束标记，因为 MySQL 默认的语句结束符号为分号`;`。为了避免与存储过程中 SQL 语句结束符相冲突，需要使用`DELIMITER`改变存储过程的结束符。"},"6734":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#调用存储过程","content":"**语法**："},"6735":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#调用存储过程","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在 MySQL 中，存储过程不像普通的编程语言（比如 VC++、Java 等）那样有专门的集成开发环境。因此，你可以通过 SELECT 语句，把程序执行的中间结果查询出来，来调试一个 SQL 语句的正确性。调试成功之后，把 SELECT 语句后移到下一个 SQL 语句之后，再调试下一个 SQL 语句。这样逐步推进，就可以完成对存储过程中所有操作的调试了。当然，你也可以把存储过程中的 SQL 语句复制出来，逐段单独调试。"},"6736":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(1) 创建存储过程 select_all_data()，查看 emps 表的所有数据"},"6737":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6738":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(2) 创建存储过程 avg_employee_salary()，返回所有员工的平均工资"},"6739":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6740":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(3) 创建存储过程 show_max_salary()，用来查看 emps 表的最高薪资值"},"6741":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6742":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-43","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(4) 创建存储过程 show_min_salary()，查看 emps 表的最低薪资值，并将最低薪资通过 OUT 参数 ms 输出"},"6743":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-44","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6744":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-45","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(5) 创建存储过程 show_someone_salary()，查看 emps 表的某个员工的薪资，并用 IN 参数 empname 输入员工姓名"},"6745":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6746":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-47","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(6) 创建存储过程 show_someone_salary2()，查看 emps 表的某个员工的薪资，并用 IN 参数 empname 输入员工姓名，用 OUT 参数 empsalary 输出员工薪资"},"6747":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-48","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6748":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-49","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"(7) 创建存储过程 show_mgr_name()，查询某个员工领导的姓名，并用 INOUT 参数 empname 输入员工姓名，输出领导的姓名"},"6749":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-50","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例","content":"**调用**："},"6750":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-51","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"**语法**："},"6751":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-52","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"**说明**：  \n(1) 参数列表：指定参数为`IN`、`OUT`或`INOUT`只对 PROCEDURE 是合法的，FUNCTION 中总是默认为`IN`参数；"},"6752":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-53","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"(2) `RETURNS type`语句表示函数返回的数据的类型；"},"6753":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-54","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"> RETURNS 子句只能对 FUNCTION 做指定，对函数而言这是强制的。它用来指定函数的返回类型，而且函数体必须包含一个`RETURN value`语句；"},"6754":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-55","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"(3) `characteristic`创建函数时指定的对函数的约束。取值与创建存储过程时相同，可以看上面存储过程(2.1 语法分析)的说明；"},"6755":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-56","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#语法分析-1","content":"(4) 函数体也可以用`BEGIN...END`来表示 SQL 代码的开始和结束。如果函数体只有一条语句，也可以省略`BEGIN...END`。"},"6756":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-57","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#调用存储函数","content":"在 MySQL 中，存储函数的使用方法与 MySQL 内部函数的使用方法是一样的。换言之，用户自己定义的存储函数与 MySQL 内部函数是一个性质的。区别在于，存储函数是用户自己定义的，而内部函数是 MySQL 的开发者定义的。"},"6757":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-58","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"(1) 创建存储函数，名称为 email_by_name()，参数定义为空，该函数查询 Abel 的 email，并返回，数据类型为字符串型。"},"6758":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-59","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"**调用**："},"6759":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-60","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"(2) 创建存储函数，名称为 email_by_id()，参数传入 emp_id，该函数查询 emp_id 的 email，并返回，数据类型为字符串型。"},"6760":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-61","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"**调用**："},"6761":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-62","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"(3) 创建存储函数 count_by_id()，参数传入 dept_id，该函数查询 dept_id 部门的员工人数，并返回，数据类型为整型。"},"6762":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-63","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"**调用**："},"6763":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-64","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#示例-1","content":"若在创建存储函数中报错`you might want to use the less safe log_bin_trust_function_creators variable`，有两种处理方法：  \n**方式一**：加上必要的函数特性`[NOT] DETERMINISTIC`和`{CONTAINS SQL | NO SQL | READS SQL DATA |MODIFIES SQL DATA}`  \n**方式二**："},"6764":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-65","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#对比存储函数和存储过程","content":"|      | 关键字         | 调用语法          | 返回值         |\n| ---- | ----------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| 存储过程 | `PROCEDURE` | `CALL 存储过程()` | 理解为有 0 个或多个 |","table":"table-0"},"6765":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-66","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#对比存储函数和存储过程","content":"|      | 关键字        | 调用语法          | 返回值   |\n| ---- | ---------- | ------------- | ----- |\n| 存储函数 | `FUNCTION` | `SELECT 函数()` | 只能是一个 |","table":"table-0"},"6766":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-67","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#对比存储函数和存储过程","content":"> 此外，存储函数可以放在查询语句中使用，存储过程不行。反之，存储过程的功能更加强大，包括能够执行对表的操作（比如创建表，删除表等）和事务操作，这些功能是存储函数不具备的。"},"6767":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-68","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"(1) `SHOW CREATE`语句查看创建信息"},"6768":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-69","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"(2) `SHOW STATUS`语句查看状态信息"},"6769":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-70","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"> 返回子程序的特征，如数据库、名字、类型、创建者及创建和修改日期。"},"6770":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-71","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"(3) 从`information_schema.Routines`查看"},"6771":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-72","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#查看","content":"> MySQL 中存储过程和函数的信息存储在`information_schema`数据库下的`Routines`表中。可以通过查询该表的记录来查询存储过程和函数的信息。"},"6772":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#修改","content":"> 修改存储过程或函数，不影响存储过程或函数功能，只是修改相关特性。如果需要对其参数和主体进行修改，需要先删除，然后在创建新的。\n>\n> 🐼 参数说明可以看(2.1 语法分析)中的说明的第三点"},"6773":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#修改","content":"**示例**：  \n(1) 修改存储过程 CountProc 的定义。将读写权限改为`MODIFIES SQL DATA`，并指明定义者可以执行；"},"6774":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#修改","content":"(2) 修改存储函数 CountProc 的定义。将读写权限改为`READS SQL DATA`，并加上注释信息`FIND NAME`。"},"6775":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#删除","content":"删除存储过程和函数，可以使用`DROP`语句，其语法结构如下："},"6776":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#删除","content":"**示例**："},"6777":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-78","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#关于存储过程使用的争议","content":"&#8195;&#8195;尽管存储过程有诸多优点，但是对于存储过程的使用，一直都存在着很多争议，比如有些公司对于大型项目要求使用存储过程，而有些公司在手册中明确禁止使用存储过程，为什么这些公司对存储过程的使用需求差别这么大呢？"},"6778":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-79","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"(1) **存储过程可以一次编译多次使用**  \n存储过程只在创建时进行编译，之后的使用都不需要重新编译，这就提升了 SQL 的执行效率。"},"6779":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-80","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"(2) **可以减少开发工作量**  \n将代码封装成模块，实际上是编程的核心思想之一，这样可以把复杂的问题拆解成不同的模块，然后模块之间可以重复使用，在减少开发工作量的同时，还能保证代码的结构清晰。"},"6780":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-81","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"(3) **存储过程的安全性强**  \n我们在设定存储过程的时候可以设置对用户的使用权限，这样就和视图一样具有较强的安全性。"},"6781":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-82","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"(4) **可以减少网络传输量**  \n因为代码封装到存储过程中，每次使用只需要调用存储过程即可，这样就减少了网络传输量。"},"6782":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-83","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#优点","content":"(5) **良好的封装性**  \n在进行相对复杂的数据库操作时，原本需要使用一条一条的 SQL 语句，可能要连接多次数据库才能完成的操作，现在变成了一次存储过程，只需要连接一次即可。"},"6783":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-84","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"基于上面这些优点，不少大公司都要求大型项目使用存储过程，比如微软、IBM 等公司。但是国内的阿里并不推荐开发人员使用存储过程，这是为什么呢？"},"6784":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-85","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"> 阿里开发规范  \n> 【强制】禁止使用存储过程，存储过程难以调试和扩展，更没有移植性。"},"6785":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-86","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"存储过程虽然有诸如上面的好处，但缺点也是很明显："},"6786":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-87","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"(1) **可移植性差**  \n存储过程不能跨数据库移植，比如在 MySQL、Oracle 和 SQL Server 里编写的存储过程，在换成其他数据库时都需要重新编写。"},"6787":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-88","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"(2) **调试困难**  \n只有少数 DBMS 支持存储过程的调试。对于复杂的存储过程来说，开发和维护都不容易。虽然也有一些第三方工具可以对存储过程进行调试，但要收费。"},"6788":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-89","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"(3) **存储过程的版本管理很困难**  \n比如数据表索引发生变化了，可能会导致存储过程失效。我们在开发软件的时候往往需要进行版本管理，但是存储过程本身没有版本控制，版本迭代更新的时候很麻烦。"},"6789":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-90","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"(4) **它不适合高并发的场景**  \n高并发的场景需要减少数据库的压力，有时数据库会采用分库分表的方式，而且对可扩展性要求很高，在这种情况下，存储过程会变得难以维护，增加数据库的压力，显然就不适用了。"},"6790":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function-91","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/procedure_and_function#缺点","content":"存储过程虽然方便，但也有一定的局限性。尽管不同的公司对存储过程的态度不一，但是对于我们开发人员来说，不论怎样，掌握存储过程都是必备的技能之一。"},"6791":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"page","content":"排序与分页","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging"},"6792":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#数据排序","content":"数据排序"},"6793":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"排序规则"},"6794":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#单列排序","content":"单列排序"},"6795":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#多列排序","content":"多列排序"},"6796":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"分页"},"6797":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"&#8195;&#8195;要在一个不明确顺序的查询结果中对行进行排序，可以使用`ORDER BY`子句，它必须位于 SQL 语句的最后。指定一个表达式或者一个字段名作为排序条件。`ORDER BY`子句的语法形式如下："},"6798":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"&#8195;&#8195;其中，`ORDER BY {column, expr, number}`指定需要排序的字段、表达式或序号，ASC 以升序排序，DESC 以降序排序，默认以升序排序。\n针对不同的数据类型，其默认升序的含义如下："},"6799":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"对于数字类型，小的值在前面显示"},"6800":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"对于日期类型，早的日期在前面显示"},"6801":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"对于字符串类型，依字母顺序显示，a 在前，z 在最后"},"6802":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#排序规则","content":"对于空值，升序排序时显示在最后，降序排序时显示在最前面"},"6803":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#多列排序","content":"多列排序也叫多重排序，即先以一个字段对查询结果进行排序，然后在这个排序的基础上再对另一个字段排序，最终显示经多次排序后的查询结果。"},"6804":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"**格式**："},"6805":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"第一个\"位置偏移量\"参数指示 MySQL 从哪一行开始显示，是一个可选参数，如果不指定\"位置偏移量\"，将会从表中的第一条记录开始(第一条记录的位置偏移量是 0，第二条记录的位置偏移量是 1，以此类推)；第二个参数\"行数\"指示返回的记录条数。"},"6806":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"> MySQL 8.0 中可以使用`LIMIT 3 OFFSET 4`，意思是获取从第 5 条记录开始后面的 3 条记录，和`LIMIT 4, 3`返回的结果相同。"},"6807":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"**分页**："},"6808":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/sorting_paging#分页","content":"分页显示公式：`(当前页数 - 1) * 每页条数, 每页条数`"},"6809":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"page","content":"子查询","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery"},"6810":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询","content":"子查询"},"6811":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的基本使用","content":"子查询的基本使用"},"6812":{"id":"/