ry#相关子查询","content":"相关子查询"},"6822":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#基本使用","content":"基本使用"},"6823":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#exists--not-exists","content":"EXISTS / NOT EXISTS"},"6824":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#相关更新","content":"相关更新"},"6825":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#相关删除","content":"相关删除"},"6826":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#思考题","content":"思考题"},"6827":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#练习题","content":"练习题"},"6828":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的基本使用","content":"**基本语法结构**:"},"6829":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的基本使用","content":"> 子查询(内查询)在主查询之前一次执行完成  \n> 子查询的结果被主查询(外查询)使用"},"6830":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的基本使用","content":"(1) 子查询要包含在括号内  \n(2) 将子查询放在比较条件的右侧  \n(3) 单行操作符对应单行子查询，多行操作符对应多行子查询"},"6831":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的分类","content":"**分类一**：  \n按内查询的结果返回一条还是多条记录，将子查询分为单行子查询、多行子查询。"},"6832":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询的分类","content":"**分类二**：  \n按内查询是否被执行多次，将子查询划分为相关(或关联)子查询和不相关(或非关联)子查询。"},"6833":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#单行子查询","content":"单行比较操作符：`=、>、>=、<、<=、<>`"},"6834":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#单行子查询","content":"**查询示例**："},"6835":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#子查询中的空值问题","content":"> 由于没有员工的员工编号为 666，所以返回的记录数为 0（子查询不返回任何行）"},"6836":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#非法使用子查询","content":"> 子查询返回多行，但是比较符确是单行比较符，此时 salary 无法决策与子查询返回的那个值相等，故错误"},"6837":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#多行子查询操作符","content":"多行子查询也称集合比较子查询，内查询返回多行，使用多行比较操作符。"},"6838":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#多行子查询操作符","content":"| 操作符  | 含义         |\n| ---- | ---------- |\n| `IN` | 等于列表中的任意一个 |","table":"table-0"},"6839":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":