","content":"查询管理者是 King 的员工姓名和工资"},"6856":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/subquery#练习题","content":"查询工资最高的员工的姓名，要求 first_name 和 last_name 显示为一列，列名为 姓名"},"6857":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"page","content":"触发器","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger"},"6858":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器概述","content":"触发器概述"},"6859":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的创建","content":"触发器的创建"},"6860":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#查看删除触发器","content":"查看、删除触发器"},"6861":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#查看触发器","content":"查看触发器"},"6862":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#删除触发器","content":"删除触发器"},"6863":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的优缺点","content":"触发器的优缺点"},"6864":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#优点","content":"优点"},"6865":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#缺点","content":"缺点"},"6866":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#注意点","content":"注意点"},"6867":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器概述","content":"&#8195;&#8195;触发器是一个数据库对象，是一个特殊的过程，当特定的事件发生时隐式地执行。"},"6868":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器概述","content":"&#8195;&#8195;MySQL 从 5.0.2 版本开始支持触发器。它的触发器和存储过程一样，都是嵌入到 MySQL 服务器的一段程序。"},"6869":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器概述","content":"&#8195;&#8195;触发器是由事件来触发某个操作，这些事件包括 INSERT、UPDATE、DELETE 事件。所谓事件就是指用户的动作或者触发某项行为。如果定义了触发程序，当数据库执行这些语句时候，就相当于事件发生了，就会自动激发触发器执行相应的操作。"},"6870":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器概述","content":"&#8195;&#8195;当对数据表中的数据执行插入、更新和删除操作，需要自动执行一些数据库逻辑时，可以使用触发器来实现。"},"6871":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的创建","content":"语法结构："},"6872":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的创建","content":"示例一：创建名称为 before_insert 的触发器，向 test_trigger 数据表插入数据之前，向 test_trigger_log 数据表中插入 before_insert 的日志信息"},"6873":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的创建","content":"示例二：定义触发器 salary_check_trigger，基于员工表 employees 的 INSERT 事件，在 INSERT 之前检查将要添加的新员工薪资是否大于他领导的薪资，如果大于领导薪资，则报 sqlstate_value 为’HY000’的错误，从而使得添加失败"},"6874":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#触发器的创建","content":"上面触发器声明过程中的 NEW 关键字代表 INSERT 添加语句的新记录。"},"6875":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#优点","content":"(1) 触发器可以确保数据的完整性；"},"6876":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#优点","content":"(2) 触发器可以帮助我们记录操作日志；"},"6877":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#优点","content":"(3) 触发器可以用在操作数据前，对数据进行合法性检查。"},"6878":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#缺点","content":"(1) 可读性差；"},"6879":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#缺点","content":"(2) 相关数据的变更，可能会导致触发器出错。"},"6880":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#注意点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;如果在子表中定义了外键约束，并且外键指定了 ON UPDATE/DELETE CASCADE/SET NULL 子句，此时修改父表被引用的键值或删除父表被引用的记录行时，也会引起子表的修改和删除操作，此时基于子表的 UPDATE 和 DELETE 语句定义的触发器并不会被激活。"},"6881":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/trigger#注意点","content":"例如：  \n&#8195;&#8195;基于子表员工表（t_employee）的 DELETE 语句定义了触发器 t1，而子表的部门编号（did）字段定义了外键约束引用了父表部门表（t_department）的主键列部门编号（did），并且该外键加了\"ON DELETE SET NULL\"子句，那么如果此时删除父表部门表（t_department）在子表员工表（t_employee）有匹配记录的部门记录时，会引起子表员工表（t_employee）匹配记录的部门编号（did）修改为 NULL，但是此时不会激活触发器 t1。只有直接对子表员工表（t_employee）执行 DELETE 语句时才会激活触发器 t1。"},"6882":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"page","content":"变量、流程控制与游标","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor"},"6883":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#变量","content":"变量"},"6884":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"系统变量"},"6885":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户变量","content":"用户变量"},"6886":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户会话变量","content":"用户会话变量"},"6887":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#局部变量","content":"局部变量"},"6888":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义变量","content":"定义变量"},"6889":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_