"page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#小结","content":"小结"},"6915":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#补充-mysql-80-新特性","content":"补充 MySQL 8.0 新特性"},"6916":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#全局变量持久化","content":"全局变量持久化"},"6917":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#变量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在 MySQL 数据库的存储过程和函数中，可以使用变量来存储查询或计算的中间结果数据，或者输出最终的结果数据。在 MySQL 数据库中，变量分为`系统变量`以及用户`自定义变量`。"},"6918":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;变量由系统定义，不是用户定义，属于服务器层面。启动 MySQL 服务，生成 MySQL 服务实例期间，MySQL 将为 MySQL 服务器内存中的系统变量赋值，这些系统变量定义了当前 MySQL 服务实例的属性、特征。这些系统变量的值要么是编译 MySQL 时参数的默认值，要么是配置文件（例如 my.ini 等）中的参数值。"},"6919":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"> 系统变量官方文档：  \n> MySQL 5.7：https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/server-system-variables.html  \n> MySQL 8.0：https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/server-system-variables.html"},"6920":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;系统变量分为全局系统变量（需要添加 global 关键字）以及会话系统变量（需要添加 session 关键字），有时也把全局系统变量简称为全局变量，有时也把会话系统变量称为 local 变量。 如果不写，默认会话级别。 静态变量（在 MySQL 服务实例运行期间它们的值不能使用 set 动态修改）属于特殊的全局系统变量。  \n&#8195;&#8195;在 MySQL 中有些系统变量只能是全局的，例如`max_connections`用于限制服务器的最大连接数；有些系统变量作用域既可以是全局又可以是会话，例如 `character_set_client`用于设置客户端的字符集；有些系统变量的作用域只能是当前会话，例如`pseudo_thread_id`用于标记当前会话的 MySQL 连接 ID。"},"6921":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"每一个 MySQL 客户机成功连接 MySQL 服务器后，都会产生与之对应的会话。会话期间，MySQL 服务实例会在 MySQL 服务器内存中生成与该会话对应的会话系统变量，这些会话系统变量的初始值是全局系统变量值的复制。如下图："},"6922":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"① 全局系统变量针对于所有会话(连接)有效，但不能跨重启；"},"6923":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"② 会话 1 对某个全局系统变量值的修改会导致会话 2 中同一个全局系统变量值的修改。"},"6924":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"③ 会话系统变量仅针对于当前会话(连接)有效。会话期间，当前会话对某个会话系统变量值的修改，不会影响其他会话同一个会话系统变量的值。"},"6925":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"**查看系统变量**："},"6926":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-43","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"**查看指定系统变量**："},"6927":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-44","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;作为 MySQL 编码规范，MySQL 中的系统变量以两个`@`开头，其中`@@GLOBAL`仅用于标记全局系统变量，`@@SESSION`仅用于标记会话系统变量。`@@`首先标记会话系统变量，如果会话系统变量不存在，则标记全局系统变量。"},"6928":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-45","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"**修改系统变量的值**："},"6929":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"方式一：修改 MySQL 配置文件，继而修改 MySQL 系统变量的值（该方法需要重启 MySQL 服务）；"},"6930":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-47","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"方式二：在 MySQL 服务运行期间，使用`SET`命令重新设置系统变量的值："},"6931":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-48","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#系统变量","content":"**示例**："},"6932":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-49","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户变量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;用户变量是用户自己定义的，作为 MySQL 编码规范，MySQL 中的用户变量以一个`@`开头。根据作用范围不同，又分为会话用户变量和局部变量。"},"6933":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-50","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户变量","content":"> 会话用户变量：作用域和会话变量一样，只对当前连接会话有效  \n> 局部变量：只在`BEGIN`和`END`语句块中有效。局部变量只能在存储过程和函数中使用"},"6934":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-51","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户变量","content":"官方文档：  \nMySQL 5.7：https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/user-variables.html  \nMySQL 8.0：https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.0/en/user-variables.html"},"6935":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-52","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户会话变量","content":"**变量的定义**："},"6936":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-53","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户会话变量","content":"**查看用户变量的值**："},"6937":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-54","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#用户会话变量","content":"**示例**："},"6938":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-55","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#局部变量","content":"**定义**：可以使用`DECLARE`语句定义一个局部变量  \n**作用域**：仅仅在定义它的`BEGIN...END`中有效  \n**位置**：只能放在`BEGIN...END`中，并且只能放在第一句"},"6939":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-56","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用变量","content":"**示例**："},"6940":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-57","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用变量","content":"(1) 声明局部变量，并分别赋值为 employees 表中 employee_id 为 102 的 last_name 和 salary"},"6941":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-58","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用变量","content":"(2) 声明两个变量，求和并打印 （分别使用会话用户变量、局部变量的方式实现）"},"6942":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-59","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用变量","content":"(3) 创建存储过程 different_salary 查询某员工和他领导的薪资差距，并用 IN 参数 emp_id 接收员工 id，用 OUT 参数 dif_salary 输出薪资差距结果"},"6943":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-60","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#会话用户变量与局部变量对比","content":"|        | 作用域  | 定义位置    | 语法            |\n| ------ | ---- | ------- | ------------- |\n| 会话用户变量 | 当前会话 | 会话的任何地方 | 加符号`@`，不用指定类型 |","table":"table-0"},"6944":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-61","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#会话用户变量与局部变量对比","content":"|      | 作用域           | 定义位置             | 语法             |\n| ---- | ------------- | ---------------- | -------------- |\n| 局部变量 | `BEGIN...END` | `BEGIN...END`第一句 | 一般不加`@`，需要指定类型 |","table":"table-0"},"6945":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-62","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件与处理程序","content":"&#8195;&#8195;**定义条件**是事先定义程序执行过程中可能遇到的问题，**处理程序**定义了在遇到问题时应当采取的处理方式，并且保证存储过程或函数在遇到警告或错误时能继续执行。这样可以增强存储程序处理问题的能力，避免程序异常停止运行。"},"6946":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-63","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例分析","content":"(1) 创建一个名称为\"UpdateDataNoCondition\"的存储过程，代码如下："},"6947":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-64","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例分析","content":"(2) 调用存储过程："},"6948":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-65","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例分析","content":"&#8195;&#8195;可以看到，此时变量`@x = 1`。结合创建存储过程的 SQL 语句代码可以得出：在存储过程中未定义条件和处理程序，且当存储过程中执行的 SQL 语句报错时，MySQL 数据库就会抛出错误，并退出当前 SQL 逻辑，不在向下继续执行。"},"6949":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-66","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"&#8195;&#8195;定义条件就是给 MySQL 中的错误码命名，这有助于存储的程序代码更清晰。它将一个错误名字和指定的错误条件关联起来，这个名字随后被用在定义处理程序的`DECLARE HANDLER`语句中。"},"6950":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-67","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"定义条件使用`DECLARE`语句，语法格式如下："},"6951":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-68","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"说明："},"6952":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-69","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"`mysql_error_code`和`sqlstate_value`都可以表示 MySQL 的错误"},"6953":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-70","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"> `mysql_error_code`：数值类型错误代码  \n> `sqlstate_value`：字符串类型错误代码(长度为 5)  \n> 例如：ERROR 1048 (23000)中，1048 是 mysql_error_code，23000 是 sqlstate_value"},"6954":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-71","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"`DECLARE`仅仅在定义它的`BEGIN...END`中有效，且只能放在第一句"},"6955":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-72","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"示例一：定义\"Field_Not_Be_NULL\"错误名与 MySQL 中违反非空约束的错误类型是\"ERROR 1048 (23000)\"对应"},"6956":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义条件","content":"示例二：定义\"ERROR 1148(42000)\"错误，名称为\"command_not_allowed\""},"6957":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义处理程序","content":"可以为 SQL 执行过程中发生的某些类型的错误定义特殊的处理程序。定义处理程序时，可以使用`DECLARE`语句，语法如下："},"6958":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#定义处理程序","content":"定义处理程序的几种方式，如下："},"6959":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例解决","content":"在存储过程中，定义处理程序，捕获 sqlstate_value 值，当遇到 mysql_error_code 值为 1048 时，执行 CONTINUE 操作，并且将@proc_value 的值设置为-1"},"6960":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例解决","content":"调用："},"6961":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-78","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#流程控制","content":"&#8195;&#8195;解决复杂问题不可能通过一个 SQL 语句完成，我们需要执行多个 SQL 操作。流程控制语句的作用就是控制存储过程中 SQL 语句的执行顺序，我们完成复杂操作必不可少的一部分。"},"6962":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-79","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#流程控制","content":"只要是执行的程序，流程就分为三大类：  \n&#8195;① **顺序结构**：程序从上往下依次执行  \n&#8195;② **分支结构**：程序按条件进行选择执行，从两条或多条路径中选择一条执行  \n&#8195;③ **循环结构**：程序满足一定条件下，重复执行一组语句"},"6963":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-80","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#流程控制","content":"针对于 MySQL 的流程控制语句主要有三类(注意：只能用于存储程序)：  \n&#8195;① **条件判断语句**：IF 语句和 CASE 语句  \n&#8195;② **循环语句**：LOOP、WHILE 和 REPEAT 语句  \n&#8195;③ **跳转语句**：ITERATE 和 LEAVE 语句"},"6964":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-81","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#分支结构if","content":"语法结构："},"6965":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-82","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#分支结构if","content":"示例："},"6966":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-83","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#分支结构case","content":"语法结构："},"6967":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-84","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#分支结构case","content":"> 与流程控制函数中的`CASE`稍微有点区别：结尾一个为`END`，一个为`END CASE`"},"6968":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-85","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#分支结构case","content":"示例："},"6969":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-86","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构loop","content":"语法结构："},"6970":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-87","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构loop","content":"> LOOP 循环语句用来重复执行某些语句。LOOP 内的语句一直重复执行直到被退出(使用 LEAVE 子句)，跳出循环。"},"6971":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-88","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构loop","content":"示例：使用 LOOP 语句进行循环操作，id 值小于 10 时将重复执行循环过程"},"6972":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-89","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构while","content":"语法结构："},"6973":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-90","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构while","content":"> WHILE 语句创建一个带条件判断的循环过程。WHILE 在执行语句执行时，先对指定的表达式进行判断，如果为真，就执行循环内的语句，否则退出循环。"},"6974":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-91","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构while","content":"示例：使用 WHILE 语句进行循环操作，id 值小于 10 时将重复执行循环过程"},"6975":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-92","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构repeat","content":"语法结构："},"6976":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-93","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构repeat","content":"> REPEAT 语句创建一个带条件判断的循环过程。与 WHILE 循环不同的是，REPEAT 循环首先会执行一次循环，然后在 UNTIL 中进行表达式的判断，如果满足条件就退出，即 END REPEAT；如果条件不满足，则会就继续执行循环，直到满足退出条件为止。"},"6977":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-94","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#循环结构repeat","content":"示例："},"6978":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-95","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#对比三种循环结构","content":"| 关键字    | 说明             |\n| ------ | -------------- |\n| `LOOP` | 一般用于实现简单的\"死\"循环 |","table":"table-1"},"6979":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-96","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#对比三种循环结构","content":"| 关键字     | 说明     |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| `WHILE` | 先判断后执行 |","table":"table-1"},"6980":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-97","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#对比三种循环结构","content":"| 关键字      | 说明               |\n| -------- | ---------------- |\n| `REPEAT` | 先执行后判断，无条件至少执行一次 |","table":"table-1"},"6981":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-98","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#对比三种循环结构","content":"> 这三种循环都可以省略名称，但如果循环中添加了循环控制语句(`LEAVE或ITERATE`)则必须添加名称"},"6982":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-99","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句leave","content":"语法结构："},"6983":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-100","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句leave","content":"> 可以用在循环语句内，或者以`BEGIN ... END` 包裹起来的程序体内，表示跳出循环或跳出程序题的操作。如果你有面向过程的编写语言的经验，可以把`LEAVE`理解为`break`。"},"6984":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-101","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句leave","content":"示例："},"6985":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-102","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句leave","content":"当市场环境不好时，公司为了渡过难关，决定暂时降低大家的薪资。声明存储过程 leave_while()，声明 OUT 参数 num，输出循环次数，存储过程中使用 WHILE 循环给大家降低薪资为原来薪资的 90%，直到全公司的平均薪资小于等于 10000 ，并统计循环次数"},"6986":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-103","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句iterate","content":"语法结构："},"6987":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-104","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句iterate","content":"> 只能用在循环语句`LOOP`、`REPEAT` 和 `WHILE`语句内，表示重新开始循环，将执行顺序转到语句段开头处。如果你有面向过程的编程语言的使用经验，你可以把`ITERATE`理解为`continue`。"},"6988":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-105","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句iterate","content":"示例："},"6989":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-106","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#跳转语句iterate","content":"定义局部变量 num，初始值为 0。循环结构中执行 num + 1 操作：  \n&#8195;如果 num &lt; 10，则继续执行循环；  \n&#8195;如果 num > 15，则退出循环结构；"},"6990":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-107","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#什么是游标","content":"&#8195;&#8195;游标又称光标，是 SQL 的一个内存工作区，由系统或用户以变量的形式定义，主要用于暂时存放受 SQL 语句影响到的所有数据。"},"6991":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-108","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用游标步骤","content":"&#8195;&#8195;游标必须在声明处理程序之前被声明，并且变量和条件还必须在声明游标或处理程序之前被声明。如果我们在使用游标，一般需要经历下面四个步骤。需要注意的是不同的 DBMS 中，使用游标的语法可能略有不用。"},"6992":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-109","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#声明游标","content":"> 这个语法适用于 MySQL，SQL Server，DB2 和 MariaDB。如果是用 Oracle 或者 PostgreSQL，需要写成`DECLARE cursor_name CURSOR IS select_statement;`"},"6993":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-110","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用游标","content":"> 使用 cursor_name 这个游标来读取当前行，并且将数据保存到 var_name 这个变量中，游标指针指到下一行。如果游标读取的数据行有多个列名，则在 INTO 关键字后面赋值给多个变量名即可。"},"6994":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-111","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#使用游标","content":"🔔 注意：游标的查询结果集中的字段数，必须跟 INTO 后面的变量数一致 ，否则，在存储过程执行的时候，MySQL 会提示错误。"},"6995":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-112","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#关闭游标","content":"> 游标会占用系统资源，如果不及时关闭，游标会一直保持到存储过程结束，影响系统运行的效率，而关闭游标的操作，会释放游标占用的系统资源。"},"6996":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-113","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#案例","content":"&#8195;&#8195;创建存储过程 get_count_by_limit_total_salary()，声明 IN 参数 limit_total_salary，DOUBLE 类型；声明 OUT 参数 total_count，INT 类型。函数的功能可以实现累加薪资最高的几个员工的薪资值，直到薪资总和达到 limit_total_salary 参数的值，返回累加的人数给 total_count。"},"6997":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-114","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#小结","content":"&#8195;&#8195;游标是 MySQL 的一个重要的功能，为逐条读取结果集中的数据，提供了完美的解决方案。跟在应用层面实现相同的功能相比，游标可以在存储程序中使用，效率高，程序也更加简洁。但同时也会带来一些性能问题，比如在使用游标的过程中，会对数据行进行加锁，这样在业务并发量大的时候，不仅会影响业务之间的效率，还会消耗系统资源，造成内存不足，这是因为游标是在内存中进行的处理。"},"6998":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-115","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#小结","content":"养成用完之后就关闭的习惯，这样才能提高系统的整体效率。"},"6999":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-116","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#全局变量持久化","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在数据库中，全局变量可以通过`SET GLOBAL`语句来设置，但是设置的变量值只会临时生效，当数据库重启后，服务器又会从 MySQL 配置文件中读取变量的默认值。在 MySQL 8.0 中新增了`SET PERSIST`命令来进行持久化设置。使用该命令会将配置保存到数据目录下的`mysqld-auto.cnf`文件中，下次启动时会读取该文件，用其中的配置来覆盖默认配置。"},"7000":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-117","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#全局变量持久化","content":"例如：设置服务器的最大连接数为 1000"},"7001":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor-118","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/variable_flow_cursor#全局变量持久化","content":"删除持久化的全局系统变量设置："},"7002":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"page","content":"视图","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","数据库","MySQL基础篇"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view"},"7003":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"常见的数据库对象"},"7004":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图概述","content":"视图概述"},"7005":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#什么是视图","content":"什么是视图"},"7006":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#为什么要使用视图","content":"为什么要使用视图"},"7007":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"创建视图"},"7008":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#查看视图","content":"查看视图"},"7009":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#更新视图的数据","content":"更新视图的数据"},"7010":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#修改删除视图","content":"修改、删除视图"},"7011":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#修改视图","content":"修改视图"},"7012":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#删除视图","content":"删除视图"},"7013":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#总结","content":"总结"},"7014":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"视图的优点"},"7015":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的缺点","content":"视图的缺点"},"7016":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象       | 描述                                |\n| -------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 表`TABLE` | 表是存储数据的逻辑单元，以行和列的形式存在，列就是字段，行就是记录 |","table":"table-0"},"7017":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象   | 描述                                                 |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 数据字典 | 就是系统表，存放数据库相关信息的表。系统表的数据通常由数据库系统维护，程序员通常不应该修改，只可查看 |","table":"table-0"},"7018":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象             | 描述                     |\n| -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 约束`CONSTRAINT` | 执行数据校验的规则，用于保证数据完整性的规则 |","table":"table-0"},"7019":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象       | 描述                          |\n| -------- | --------------------------- |\n| 视图`VIEW` | 一个或者多个数据表里的数据的逻辑显示，视图并不存储数据 |","table":"table-0"},"7020":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象        | 描述               |\n| --------- | ---------------- |\n| 索引`INDEX` | 用于提高查询性能，相当于书的目录 |","table":"table-0"},"7021":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象              | 描述                                     |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 存储过程`PROCEDURE` | 用于完成一次完整的业务处理，没有返回值，但可通过传出参数将多个值传给调用环境 |","table":"table-0"},"7022":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象             | 描述                  |\n| -------------- | ------------------- |\n| 存储函数`FUNCTION` | 用于完成一次特定的计算，具有一个返回值 |","table":"table-0"},"7023":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#常见的数据库对象","content":"| 对象           | 描述                                    |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 触发器`TRIGGER` | 相当于一个事件监听器，当数据库发生特定事件后，触发器被触发，完成相应的处理 |","table":"table-0"},"7024":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#什么是视图","content":"&#8195;&#8195;视图是表现数据逻辑子集或数据的组合。视图是基于表或另一个视图的逻辑表，一个视图并不包含真实的数据，它提供了另一个视角查看或改变表中的数据，视图的本质就是一个 SELECT 语句。  \n&#8195;&#8195;视图建立在已有表的基础上，视图赖以建立的这些表称为基表。视图的创建和删除只影响视图本身，不影响对应的基表；但是当对视图中的数据进行增加、删除和修改操作时，数据表中的数据就会相应地发生变化，反之亦然。  \n&#8195;&#8195;通常情况下，小型项目的数据库可以不使用视图，但是在大型项目中，以及数据表比较复杂的情况下，视图的价值就凸显出来了，它可以帮助我们把经常查询的结果集放到虚拟表中，提升使用效率。"},"7025":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#为什么要使用视图","content":"(1) 视图可以起到隐藏数据的功能。  \n(2) 视图可以将复杂的多表连接查询的结果构成一个简单的表结构提供给用户。"},"7026":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"**官方结构**："},"7027":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"**精简版**："},"7028":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"**创建单表视图**："},"7029":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"**创建多表视图**："},"7030":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#创建视图","content":"**基于视图创建视图**："},"7031":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#更新视图的数据","content":"&#8195;&#8195;MySQL 支持使用 INSERT、UPDATE 和 DELETE 语句对视图中的数据进行插入、更新和删除操作。当视图中的数据发生变化时，数据表中的数据也会发生变化，反之亦然。要使视图可更新，视图中的行和底层基本表中的行之间必须存在一一对应的关系，否则不支持视图的更新操作。"},"7032":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#更新视图的数据","content":"**下面是不支持更新视图的情况**：  \n① 在定义视图的时候指定了`ALGORITHM = TEMPTABLE`，视图将不支持`INSERT`和`DELETE`操作；  \n② 视图中不包含基表中所有被定义为非空又未指定默认值的列，视图将不支持`INSERT`操作；  \n③ 在定义视图时的`SELECT`语句中使用了`JION联合查询`，视图将不支持`INSERT`和`DELETE`操作；  \n④ 在定义视图的`SELECT`语句后的字段列表中使用了数学表达式或子查询，视图将不支持`INSERT`，也不支持`UPDATE`使用了数学表达式、子查询的字段值；  \n⑤ 在定义视图的`SELECT`语句后的字段列表中使用`DISTINCT`、`聚合函数`、`GROUP BY`、`HAVING`、`UNION`等，视图将不支持`INSERT`、`UPDATE`、`DELETE`；  \n⑥ 在定义视图的`SELECT`语句中包含了子查询，而子查询中引用了`FROM`后面的表，视图将不支持`INSERT`、`UPDATE`、`DELETE`；  \n⑦ 视图定义基于一个不可更新视图；  \n⑧ 常量视图；"},"7033":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#更新视图的数据","content":"虽然可以更新视图数据，但总的来说，视图作为虚拟表，主要用于方便查询，不建议更新视图的数据。对视图数据的更改，都是通过对实际数据表里数据的操作来完成的。"},"7034":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#修改视图","content":"**方式一**：使用`CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW 子句`"},"7035":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#修改视图","content":"**方式二**：使用`ALTER VIEW`"},"7036":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#删除视图","content":"(1) 删除视图只是删除视图的定义，并不会删除基表的数据。  \n(2) 基于视图 a、b 创建了新的视图 c，如果将视图 a 或者视图 b 删除，会导致视图 c 的查询失败。这样的视图 c 需要手动删除或修改，否则影响使用。"},"7037":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"(1) 操作简单  \n&#8195;&#8195;将经常使用的查询操作定义为视图，可以使开发人员不需要关心视图对应的数据表的结构、表与表之间的关联关系，也不需要关心数据表之间的业务逻辑和查询条件，而只需要简单地操作视图即可，极大简化了开发人员对数据库的操作。"},"7038":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"(2) 减少数据冗余  \n&#8195;&#8195;视图跟实际数据表不一样，它存储的是查询语句。所以，在使用的时候，我们要通过定义视图的查询语句来获取结果集，而视图本身不存储数据，不占用数据存储的资源，减少了数据冗余。"},"7039":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"(3) 数据安全  \n&#8195;&#8195;MySQL 将用户对数据的访问限制在某些数据的结果集上，而这些数据的结果集可以使用视图来实现。用户不必直接查询或操作数据表。这也可以理解为视图具有隔离性。视图相当于在用户和实际的数据表之间加了一层虚拟表。  \n&#8195;&#8195;同时，MySQL 可以根据权限将用户对数据的访问限制在某些视图上，用户不需要查询数据表，可以直接通过视图获取数据表中的信息。这在一定程度上保障了数据表中数据的安全性。"},"7040":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"(4) 适应灵活多变的需求  \n&#8195;&#8195;当业务系统的需求发生变化后，如果需要改动数据表的结构，则工作量相对较大，可以使用视图来减少改动的工作量。这种方式在实际工作中使用得比较多。"},"7041":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的优点","content":"(5) 能够分解复杂的查询逻辑  \n&#8195;&#8195;数据库中如果存在复杂的查询逻辑，则可以将问题进行分解，创建多个视图获取数据，再将创建的多个视图结合起来，完成复杂的查询逻辑。"},"7042":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的缺点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;如果我们在实际数据表的基础上创建了视图，那么如果实际数据表的结构变更了，我们就需要及时对相关的视图进行相应的维护。特别是嵌套的视图（就是在视图的基础上创建视图），维护会变得比较复杂，可读性不好，容易变成系统的潜在隐患。因为创建视图的 SQL 查询可能会对字段重命名，也可能包含复杂的逻辑，这些都会增加维护的成本。"},"7043":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的缺点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;实际项目中，如果视图过多，会导致数据库维护成本的问题。"},"7044":{"id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/database/base/view","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/database/base/view#视图的缺点","content":"在创建视图的时候，你要结合实际项目需求，综合考虑视图的优点和不足，这样才能正确使用视图，使系统整体达到最优。"},"7045":{"id":"/docs/backend/database","p