s/backend/java/lambda","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"API 中函数式接口所在的包"},"7283":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Lambda 是一个**匿名函数**，我们可以把 Lambda 表达式理解为是**一段可以传递的代码**（将代码像数据一样进行传递）。使用它可以写出更简洁、更灵活的代码。作为一种更紧凑的代码风格，使 Java 的语言表达能力得到了提升。"},"7284":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"① **无参，无返回值**"},"7285":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"② **需要一个参数，但没有返回值**"},"7286":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"③ **数据类型可以省略，因为可由编译器推断得出，称为\"类型推断\"**"},"7287":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;Lambda 表达式中无需指定类型，程序依然可以编译，这是因为 javac 根据程序的上下文，在后台推断出了参数的类型。Lambda 表达式的类型依赖于上下文环境，是由编译器推断出来的。这就是所谓的`类型推断`。"},"7288":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"④ **若只需要一个参数时，参数的小括号可以省略**"},"7289":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"⑤ **需要两个及以上参数，多条执行语句，并且可以有返回值**"},"7290":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#语法格式","content":"⑥ **当 Lambda 体只有一条语句时，return 与大括号若有，都可以省略**"},"7291":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式的本质","content":"① Lambda 表达式作为接口的实现类的对象；\n② Lambda 表达式是一个匿名函数；"},"7292":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"Labmda 表达式不是匿名内部类的语法糖，但是他也是一个语法糖。实现方式其实是依赖了几个 JVM 底层提供的 lambda 相关 API。"},"7293":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"**代码举例**："},"7294":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;为啥说他并不是内部类的语法糖呢？前面讲内部类我们说过，内部类在编译之后会有两个 class 文件，但是，包含 lambda 表达式的类编译后只有一个文件。\n> &#8195;&#8195;可以看到，在 forEach 方法中，其实是调用了 java.lang.invoke.LambdaMetafactory#metafactory 方法，该方法的第 5 个参数 implMethod 指定了方法实现。可以看到这里其实是调用了一个 lambda$main$0 方法进行了输出。"},"7295":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"再来看一个稍微复杂一点的，先对 List 进行过滤，然后再输出："},"7296":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"> 两个 lambda 表达式分别调用了 lambda\\$main$1 和 lambda\\$main$0 两个方法。"},"7297":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#lambda-表达式是如何实现的","content":"&#8195;&#8195;所以，lambda 表达式的实现其实是依赖了一些底层的 api，在编译阶段，编译器会把 lambda 表达式进行解糖，转换成调用内部 api 的方式。"},"7298":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#函数式接口","content":"如果接口中只声明一个抽象方法，则此接口就称为函数式接口。因为只有给函数式接口提供实现类的对象时，才可以使用 Lambda 表达式。"},"7299":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"JDK8 中声明的函数式接口在`java.util.function`包下"},"7300":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"**四大核心函数式接口**："},"7301":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"| 函数式接口         | 称谓    | 参数类型 | 用途                                    |\n| ------------- | ----- | ---- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `Consumer<T>` | 消费型接口 | T    | 对类型 T 的对象应用操作，包含方法：`void accept(T t)` |","table":"table-0"},"7302":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"| 函数式接口         | 称谓    | 参数类型 | 用途                         |\n| ------------- | ----- | ---- | -------------------------- |\n| `Supplier<T>` | 供给型接口 | 无    | 返回类型为 T 的对象，包含方法：`T get()` |","table":"table-0"},"7303":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"| 函数式接口            | 称谓    | 参数类型 | 用途                                                   |\n| ---------------- | ----- | ---- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Function<T, R>` | 函数型接口 | T    | 对类型为 T 的对象应用操作，并返回结果。结果是 R 类型的对象，包含方法：`R apply(T t)` |","table":"table-0"},"7304":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/lambda","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/lambda#api-中函数式接口所在的包","content":"| 函数式接口          | 称谓    | 参数类型 | 用途                                                        |\n| -------------- | ----- | ---- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Predicate<T>` | 判断型接口 | T    | 确定类型为 T 的对象是否满足某约束，并返回 boolean 值，包含方法：`boolean test(T t)` |","table":"table-0"},"7305":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"page","content":"语法糖","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","Java"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar"},"7306":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#语法糖","content":"语法糖"},"7307":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#解语法糖","content":"解语法糖"},"7308":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#常见的语法糖","content":"常见的语法糖"},"7309":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"switch 支持 String"},"7310":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"泛型"},"7311":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#自动装箱与拆箱","content":"自动装箱与拆箱"},"7312":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#方法变长参数","content":"方法变长参数"},"7313":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#枚举","content":"枚举"},"7314":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#内部类","content":"内部类"},"7315":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#条件编译","content":"条件编译"},"7316":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#断言","content":"断言"},"7317":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#数值字面量","content":"数值字面量"},"7318":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#for-each","content":"for-each"},"7319":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#try-with-resource","content":"try-with-resource"},"7320":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#lambda-表达式","content":"Lambda 表达式"},"7321":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"需要注意的点"},"7322":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#总结","content":"总结"},"7323":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","content":"<Card title=\"原文：不了解这12个语法糖，别说你会Java！\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EBnM7QAOPjDk5bG3M0Mu-w\" description=\"作者：Hollis\" external />"},"7324":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#语法糖","content":"&#8195;&#8195;语法糖(Syntactic sugar)，指在计算机语言中添加的某种语法，这种语法对语言的功能并没有影响，但是更方便程序员使用。**简而言之，语法糖让程序更加简洁，有更高的可读性。**"},"7325":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#解语法糖","content":"&#8195;&#8195;虽然 Java 中有很多语法糖，但是 Java 虚拟机并不支持这些语法糖，所以这些语法糖在编译阶段就会被还原成简单的基础语法结构，这样才能被虚拟机识别，这个过程就是解语法糖。"},"7326":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#解语法糖","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Java 语言中，`javac`命令可以将后缀名为`.java`的源文件编译为后缀名为`.class`的可以运行于 Java 虚拟机的字节码。"},"7327":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#解语法糖","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在使用`javac`命令去编译源文件时，实际上是去执行`com.sun.tools.javac.Main#main`方法，而真正执行编译动作的，正是`com.sun.tools.javac.main.JavaCompiler`类。如果你去看这个类的源码，你会发现在`compile()`中有一个步骤就是调用`desugar()`，这个方法就是负责解语法糖的实现的。"},"7328":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#解语法糖","content":"&#8195;&#8195;常见的语法糖有 switch 支持枚举及字符串、泛型、条件编译、断言、可变参数、自动装箱/拆箱、枚举、内部类、增强 for 循环、try-with-resources 语句、lambda 表达式等。"},"7329":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#常见的语法糖","content":"常用的反编译工具为："},"7330":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#常见的语法糖","content":"<Card title=\"CFR - Another Java Decompiler\" href=\"https://github.com/leibnitz27/cfr\" description=\"GIT地址\" external />"},"7331":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#常见的语法糖","content":"<Card title=\"Decompilers online\" href=\"http://www.javadecompilers.com/\" description=\"在线网页\" external />"},"7332":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#常见的语法糖","content":"**CFR 命令**："},"7333":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"&#8195;&#8195;从 Java 7 开始，Java 语言中的语法糖在逐渐丰富，其中一个比较重要的就是 Java 7 中 switch 开始支持 String。"},"7334":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Java 中的 swith 自身原本就支持基本类型。比如 int、char 等。对于 int 类型，直接进行数值的比较。对于 char 类型则是比较其 ascii 码。"},"7335":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"&#8195;&#8195;所以，对于编译器来说，switch 中其实只能使用整型，任何类型的比较都要转换成整型。比如 byte、short、char(ascii 码是整型)以及 int。"},"7336":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"&#8195;&#8195;switch 对 String 的支持，代码如下："},"7337":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#switch-支持-string","content":"> 字符串的 switch 是通过 equals()和 hashCode()方法来实现的。switch 的实际是哈希值，然后通过使用 equals 方法比较进行安全检查，这个检查是必要的，因为哈希可能会发生碰撞。因此它的性能是不如使用枚举进行 switch 或者使用纯整数常量，但这也不是很差。"},"7338":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"&#8195;&#8195;很多语言都是支持泛型的，不同的编译器对于泛型的处理方式是不同的。通常情况下，一个编译器处理泛型有两种方式：`Code specialization` 和 `Code sharing`。"},"7339":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"> Code sharing 方式为每个泛型类型创建唯一的字节码表示，并且将该泛型类型的实例都映射到这个唯一的字节码表示上。将多种泛型类形实例映射到唯一的字节码表示是通过类型擦除（type erasue）实现的。"},"7340":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"&#8195;&#8195;C++ 和 C# 是使用`Code specialization`的处理机制，而 Java 使用的是`Code sharing`的机制。"},"7341":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"&#8195;&#8195;对于 Java 虚拟机来说，他根本不认识`Map<String, String> map`这样的语法，需要在编译阶段通过类型擦除的方式进行解语法糖。"},"7342":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"**类型擦除的主要过程如下**：\n① 将所有的泛型参数用其最左边界（最顶级的父类型）类型替换。\n② 移除所有的类型参数。"},"7343":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#泛型","content":"> 虚拟机中没有泛型，只有普通类和普通方法，所有泛型类的类型参数在编译时都会被擦除，泛型类并没有自己独有的 Class 类对象。比如并不存在`List<String>.class` 或是 `List<Integer>.class`，而只有`List.class`"},"7344":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#自动装箱与拆箱","content":"&#8195;&#8195;包装类是对基本类型的包装，所以，把基本数据类型转换成包装类的过程就是装箱；反之，把包装类转换成基本数据类型的过程就是拆箱。在 Java SE5 中，为了减少开发人员的工作，Java 提供了自动拆箱与自动装箱功能。\n&#8195;&#8195;自动装箱都是通过包装类的`valueOf()`方法实现；自动拆箱都是通过包装类对象的`xxxValue()`来实现。"},"7345":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#自动装箱与拆箱","content":"<Card title=\"Java 中有了基本类型为什么还需要包装类？\" href=\"/docs/interview/java/java-foundation#java-中有了基本类型为什么还需要包装类\" description=\"知识扩展：自动拆装箱\" />"},"7346":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#方法变长参数","content":"&#8195;&#8195;可变参数(variable arguments)是在 Java 1.5 中引入的一个特性。它允许一个方法把任意数量的值作为参数。"},"7347":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#方法变长参数","content":"> 可变参数在被使用的时候，他首先会创建一个数组，数组的长度就是调用该方法是传递的实参的个数，然后再把参数值全部放到这个数组当中，然后再把这个数组作为参数传递到被调用的方法中。"},"7348":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#枚举","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Java SE5 提供了一种新的类型-Java 的枚举类型，关键字 enum 可以将一组具名的值的有限集合创建为一种新的类型。"},"7349":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-43","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#枚举","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;通过反编译后代码我们可以看到，public final class T extends Enum，说明，该类是继承了 Enum 类的，同时 final 关键字告诉我们，这个类也是不能被继承的。\n> &#8195;&#8195;当我们使用 enmu 来定义一个枚举类型的时候，编译器会自动帮我们创建一个 final 类型的类继承 Enum 类，所以枚举类型不能被继承。"},"7350":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-44","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#内部类","content":"&#8195;&#8195;内部类又称为嵌套类，可以把内部类理解为外部类的一个普通成员。"},"7351":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-45","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#内部类","content":"&#8195;&#8195;内部类之所以也是语法糖，是因为它仅仅是一个编译时的概念。"},"7352":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-46","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#内部类","content":"&#8195;&#8195;`Outer.java`里面定义了一个内部类`Inner`，一旦编译成功，就会生成两个完全不同的`.class`文件了，分别是`Outer.class`和`Outer$Inner.class`。所以内部类的名字完全可以和它的外部类名字相同。"},"7353":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-47","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#条件编译","content":"&#8195;&#8195;—般情况下，程序中的每一行代码都要参加编译。但有时候出于对程序代码优化的考虑，希望只对其中一部分内容进行编译，此时就需要在程序中加上条件，让编译器只对满足条件的代码进行编译，将不满足条件的代码舍弃，这就是条件编译。"},"7354":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-48","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#条件编译","content":"> Java 语法的条件编译，是通过判断条件为常量的 if 语句实现的。根据 if 判断条件的真假，编译器直接把分支为 false 的代码块消除。通过该方式实现的条件编译，必须在方法体内实现，而无法在正整个 Java 类的结构或者类的属性上进行条件编译。"},"7355":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-49","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#断言","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在 Java 中，assert 关键字是从 JAVA SE 1.4 引入的，为了避免和老版本的 Java 代码中使用了 assert 关键字导致错误，Java 在执行的时候默认是不启动断言检查的（这个时候，所有的断言语句都将忽略！）。"},"7356":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-50","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#断言","content":"&#8195;&#8195;如果要开启断言检查，则需要用开关`-enableassertions`或`-ea`来开启。"},"7357":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-51","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#断言","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;反编译之后的代码要比我们自己的代码复杂的多。所以，使用了 assert 这个语法糖我们节省了很多代码。\n> &#8195;&#8195;其实断言的底层实现就是 if 语言，如果断言结果为 true，则什么都不做，程序继续执行，如果断言结果为 false，则程序抛出 AssertError 来打断程序的执行。\n> &#8195;&#8195;-enableassertions 会设置$assertionsDisabled 字段的值。"},"7358":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-52","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#数值字面量","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在 Java 7 中，数值字面量，不管是整数还是浮点数，都允许在数字之间插入任意多个下划线。这些下划线不会对字面量的数值产生影响，目的就是方便阅读。"},"7359":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-53","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#数值字面量","content":"> 反编译后就是把`_`删除了。也就是说编译器并不认识在数字字面量中的`_`，需要在编译阶段把他去掉。"},"7360":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-54","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#for-each","content":"&#8195;&#8195;增强 for 循环（for-each）相信大家都不陌生，日常开发经常会用到的，他会比 for 循环要少写很多代码，那么这个语法糖背后是如何实现的呢？"},"7361":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-55","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#for-each","content":"> 代码很简单，for-each 的实现原理其实就是使用了普通的 for 循环和迭代器。"},"7362":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-56","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#try-with-resource","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Java 里，对于文件操作 IO 流、数据库连接等开销非常昂贵的资源，用完之后必须及时通过 close 方法将其关闭，否则资源会一直处于打开状态，可能会导致内存泄露等问题。"},"7363":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-57","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#try-with-resource","content":"&#8195;&#8195;关闭资源的常用方式就是在 finally 块里是释放，即调用 close 方法。比如，我们经常会写这样的代码："},"7364":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-58","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#try-with-resource","content":"从 Java 7 开始，jdk 提供了一种更好的方式关闭资源，使用 try-with-resources 语句，改写一下上面的代码，效果如下："},"7365":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-59","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#try-with-resource","content":"> 其实背后的原理也很简单，那些我们没有做的关闭资源的操作，编译器都帮我们做了。所以，再次印证了，语法糖的作用就是方便程序员的使用，但最终还是要转成编译器认识的语言。"},"7366":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-60","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#lambda-表达式","content":"<Card title=\"Lambda 表达式\" href=\"/docs/backend/java/lambda\" description=\"Lambda 表达式\" />"},"7367":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-61","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#lambda-表达式","content":"Labmda 表达式不是匿名内部类的语法糖，但是它也是一个语法糖。实现方式其实是依赖了几个 JVM 底层提供的 Lambda 相关 API。"},"7368":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-62","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"① **泛型 —— 当泛型遇到重载**"},"7369":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-63","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;上面这段代码，有两个重载的函数，因为他们的参数类型不同，一个是 List 另一个是 List，但是，这段代码是编译通不过的。因为我们前面讲过，参数 List 和 List 编译之后都被擦除了，变成了一样的原生类型 List，擦除动作导致这两个方法的特征签名变得一模一样。"},"7370":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-64","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"② **泛型 —— 当泛型遇到 catch**\n&#8195;&#8195;泛型的类型参数不能用在 Java 异常处理的 catch 语句中。因为异常处理是由 JVM 在运行时刻来进行的。由于类型信息被擦除，JVM 是无法区分两个异常类型 `MyException<String>`和`MyException<Integer>`的。"},"7371":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-65","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"③ **泛型 —— 当泛型内包含静态变量**"},"7372":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-66","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"> 以上代码输出结果为：`2`！由于经过类型擦除，所有的泛型类实例都关联到同一份字节码上，泛型类的所有静态变量是共享的。"},"7373":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-67","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"④ **自动装箱与拆箱 —— 对象相等比较**"},"7374":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-68","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"输出结果："},"7375":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-69","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"> 在 Java 5 中，在 Integer 的操作上引入了一个新功能来节省内存和提高性能。整型对象通过使用相同的对象引用实现了缓存和重用。适用于整数值区间-128 至 +127。只适用于自动装箱，使用构造函数创建对象不适用。"},"7376":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-70","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"⑤ **增强 for 循环**"},"7377":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-71","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;会抛出`ConcurrentModificationException`异常。"},"7378":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-72","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Iterator 是工作在一个独立的线程中，并且拥有一个 mutex 锁。 Iterator 被创建之后会建立一个指向原来对象的单链索引表，当原来的对象数量发生变化时，这个索引表的内容不会同步改变，所以当索引指针往后移动的时候就找不到要迭代的对象，所以按照 fail-fast 原则 Iterator 会马上抛出 java.util.ConcurrentModificationException 异常。"},"7379":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#需要注意的点","content":"&#8195;&#8195;所以 Iterator 在工作的时候是不允许被迭代的对象被改变的。但你可以使用 Iterator 本身的方法 remove()来删除对象，Iterator.remove() 方法会在删除当前迭代对象的同时维护索引的一致性。"},"7380":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#总结","content":"&#8195;&#8195;前面介绍了 12 种 Java 中常用的语法糖。所谓语法糖就是提供给开发人员便于开发的一种语法而已。"},"7381":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#总结","content":"&#8195;&#8195;但是这种语法只有开发人员认识。要想被执行，需要进行解糖，即转成 JVM 认识的语法。"},"7382":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#总结","content":"&#8195;&#8195;当我们把语法糖解糖之后，你就会发现其实我们日常使用的这些方便的语法，其实都是一些其他更简单的语法构成的。"},"7383":{"id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/java/syntactic-sugar#总结","content":"&#8195;&#8195;有了这些语法糖，我们在日常开发的时候可以大大提升效率，但是同时也要避免过渡使用。使用之前最好了解下原理，避免掉坑。"},"7384":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"page","content":"数据类型","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","Redis"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types"},"7385":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#基础","content":"基础"},"7386":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#存储区域","content":"存储区域"},"7387":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#key-操作","content":"key 操作"},"7388":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#基本操作","content":"基本操作"},"7389":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#时效性操作","content":"时效性操作"},"7390":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#查询操作","content":"查询操作"},"7391":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","type":"