/backend/redis/data_types#基础","content":"① 在 Redis 中单个指令都是原子性操作，通过指令操作 Redis 数据时无需担心线程安全问题。\n② Redis 以 key-value 的形式保存数据：key 值一定为 string 类型，而 value 值支持多种类型。"},"7454":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-69","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#存储区域","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Redis 将数据存储分为多个相互独立的区域，将 Redis 操作局限在自己的存储区域内。通常划分为 16 个（编号 0-15），默认使用编号 0 。"},"7455":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-70","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#时效性操作","content":"Redis 中可以为 key 设置有效期，key 过期后会由 Redis 执行删除策略回收内存空间。"},"7456":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-71","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#查询操作","content":"Redis 支持查询存储区域内含有的 key，且允许使用以下通配符："},"7457":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-72","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#查询操作","content":"`-` 表示任意数量字符\n`?` 表示任意一个字符\n`[]` 表示一个指定字符"},"7458":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-73","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#字符串string","content":"&#8195;&#8195;string 是 redis 最基本的数据类型，一个 key 对应一个 value。它是二进制安全的，意思是 redis 的 string 可以包含任何数据，比如 jpg 图片或者序列化对象等；一个 redis 中字符串 value 最多可以是 512M。"},"7459":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-74","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令              | 描述          |\n| --------------- | ----------- |\n| `SET key value` | 设置指定 key 的值 |","table":"table-0"},"7460":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-75","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令        | 描述          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| `GET key` | 获取指定 key 的值 |","table":"table-0"},"7461":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-76","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                       | 描述               |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------- |\n| `GETRANGE key start end` | 返回 key 中字符串值的子字符 |","table":"table-0"},"7462":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-77","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                 | 描述                                         |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `GETSET key value` | 将给定 key 的值设为 value ，并返回 key 的旧值(old value) |","table":"table-0"},"7463":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-78","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                  | 描述                             |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `GETBIT key offset` | 对 key 所储存的字符串值，获取指定偏移量上的位(bit) |","table":"table-0"},"7464":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-79","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                   | 描述                   |\n| -------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `MGET key1 [key2..]` | 获取所有(一个或多个)给定 key 的值 |","table":"table-0"},"7465":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-80","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                        | 描述                                |\n| ------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `SETBIT key offset value` | 对 key 所储存的字符串值，设置或清除指定偏移量上的位(bit) |","table":"table-0"},"7466":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-81","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                        | 描述                                               |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `SETEX key seconds value` | 将值 value 关联到 key ，并将 key 的过期时间设为 seconds (以秒为单位) |","table":"table-0"},"7467":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-82","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                | 描述                    |\n| ----------------- | --------------------- |\n| `SETNX key value` | 只有在 key 不存在时设置 key 的值 |","table":"table-0"},"7468":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-83","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                          | 描述                                         |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `SETRANGE key offset value` | 用 value 参数覆写给定 key 所储存的字符串值，从偏移量 offset 开始 |","table":"table-0"},"7469":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-84","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令           | 描述                 |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| `STRLEN key` | 返回 key 所储存的字符串值的长度 |","table":"table-0"},"7470":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-85","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                               | 描述                    |\n| -------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `MSET key value [key value ...]` | 同时设置一个或多个 key-value 对 |","table":"table-0"},"7471":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-86","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                                 | 描述                                      |\n| ---------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `MSETNX key value [key value ...]` | 同时设置一个或多个 key-value 对，当且仅当所有给定 key 都不存在 |","table":"table-0"},"7472":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-87","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                              | 描述                                                          |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `PSETEX key milliseconds value` | 这个命令和 SETEX 命令相似，但它以毫秒为单位设置 key 的生存时间，而不是像 SETEX 命令那样，以秒为单位 |","table":"table-0"},"7473":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-88","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令         | 描述              |\n| ---------- | --------------- |\n| `INCR key` | 将 key 中储存的数字值增一 |","table":"table-0"},"7474":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-89","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                     | 描述                             |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `INCRBY key increment` | 将 key 所储存的值加上给定的增量值（increment） |","table":"table-0"},"7475":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-90","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                          | 描述                               |\n| --------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `INCRBYFLOAT key increment` | 将 key 所储存的值加上给定的浮点增量值（increment） |","table":"table-0"},"7476":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-91","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令         | 描述              |\n| ---------- | --------------- |\n| `DECR key` | 将 key 中储存的数字值减一 |","table":"table-0"},"7477":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-92","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                     | 描述                           |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `DECRBY key decrement` | key 所储存的值减去给定的减量值（decrement） |","table":"table-0"},"7478":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-93","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总","content":"| 命令                 | 描述                                                              |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `APPEND key value` | 如果 key 已经存在并且是一个字符串， APPEND 命令将指定的 value 追加到该 key 原来值（value）的末尾 |","table":"table-0"},"7479":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-94","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#最常用","content":"**参数说明**：\n&#8195;`EX seconds`：以秒为单位设置过期时间\n&#8195;`PX milliseconds`：以毫秒为单位设置过期时间\n&#8195;`EXAT unix-time-seconds`：设置以秒为单位的 UNIX 时间戳所对应的时间为过期时间\n&#8195;`PXAT unix-time-milliseconds`：设置以毫秒为单位的 UNIX 时间戳所对应的时间为过期时间\n&#8195;`KEEPTTL`：保留设置前指定键的生存时间\n&#8195;`NX`：键不存在的时候设置键值\n&#8195;`XX`：键存在的时候设置键值\n&#8195;`GET`：返回指定键原本的值，若键不存在时返回`nil`"},"7480":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-95","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#最常用","content":"> `SET`命令使用 EX、PX、NX 参数，其效果等同于 SETEX、PSETEX、SETNX 命令。根据官方文档的描述，未来的版本中 SETEX、PSETEX、SETNX 命令可能会被淘汰。"},"7481":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-96","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#最常用","content":"**示例**："},"7482":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-97","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#最常用","content":"展开查看"},"7483":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-98","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#数值增减","content":"> 注意：一定要是数字才能进行加减\n> 应用场景：阅读数、点赞数等等"},"7484":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-99","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#列表list","content":"&#8195;&#8195;列表是简单的字符串列表(单值多 value)，按照插入顺序排列。你可以添加一个元素到列表的头部(左边)或者尾部(右边)。它的底层实际是个双端链表，最多可以包含 232-1 个元素(4294967295，每个列表超过 40 亿个元素)。主要功能有 pop/push 等，一般用在栈、队列、消息队列等场景。\n&#8195;&#8195;所谓的双端就是它的左侧和右侧都可以插入添加，如果键不存在，则创建新的链表，如果键已经存在，则新增内容，如果值全移除，对应的键也就消失了。对两端的操作性能很高，通过索引下标的操作中间的节点性能会较差。"},"7485":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-100","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                           | 描述                                           |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `BLPOP key1 [key2 ] timeout` | 移出并获取列表的第一个元素， 如果列表没有元素会阻塞列表直到等待超时或发现可弹出元素为止 |","table":"table-1"},"7486":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-101","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                           | 描述                                            |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `BRPOP key1 [key2 ] timeout` | 移出并获取列表的最后一个元素， 如果列表没有元素会阻塞列表直到等待超时或发现可弹出元素为止 |","table":"table-1"},"7487":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-102","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                                      | 描述                                                            |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `BRPOPLPUSH source destination timeout` | 从列表中弹出一个值，将弹出的元素插入到另外一个列表中并返回它； 如果列表没有元素会阻塞列表直到等待超时或发现可弹出元素为止 |","table":"table-1"},"7488":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-103","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                 | 描述           |\n| ------------------ | ------------ |\n| `LINDEX key index` | 通过索引获取列表中的元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7489":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-104","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                   | 描述             |\n| -------------------- | -------------- |\n| `LINSERT key BEFORE` | 在列表的元素前或者后插入元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7490":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-105","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令         | 描述     |\n| ---------- | ------ |\n| `LLEN key` | 获取列表长度 |","table":"table-1"},"7491":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-106","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令         | 描述            |\n| ---------- | ------------- |\n| `LPOP key` | 移出并获取列表的第一个元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7492":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-107","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                          | 描述             |\n| --------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `LPUSH key value1 [value2]` | 将一个或多个值插入到列表头部 |","table":"table-1"},"7493":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-108","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                 | 描述              |\n| ------------------ | --------------- |\n| `LPUSHX key value` | 将一个值插入到已存在的列表头部 |","table":"table-1"},"7494":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-109","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                      | 描述           |\n| ----------------------- | ------------ |\n| `LRANGE key start stop` | 获取列表指定范围内的元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7495":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-110","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                     | 描述     |\n| ---------------------- | ------ |\n| `LREM key count value` | 移除列表元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7496":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-111","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                     | 描述           |\n| ---------------------- | ------------ |\n| `LSET key index value` | 通过索引设置列表元素的值 |","table":"table-1"},"7497":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-112","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                     | 描述                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `LTRIM key start stop` | 对一个列表进行修剪(trim)，就是说，让列表只保留指定区间内的元素，不在指定区间之内的元素都将被删除 |","table":"table-1"},"7498":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-113","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令         | 描述                    |\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\n| `RPOP key` | 移除列表的最后一个元素，返回值为移除的元素 |","table":"table-1"},"7499":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-114","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                             | 描述                           |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `RPOPLPUSH source destination` | 移除列表的最后一个元素，并将该元素添加到另一个列表并返回 |","table":"table-1"},"7500":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-115","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                          | 描述                |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `RPUSH key value1 [value2]` | 在列表中添加一个或多个值到列表尾部 |","table":"table-1"},"7501":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-116","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-1","content":"| 命令                 | 描述         |\n| ------------------ | ---------- |\n| `RPUSHX key value` | 为已存在的列表添加值 |","table":"table-1"},"7502":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-117","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#哈希表hash","content":"&#8195;&#8195;redis hash 是一个 string 类型的 field(字段)和 value(值)的映射表(KV 模式不变，但 V 是一个键值对，即 Map&lt;String, Map&lt;Object, Object>>)，hash 特别适合用于存储对象。redis 中每个 hash 可以存储 232-1 键值对(40 多亿)。"},"7503":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-118","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                         | 描述           |\n| -------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `HDEL key field1 [field2]` | 删除一个或多个哈希表字段 |","table":"table-2"},"7504":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-119","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                  | 描述                    |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `HEXISTS key field` | 查看哈希表 key 中，指定的字段是否存在 |","table":"table-2"},"7505":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-120","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令               | 描述              |\n| ---------------- | --------------- |\n| `HGET key field` | 获取存储在哈希表中指定字段的值 |","table":"table-2"},"7506":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-121","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令            | 描述                    |\n| ------------- | --------------------- |\n| `HGETALL key` | 获取在哈希表中指定 key 的所有字段和值 |","table":"table-2"},"7507":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-122","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                            | 描述                                |\n| ----------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `HINCRBY key field increment` | 为哈希表 key 中的指定字段的整数值加上增量 increment |","table":"table-2"},"7508":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-123","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                                 | 描述                                 |\n| ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `HINCRBYFLOAT key field increment` | 为哈希表 key 中的指定字段的浮点数值加上增量 increment |","table":"table-2"},"7509":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-124","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令          | 描述          |\n| ----------- | ----------- |\n| `HKEYS key` | 获取哈希表中的所有字段 |","table":"table-2"},"7510":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-125","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令         | 描述          |\n| ---------- | ----------- |\n| `HLEN key` | 获取哈希表中字段的数量 |","table":"table-2"},"7511":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-126","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                          | 描述         |\n| --------------------------- | ---------- |\n| `HMGET key field1 [field2]` | 获取所有给定字段的值 |","table":"table-2"},"7512":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-127","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                                         | 描述                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `HMSET key field1 value1 [field2 value2 ]` | 同时将多个 field-value (域-值)对设置到哈希表 key 中 |","table":"table-2"},"7513":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-128","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                     | 描述                             |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `HSET key field value` | 将哈希表 key 中的字段 field 的值设为 value |","table":"table-2"},"7514":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-129","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                       | 描述                         |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `HSETNX key field value` | 只有在字段 field 不存在时，设置哈希表字段的值 |","table":"table-2"},"7515":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-130","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令          | 描述        |\n| ----------- | --------- |\n| `HVALS key` | 获取哈希表中所有值 |","table":"table-2"},"7516":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-131","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-2","content":"| 命令                                               | 描述         |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ---------- |\n| `HSCAN key cursor [MATCH pattern] [COUNT count]` | 迭代哈希表中的键值对 |","table":"table-2"},"7517":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-132","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#hset--hget--hmset--hmget--hgetall--hdel","content":"&#8195;&#8195;开始 HSET 仅支持设置单个键值对，如果想设置多个就需要使用 HMSET；但是现在根据官方文档，HMSET 自 Redis 4.0.0 开始弃用，如果需要设置多个键值对可以使用 HSET 代替。"},"7518":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-133","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#集合set","content":"&#8195;&#8195;redis 的 Set 是 String 类型的无序集合。集合成员是唯一的，这就意味着集合中不能出现重复的数据。集合对象的编码可以是 intset 或者 hashtable。"},"7519":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-134","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#集合set","content":"&#8195;&#8195;redis 中集合是通过哈希表实现的，所以添加，删除，查找的复杂度都是 O(1)。集合中最大的成员数为 232-1 (每个集合可存储 40 多亿个成员)。"},"7520":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-135","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-3","content":"| 命令                           | 描述           |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `SADD key member1 [member2]` | 向集合添加一个或多个成员 |","table":"table-3"},"7521":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-136","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-3","content":"| 命令          | 描述       |\n| ----------- | -------- |\n| `SCARD key` | 获取集合的成员数 |","table":"table-3"},"7522":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-137","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-3","content":"| 命令                  | 描述                |\n| ------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `SDIFF key1 [key2]` | 返回第一个集合与其他集合之间的差异 |","table":"table-3"},"7523":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-138","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-3","content":"| 命令                                   | 描述                            |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `SDIFFSTORE destination key1 [key2]` | 返回给定所有集合的差集并存储在 destination 中 |","table":"table-3"},"7524":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-139","page_