/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令          | 描述         |\n| ----------- | ---------- |\n| `ZCARD key` | 获取有序集合的成员数 |","table":"table-6"},"7549":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-164","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                   | 描述                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `ZCOUNT key min max` | 计算在有序集合中指定区间分数的成员数 |","table":"table-6"},"7550":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-165","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                             | 描述                          |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| `ZINCRBY key increment member` | 有序集合中对指定成员的分数加上增量 increment |","table":"table-6"},"7551":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-166","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                              | 描述                                           |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `ZINTERSTORE destination numkeys key [key ...]` | 计算给定的一个或多个有序集的交集并将结果集存储在新的有序集合 destination 中 |","table":"table-6"},"7552":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-167","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                      | 描述                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `ZLEXCOUNT key min max` | 在有序集合中计算指定字典区间内成员数量 |","table":"table-6"},"7553":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-168","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                   | 描述                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `ZRANGE key start stop [WITHSCORES]` | 通过索引区间返回有序集合指定区间内的成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7554":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-169","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                             | 描述              |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `ZRANGEBYLEX key min max [LIMIT offset count]` | 通过字典区间返回有序集合的成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7555":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-170","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                               | 描述                 |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| `ZRANGEBYSCORE key min max [WITHSCORES] [LIMIT]` | 通过分数返回有序集合指定区间内的成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7556":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-171","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                 | 描述             |\n| ------------------ | -------------- |\n| `ZRANK key member` | 返回有序集合中指定成员的索引 |","table":"table-6"},"7557":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-172","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                             | 描述              |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------- |\n| `ZREM key member [member ...]` | 移除有序集合中的一个或多个成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7558":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-173","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                           | 描述                  |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `ZREMRANGEBYLEX key min max` | 移除有序集合中给定的字典区间的所有成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7559":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-174","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                               | 描述                  |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `ZREMRANGEBYRANK key start stop` | 移除有序集合中给定的排名区间的所有成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7560":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-175","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                             | 描述                  |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| `ZREMRANGEBYSCORE key min max` | 移除有序集合中给定的分数区间的所有成员 |","table":"table-6"},"7561":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-176","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                      | 描述                         |\n| --------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `ZREVRANGE key start stop [WITHSCORES]` | 返回有序集中指定区间内的成员，通过索引，分数从高到低 |","table":"table-6"},"7562":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-177","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                          | 描述                        |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `ZREVRANGEBYSCORE key max min [WITHSCORES]` | 返回有序集中指定分数区间内的成员，分数从高到低排序 |","table":"table-6"},"7563":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-178","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                    | 描述                                 |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `ZREVRANK key member` | 返回有序集合中指定成员的排名，有序集成员按分数值递减(从大到小)排序 |","table":"table-6"},"7564":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-179","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                  | 描述            |\n| ------------------- | ------------- |\n| `ZSCORE key member` | 返回有序集中，成员的分数值 |","table":"table-6"},"7565":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-180","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                              | 描述                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `ZUNIONSTORE destination numkeys key [key ...]` | 计算给定的一个或多个有序集的并集，并存储在新的 key 中 |","table":"table-6"},"7566":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-181","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-4","content":"| 命令                                               | 描述                      |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------- |\n| `ZSCAN key cursor [MATCH pattern] [COUNT count]` | 迭代有序集合中的元素（包括元素成员和元素分值） |","table":"table-6"},"7567":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-182","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-1","content":"根据商品销售对商品进行排序显示"},"7568":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-183","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-1","content":"| 说明                         | 命令                                   |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 商品编号 1001 的销量是 9，1002 是 15 | `zadd goods:sellsort 9 1001 15 1002` |","table":"table-7"},"7569":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-184","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-1","content":"| 说明                 | 命令                              |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| 有一个客户又买了两件 1001 商品 | `zincrby goods:sellsort 2 1001` |","table":"table-7"},"7570":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-185","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-1","content":"| 说明       | 命令                                     |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 求商品销量前十名 | `zrange goods:sellsort 0 9 withscores` |","table":"table-7"},"7571":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-186","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#位图bitmap","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Bitmap，即位图，是一串连续的二进制数组（0 和 1），可以通过偏移量（offset）定位元素。它是基于 string 数据类型的按位的操作。bitmap 支持的最大位数是 232位，它可以极大的节省存储空间，使用 512M 内存就可以存储多达 42.9 亿的字节信息。"},"7572":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-187","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令                        | 描述             |\n| ------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `SETBIT key offset value` | 设置或清除字符串值偏移处的位 |","table":"table-8"},"7573":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-188","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令                  | 描述       |\n| ------------------- | -------- |\n| `GETBIT key offset` | 按偏移量返回位值 |","table":"table-8"},"7574":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-189","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令           | 描述        |\n| ------------ | --------- |\n| `STRLEN key` | 返回字符串值的长度 |","table":"table-8"},"7575":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-190","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令                                      | 描述                     |\n| --------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `BITCOUNT key [start end [BYTE\\| BIT]]` | 对字符串中设置的位数 (填充计数) 进行计数 |","table":"table-8"},"7576":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-191","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令                                              | 描述                 |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `BITOP AND\\|OR\\|XOR\\|NOT destkey key [key ...]` | 对多个字符串执行按位运算，并存储结果 |","table":"table-8"},"7577":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-192","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令         | 描述              |\n| ---------- | --------------- |\n| `BITFIELD` | 对字符串执行任意位字段整数运算 |","table":"table-8"},"7578":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-193","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"| 命令            | 描述                |\n| ------------- | ----------------- |\n| `BITFIELD_RO` | 对字符串执行任意只读位字段整数运算 |","table":"table-8"},"7579":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-194","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"> 偏移量（offset）下标从 0 开始"},"7580":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-195","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-5","content":"**BITOP**："},"7581":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-196","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-2","content":"每日签到"},"7582":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-197","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#基数统计hyperloglog","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Redis 在 2.8.9 版本中添加了 HyperLogLog 结构。它是用来做基数统计的算法，其优点是在输入元素的数量或者体积非常非常大时，计算基数所需的空间总是固定的，并且是很小的。\n&#8195;&#8195;在 Redis 中，每个 HyperLogLog 键只需花 12KB 内存，就可以计算接近 264个不同元素的基数，这和计算基数时，元素越多耗费内存就越多的集合形成鲜明对比。但是，因为 HyperLogLog 只会根据输入元素来计算基数，而不会存储输入元素本身，所以 HyperLogLog 不能像集合那样，返回输入的各个元素。"},"7583":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-198","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-6","content":"| 命令                                | 描述                     |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `PFADD key element [element ...]` | 添加指定元素到 HyperLogLog 中。 |","table":"table-9"},"7584":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-199","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-6","content":"| 命令                      | 描述                       |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `PFCOUNT key [key ...]` | 返回给定 HyperLogLog 的基数估算值。 |","table":"table-9"},"7585":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-200","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-6","content":"| 命令                                          | 描述                                |\n| ------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `PFMERGE destkey sourcekey [sourcekey ...]` | 将多个 HyperLogLog 合并为一个 HyperLogLog |","table":"table-9"},"7586":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-201","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-6","content":"**扩展**:\n① UV：Unique View（独立访客），需要去重\n② PV：Page View（页面浏览量），不需要去重\n③ DAU：Daily Active User（日活跃用户量）\n④ MAU：Monthly Active User（月活跃用户量）"},"7587":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-202","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#地理空间geo","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Redis GEO 主要用于存储地理位置信息，并对存储的信息进行操作。"},"7588":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-203","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令       | 描述        |\n| -------- | --------- |\n| `GEOADD` | 添加地理位置的坐标 |","table":"table-10"},"7589":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-204","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令       | 描述        |\n| -------- | --------- |\n| `GEOPOS` | 获取地理位置的坐标 |","table":"table-10"},"7590":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-205","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令        | 描述          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| `GEODIST` | 计算两个位置之间的距离 |","table":"table-10"},"7591":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-206","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令          | 描述                          |\n| ----------- | --------------------------- |\n| `GEORADIUS` | 根据用户给定的经纬度坐标来获取指定范围内的地理位置集合 |","table":"table-10"},"7592":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-207","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令                  | 描述                             |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `GEORADIUSBYMEMBER` | 根据储存在位置集合里面的某个地点获取指定范围内的地理位置集合 |","table":"table-10"},"7593":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-208","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"| 命令        | 描述                     |\n| --------- | ---------------------- |\n| `GEOHASH` | 返回一个或多个位置对象的 geohash 值 |","table":"table-10"},"7594":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-209","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#汇总-7","content":"> 中文乱码解决：`redis-cli --raw`"},"7595":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types-210","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/data_types#应用场景-3","content":"例如：打车软件，附近的网约车；地图上附近的核酸点......"},"7596":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","type":"page","content":"概览","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","Redis"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis"},"7597":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis#目录","content":"目录"},"7598":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis#视频学习","content":"视频学习"},"7599":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis#目录","content":"<Card title=\"安装配置\" href=\"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config\" description=\"Redis安装配置\" />"},"7600":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis#目录","content":"<Card title=\"数据类型\" href=\"/docs/backend/redis/data_types\" description=\"数据类型\" />"},"7601":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis#视频学习","content":"<Card title=\"Redis 7 教程\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV13R4y1v7sP\" description=\"此笔记学习视频(尚硅谷)\" external />"},"7602":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"page","content":"安装配置","breadcrumbs":["主页","后端","Redis"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config"},"7603":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-0","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-数据库","content":"Redis 数据库"},"7604":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-1","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-应用场景","content":"Redis 应用场景"},"7605":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-2","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#先决条件","content":"先决条件"},"7606":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-3","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#安装","content":"安装"},"7607":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-4","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis","content":"启动与停止 Redis"},"7608":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-5","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis后台启动方式","content":"启动与停止 Redis(后台启动方式)"},"7609":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-6","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#连接-redis","content":"连接 Redis"},"7610":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-7","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#关闭","content":"关闭"},"7611":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-8","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#配置文件","content":"配置文件"},"7612":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-9","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#基本配置","content":"基本配置"},"7613":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-10","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#日志配置","content":"日志配置"},"7614":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-11","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#持久化配置","content":"持久化配置"},"7615":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-12","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#容量配置","content":"容量配置"},"7616":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-13","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#多机配置","content":"多机配置"},"7617":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-14","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#卸载","content":"卸载"},"7618":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-15","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","content":"&#8195;&#8195;笔者处于学习阶段，使用的系统为 M1 的 macOS，故参考使用 Homebrew 在本地安装 Redis。安装参考地址：https://redis.io/docs/getting-started/installation/install-redis-on-mac-os/，在这里你也可以找到自己系统的安装方式，或者你也可以从其它地方学习如何安装。"},"7619":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-16","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-数据库","content":"Redis 是一种基于内存的数据库技术。底层采用 C 语言开发，默认端口号 6379。"},"7620":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-17","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-数据库","content":"① Redis 数据库作为数据缓存，将业务数据直接存储在内存中进行读写，单机读/写速度可达 110000/84000 QPS，可以满足高速响应的需求。\n② Redis 数据库只负责存储数据，数据之间不具有任何关联，易于扩容和伸缩。"},"7621":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-18","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-应用场景","content":"受限于内存的高昂成本，一般我们只使用 Redis 存储高频读写的关键数据。比如："},"7622":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-19","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-应用场景","content":"**热点数据**：如热点商品信息。\n**任务队列**：如秒杀队列、抢购队列。\n**实时更新信息**：如商品排行榜、公交到站信息。\n**时效性信息**：如手机验证码、session 、 心跳(heartbeat)。"},"7623":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-20","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#redis-应用场景","content":"> Redis 主要适用于内部系统的高频数据。在线上环境负载极大的情况下，使用 Redis 也不足以满足对数据读写的速度要求。"},"7624":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-21","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#先决条件","content":"&#8195;&#8195;确保你的 macOS 安装了 Homebrew。在终端中输入`brew --version`执行，正常会返回版本信息，如果没有你需要先安装 Homebrew。"},"7625":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-22","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#安装","content":"&#8195;&#8195;在终端中执行`brew install redis`将会在你的系统上进行 Redis 的安装。"},"7626":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-23","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis","content":"&#8195;&#8195;验证 Redis 的安装，你可以在终端输入命令行`redis-server`。如果成功你将看到 Redis 的启动日志(**如下图**)，并且 Redis 将在前台运行。如果需要停止，你可以输入Control+C"},"7627":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-24","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis","content":"> ```sh :no-line-numbers\n> redis-server                            # 启动 Redis 数据库\n> redis-server --port 6380                # 启动 Redis 数据库，在指定端口\n> redis-server redis-6379.conf            # 启动 Redis 数据库，使用指定配置文件\n> ```"},"7628":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-25","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis后台启动方式","content":"&#8195;&#8195;作为在前台运行 Redis 的替代方案，也可以使用 launchd 在后台启动进程。"},"7629":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-26","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#启动与停止-redis后台启动方式","content":"**终端命令执行演示**："},"7630":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#连接-redis","content":"输入`redis-cli`连接到本机的 Redis，再打开的客户端中，尝试输入一些命令"},"7631":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#连接-redis","content":"**连接 Redis**："},"7632":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#连接-redis","content":"> ```sh :no-line-numbers\n> redis-cli                 # 进入 Redis 控制台，在默认端口\n> redis-cli -p 6380         # 进入 Redis 控制台，在指定端口\n> ```"},"7633":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#关闭","content":"> 注意：完整的格式：`redis-cli -h 127.0.0.1 -p 6379`"},"7634":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#配置文件","content":"&#8195;&#8195;终端输入命令行`brew list redis`可以得到 Redis 的安装路径，查看`homebrew.mxcl.redis.plist`文件信息，可以获取 redis.conf 配置文件的路径。"},"7635":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#基本配置","content":"**重要参数说明**："},"7636":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#基本配置","content":"> 上面的配置启动 Redis 数据库时默认加载；若修改配置文件，需要重启！"},"7637":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#日志配置","content":"&#8195;&#8195;Redis 总共支持四个日志级别：debug / verbose / notice / warning ，从前往后日志记录信息逐渐减少。通常情况下开发环境设为 verbose ，生产环境设为 notice 。"},"7638":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#持久化配置","content":"默认使用 RDB 方式持久化数据，相关配置如下："},"7639":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#持久化配置","content":"可以在配置文件中改用 AOF 方式持久化数据，刷新文件条件有三种类型： always / everysec / no"},"7640":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#容量配置","content":"对 Redis 数据库占用空间和客户链接做出限制。"},"7641":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#多机配置","content":"如果我们要设置集群，则需要进行以下配置："},"7642":{"id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/redis/install_and_config#多机配置","content":"如果我们要设置主从服务器，则需要进行以下配置："},"7643":{"id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex","page_id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex","type":"page","content":"Flex 弹性盒子","breadcrumbs":["主页","前端","CSS"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/frontend/css/flex"},"7644":{"id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex-0","page_id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/frontend/css/flex#概述","content":"概述"},"7645":{"id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex-1","page_id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/frontend/css/flex#flex-布局是什么","content":"Flex 布局是什么"},"7646":{"id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex-2","page_id":"/docs/frontend/css/flex","typ