":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型     | 例子             | 描述    |\n| ------ | -------------- | ----- |\n| string | 'Hi'，\"Hi\"，\\`h` | 任意字符串 |","table":"table-0"},"7667":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-7","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型      | 例子         | 描述  |\n| ------- | ---------- | --- |\n| boolean | true，false | 布尔值 |","table":"table-0"},"7668":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-8","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型     | 例子  | 描述             |\n| ------ | --- | -------------- |\n| 字面量`①` | 其本身 | 限制变量的值就是该字面量的值 |","table":"table-0"},"7669":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-9","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型  | 例子  | 描述          |\n| --- | --- | ----------- |\n| any | \\*  | 任意类型（不建议使用） |","table":"table-0"},"7670":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-10","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型         | 例子  | 描述        |\n| ---------- | --- | --------- |\n| unknown`②` | \\*  | 类型安全的 any |","table":"table-0"},"7671":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-11","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型   | 例子            | 描述               |\n| ---- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| viod | 空值（undefined） | 没有值（或 undefined） |","table":"table-0"},"7672":{"id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type-12","page_id":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/typescript/base_type#类型","content":"| 类型       | 例子  | 描述             |\n| -------- | --- | -----------