ack)`(全局过滤器) 或 `new Vue { filters:{} }`(局部过滤器)"},"7924":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-183","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#过滤器","content":"(2)使用过滤器：`{{ xxx | 过滤器名}}` 或 `v-bind:属性 = \"xxx | 过滤器名\"`"},"7925":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-184","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#过滤器","content":"① 过滤器也可以接受额外参数、多个过滤器也可以串联  \n② 并没有改变原本的数据，是产生新的对应的数据"},"7926":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-185","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#过滤器","content":"示例代码"},"7927":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-186","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#内置及自定义指令","content":"**回顾**："},"7928":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-187","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#内置及自定义指令","content":"| 指令     | 功能                   |\n| ------ | -------------------- |\n| v-bind | 单向绑定解析表达式，可简写为`:xxx` |","table":"table-1"},"7929":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-188","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#内置及自定义指令","content":"| 指令      | 功能     |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| v-model | 双向数据绑定 |","table":"table-1"},"7930":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-189","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#内置及自定义指令","content":"| 指令    | 功能          |\n| ----- | ----------- |\n| v-for | 遍历数组、对象、字符串 |","table":"table-1"},"7931":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-190","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#内置及自定义指令","content":"| 指令   | 功能             |\n| ---- | -------------- |\n| v-on | 绑定事件监听，可简写为`@` |","table":"table-1"},"7932":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-191","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[