vue/base_vue-199","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#v-once-指令","content":"> ① `v-once`所在节点在初次动态渲染后，就视为静态内容了\n>\n> ② 以后数据的改变不会引起`v-once`所在结构的更新，可以用于优化性能"},"7941":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-200","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#v-pre-指令","content":"> ① 跳过 v-pre 所在节点的编译过程\n>\n> ② 可利用它跳过：没有使用指令语法、没有使用插值语法的节点，会加快编译"},"7942":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-201","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"**定义语法**："},"7943":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-202","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"（1）局部指令"},"7944":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-203","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"（2）全局指令"},"7945":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-204","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"`bind(element, binding)`：指令与元素成功绑定时调用"},"7946":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-205","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"`inserted(element, binding)`：指令所在元素被插入页面时调用"},"7947":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-206","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"`update(element, binding)`：指令所在模板结构被重新解析时调用"},"7948":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-207","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"注意："},"7949":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-208","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"（1）指令定义时不加`v-`，但使用时要加`v-`"},"7950":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-209","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"（2）指令名如果是多个单词，要使用 kebab-case 命名方式，不要用 camelCase 命名"},"7951":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-210","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#自定义指令","content":"示例代码"},"7952":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-211","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"&#8195;&#8195;生命周期又称生命周期回调函数、生命周期函数、生命周期钩子，它是 Vue 在关键时刻帮我们调用的一些特殊名称的函数；生命周期函数的名字不可更改，但函数的具体内容是程序员根据需求编写的，生命周期函数中的 this 指向是vm或组件实例对象。"},"7953":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-212","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"**常用的生命周期钩子**："},"7954":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-213","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"`mounted`:发送 ajax 请求、启动定时器、绑定自定义事件、订阅消息等[初始化操作]"},"7955":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-214","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"`beforeDestroy`:清除定时器、解绑自定义事件、取消订阅消息等[收尾工作]"},"7956":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-215","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"**关于销毁 Vue 实例**："},"7957":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-216","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"（1）销毁后借助 Vue 开发者工具看不到任何信息"},"7958":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-217","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue#生命周期","content":"（2）销毁后自定义事件会失效，但原生 DOM 事件依然有效（vue 从 2.7.0 版本以后，执行 this.$distory()后发现原生 DOM 失效，点击控制台无响应）"},"7959":{"id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue-218","page_id":"/docs/frontend/vue/base_vue","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs