docs/others/pve#pve-镜像下载","content":"&#8195;&#8195;本次使用的 PVE 镜像为最新的 8.0，下载地址：Proxmox VE 8.0-2"},"8829":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-7","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#制作-pve-的-u-盘启动盘","content":"① 准备一个容量大于 2GB 的 U 盘，并对其进行格式化"},"8830":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-8","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#制作-pve-的-u-盘启动盘","content":"② 打开烧录工具 balenaEtcher"},"8831":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-9","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#制作-pve-的-u-盘启动盘","content":"③ 选择镜像 → 选择烧录的 U 盘 → 开始烧录"},"8832":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-10","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#开启主机虚拟化功能","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;开启**虚拟化**功能的作用是让 CPU 的虚拟化技术能应用在 PVE 系统上，其实在 intel 4 代 CPU 后基本上都支持该技术，特别老的可能不支持，请根据自己的硬件进行判别。另外一点是**硬件直通**功能，也是需要硬件支持的。"},"8833":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-11","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#开启主机虚拟化功能","content":"① 主机关机的情况下插入 U 盘，接着开机，进入 BIOS 设置界面，一般就是开机过程中连续按 Delete 键，每个电脑主板可能不同，视情况而定；"},"8834":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-12","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#开启主机虚拟化功能","content":"② 进入 BIOS 后， 进入`Advanced`选项，找到 CPU 相关的内容，将虚拟化和硬件直通打开选择`Enabled`使能；"},"8835":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-13","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#开启主机虚拟化功能","content":"③ 更改启动项"},"8836":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-14","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#开启主机虚拟化功能","content":"> &#8195;&#8195;Mac 系统制作 U 盘启动盘不建议在虚拟机里操作，制作出来的启动盘可能存在问题。如果你是 Win 系统可以使用 balenaEtcher 或者 UltraISO，建议使用前者，它支持 Win 和 Mac 并且操作更简单！"},"8837":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-15","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"> 注意：此时启动主机时，需要保持插入 U 盘，并且主机 HDMI 接显示器。"},"8838":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-16","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"① 选择 `Install Proxmox VE (Graphical)` ，使用图形化的方式安装；"},"8839":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-17","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"② 选择安装的硬盘，点击`Options`可设置大小(hsize = 64)；"},"8840":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-18","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"③ 本地时区选择，`Country → China`、`Time zone → Asia/Shanghai`、`Keyboard Layout → U.S. English`；"},"8841":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-19","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"④ 设置密码和邮箱地址，邮箱地址可以随便设置，但是格式得对；"},"8842":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-20","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"⑤ 网络配置"},"8843":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-21","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"> 笔者是将此当做是旁路由使用，所以下面配置仅供参考：\n>\n> |配置项|参数|备注|\n> |--|--|--|\n> |Management Interface|enp2s0|网卡选择，视自己情况而定|\n> |Hostname(FQDN)|pve\\.me|按格式随意|\n> |IP Address|192.168.8.187/24|主路由下闲置的 IP|\n> |Gateway|192.168.8.1|网关，主路由|\n> |DNS Server|192.168.8.1|DNS 服务器，主路由|"},"8844":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-22","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"⑥ 确认配置开始安装，当安装完毕，界面显示如下内容，说明安装完成"},"8845":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-23","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"> web 访问的地址就是前面网络配置分配的 IP 地址，注意是 **https**"},"8846":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-24","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"⑦ web 管理界面"},"8847":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-25","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#安装-pve-系统","content":"&#8195;&#8195;此时给主机相应网口接上网线，使用任意同一局域网的设备，浏览器输入 web 管理地址，并输入用户名和密码，登录后如下，此后我们的所有管理操作都是再此进行。"},"8848":{"id":"/docs/others/pve-26","page_id":"/docs/others/pve","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/others/pve#pve-一键优化脚